<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Luyana Bible Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Eliywi Okwamana ni LUKA</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lk</para>
  <para style="imt2">Eliywi okukumanena ni</para>
  <para style="imt1">LUKA</para>
  <para style="imt">Okulimukisa</para>
  <para style="ip">Eliywi okukumanena kwa Luka ni injili no tibuka tinee na mu Tesitamende no Ubya eto ti toloka omuyoyelo wa Jesu Kilesite. Einjili ni injili ku tibuka eti kame tiisaniwa nji, “Ebangeli” okutalusa nji “Eliywi no kuwaba”. Kame tina kun̄oliwa munyima no kufa kwa Jesu kwa Mateu, Maleka, Luka mane ni Jodani. Luka kasi kun̄ola engambolo no muyoyelo wa Jesu fela, kono kame nakung’ola kame einu eyo ana kutenda aiyetwa a Jesu munyima no lifu lyaye mane ni kwinguka kwaye, ebuka iisaniwa nji Etikezo no Atumiwa. Kakwisa woyo olimukile enako luli eyo lina kun̄oliwa Eliywi okukumanena ni Luka simba oko ina kun̄oleliwa, kono asi kukwiyeta no kupula kame apuena nji mwendi kame ina kun̄oliwa mu myaka makumi atanu na yiili munyima no kuleiwa kwa Kilesite</para>
  <para style="ip">Omun̄oli ni Luka, woyo neli mubangi mu sipatela. Omun̄olelo waye kame omonisa nji wuyu munu neli omulume osi kukwiyeta. Luka kame ana kusinga okun̄ola wino etoloko no kukonda eyi no mooyo wa Jesu okwamba omo ina kutendahalela einu, abo nji cwale anjili awanebo etuso aba aibala. (1.1-3). Neli kasa mu Juda (Makolose 4.10-14) mi kame ana kun̄ola mundila itendile nji kakwisa simba omunu no Mujuda mumweya woyo otwesa okuyupisisa. Esi kame simonahala luli mu mukwa owo atolokelamo esizo no Majuda (1:8).</para>
  <para style="ip">Eliywi okukumanena ni luka kame ikufekile onene ni buka ya Mateu ni Maleka, kakuli kame titoloka einu ikufekile ni mundila no kukufeka. Mukaci no tibuka tin̄atu, Luka kame aba elin̄usa mu kwiiyala okukumanena ni kuleiwa kwa Jowani Mukolobezi. Luka kame aiyateteta eyi no kulemena kame (etikauhanyo no 3.3; 11:4; 17.3-4; 23.34; 24:47) mane ni tapelo (3:21; 5:16; 6:12; 11.1-12; 22:32).</para>
  <para style="iot">Emitwi no Titaba</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Mu kauhanyo no 1.1-4; Luka kame alimukisa eliywi lyaye mane ni kutoloka eso ana li n̄olela.</para>
  <para style="io1">Okutunda abo kame atoloka okuleiwa kwa Jesu mane nomo ana kukutukiseta okwendisa esitulo simba ekeleke (1:5; 4:13)</para>
  <para style="io1">Abo ekalulo no kuneneba yonje no liywi no kuwaba (4.14-21:38), Luka kame amba eino musebezi owo ana kutenda Jesu, onene etimakazo ana kutenda mane neyi ano kwiyeta.</para>
  <para style="io1">Ku mamaneneno, mu tikauhanyo timbili no mamaneneno (22-24), kame atoloka omo ana kufela Jesu, naku teuliwa, mane nakwinguka kwaafu.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1"/>
  <para style="s">Amaywi no Matatekelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1"/>Kanyi aka no kupula,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:1">Aanu no kupula naeteke okun̄ola etitaba no inu eyi inaku tendahala mukaci ketu. <verse eid="LUK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2"/>Kanyi omo ana kutwambelela awo ana kwikalanga kumatatekelo ana kwimona mi aambi no liywi.<verse eid="LUK 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3"/>Kame imonahala wino kwa mene muku kon̄a einu wino mu nako ina kubwa, okun̄ola eliywi kwa wene no kutompeha Teufilasi. <verse eid="LUK 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4"/>Nji cwale olimuke ouniti okukumanena ni inu ona kwambeliwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okuleiwa kwa Jowani Omukolobezi aba kuna Kulimukisiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5"/>Mu tinako ta Heloda ombumu no Judeya, kame kuna kwikalanga omupulisita no litina lya Zakaliya, woyo noikalanga mu sikwata no mupulisita no Abija. Mukataye neli osilusika lwa Aloni, mi elitina lyaye neli Elizabeta. <verse eid="LUK 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6"/>Onje neli ano kuluka balubala lwa Nyambe, okuyoya oku nambulwa okunyazahala okukumanena ku titaelo tonje ni milawo ya Mbumu. <verse eid="LUK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7"/>Kono kasi kwikalanga ni mwana kakuli Elizabeta neli muumba, mi onje naku kulubala.<verse eid="LUK 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8"/>Cwale yo sebeza kanyi mupulisata balubala lwa Nyambe abo esikwata saye esili ba nako no kusebeza. <verse eid="LUK 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9"/>Okukumanena ku sizo no upulisita, kame ana kuketiwa okwingena mu keleke ya Mbumu okacin̄a eisense. <verse eid="LUK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10"/>Cwale aanu no kupula kame ana kulapelelanga bandee ba nako no kucin̄a einsense.<verse eid="LUK 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11"/>Ababo cwale sebeli kumonahala kwa yonyene elingeloi lya Nyambe, eli imanine ku silyo no aletale no insense. <verse eid="LUK 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12"/>Cwale Zakaliya kame ana kuziyeleha aba ana kumona elingeloi, sebeli okucila. <verse eid="LUK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13"/>Kono elingeloi sebeli lyamba kwa yonyene nji, “Olese kucila Zakaliya! Kakuli etapelo yowe naiyupiwa, mi mukatowe Elizabeta mbaku leyele omwana no ndumbana mi mbomu tumbu elitina lya Jowani. <verse eid="LUK 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14"/>Mi mbu wabelelwa nuukutumela mi ano kupula mba wabelelwe ba kuleiwa kwaye! <verse eid="LUK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15"/>Kakuli mbatende woyo no kuneneba balubala lwa Mbumu. Mi katamba okunwa ewaine simba amalopu cwale mba iyala ni Mebo No Kukena simba okutunda mu lipumo lya inawaye. <verse eid="LUK 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16"/>Mi mba usu aanu no kupula no Isilaele kwa Mbumu Nyambe woo, <verse eid="LUK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17"/>mi mbati balubala lwaye mu mebo ni maata a Eliya okuusa emicima no ashemi kwaana ni awo nambulwa okukon̄a okushangama no kuluka, oku baakanya aanu ana kulukisetwa kwa Mbumu .”<verse eid="LUK 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18"/>Zakaliya sebeli wamba ku lingeloi nji, “Ngasibine sani limuke eyi? Kakuli mene nakulubala kale ni mukatange nakulubala ku myaka.”<verse eid="LUK 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19"/>Elingeloi sebeli limutambula nji, “Time Gabiliyele woyo oimanine mu sibaka sa Nyambe mi kame nina tumiwa okwamba kwa wene mane nuukulitela amaywi no kuwaba. <verse eid="LUK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20"/>Cwale komone, kame sondoke ni kuulwa okwamba okutwala ba liywaa elyo aba saiyele einu eyi. Kakuli kawasi pumena amaywi ange awo saiyatetetwe mu nako yawo.”<verse eid="LUK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21"/>Cwale aanu sebeli atatelela Zakaliya ni kukomoka okuliyeha kwaye mu keleke. <verse eid="LUK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22"/>Cwale aba ana kubanena bandee kasi kutwesa okwamba kwa onyene, mi sebeli anahana nji namono epono mu keleke. Zakaiya sebeli wamba noo mu kuyuleka yooli esimumu.<verse eid="LUK 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23"/>Cwale Zakaliya enako yaye no kusebeza aba ina kubwa, sebeli ota ku ndoo yaye. <verse eid="LUK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24"/>Munyima no maywaa awo mukataye Elizabeta sebeli oimana mu mundi (oukushimba) mi sebeli okushweeka mu ndoo ba tikweti no kukwana titanu ni kwamba nji, <verse eid="LUK 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25"/>“Eyi yokame ana tende Nyambe kwa mene mu maywaa ona likete, okutundisa elikenyi lyange mukaci no aanu!”<verse eid="LUK 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okulimukisiwa no Kuleiwa kwa Jesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26"/>Mukweti no utanu ni kamweya elingeloi Gabiliyele sebeli litumiwa okutunda kwa Nyambe okuta ku mulenen̄i wisaniwa nji Nazaleta. <verse eid="LUK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27"/>Kwa mukatana no naluleya woyo ona kubeleziwa ku mulume oisaniwa Josefa, no lusika lwa Dabida. Woyo naluleya elitina lyaye neli Maliya. <verse eid="LUK 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28"/>Mi selbeli oiya kwa yonyene ni kwamba nji, “Olumele, wene no kufuyaulwa! Nyambe kame ali ni wene!”<verse eid="LUK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29"/>Kono kame ana komokisiwa ku maywi aye ni kumakala kumukwa no kuketiwa kwaye. <verse eid="LUK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30"/>Cwale Elingeloi sebeli lyamba kwa yonyene nji, “Olese kucila, Maliya, kakuli nuwana omuhau kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="LUK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31"/>Cwale komone kame sokushimbe mu lipumo lyowe ni kuleya omwana no ndumbana, mi mbumu tumbu elitina lya Jesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32"/>Mba tende wuyu no kuneneba mi mba isaniwa Omwana a Nyambe OMWAMBAKANI onene mane Ombumu Nyambe mba mubi olubona lwa nyakulyaye Dabida, <verse eid="LUK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33"/>mba busu endoo ya Jakobo okuta oku no kwaabwa mane ni mubuso waye no kwaabwa!”<verse eid="LUK 1:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34"/>Maliya sebeli oibanguta elingeloi nji, “Ngasibine saitendahale eyi kakuli mene silimukile omulume?”<verse eid="LUK 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35"/>Elingeloi sebeli lyamba kwa yonyene nji, “Emebo No Kukena mba iiyi kwa wene, mi amaata a Nyambe OMWAMBAKANI mba kufuku. Cwale abo omwana woyo soleiwa mba isaniwa nji wa kukena Omwana Nyambe. <verse eid="LUK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36"/>Cwale komone, mwabowe Elizabeta mu nako yaye no ku kulubala naku shimbi omwana no ndumbana, mi okweti uno sebeli ou no utanu ni kamweya, woyo ona kutoiwa nji muumba. <verse eid="LUK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37"/>Kakuli kwa Nyambe kakwisa esi sikwangwiwa”<verse eid="LUK 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38"/>Cwale Maliya sebeli wamba nji, “Komone, mene uno, omubika wa Mbumu, “sitendiwe kwa mene okukumanena ni maywi owe.” Cwale elingeloi sebeli limusiya.<verse eid="LUK 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Maliya yo Potela Elizabeta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39"/>Mu maywaa awo Maliya sebeli okutukiseta okuta mu naha no malundu mu mulenen̄i no Judeya. <verse eid="LUK 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40"/>Cwale sebeli okaingena mu ndoo ya Zakaliya niku keeta Elizabeta. <verse eid="LUK 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41"/>Cwale Elizabeta aba ana kuyupa okukeetiwa kwa Maliya, omwana sebeli weenda mu lipumo. Mi Elizabeta sebeli oiyala Emebo No Kukena <verse eid="LUK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42"/>mi sebeli okuweleza ni liywi no kuneneba nji, “Nufuyolwa mukaci no akati onje, mi embuyoti nimbuya no lipumo lyowe. <verse eid="LUK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43"/>Mi iikene eyi aba ina tendahala kwa mene, nji inawaye Mbumu wange aiye kwa mene? <verse eid="LUK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44"/>Kakuli komone, abo eliywi lyowe no kuni keeta aba lina keela mu litwi lyange, ababo omwana oli mu lipumo lyange sebeli weenda mulibaka no kuwabelelwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45"/>Cwale embuyoti niya woyo opumena nji mba kwiyatetwe eso sina kwambiwa kwa yonyene okutunda kwa Mbumu.”<verse eid="LUK 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Olusimo lwa Maliya no Milumbeko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46"/>Mi Maliya sebeli wamba nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">“Emebo yange kame ilumbeka Ombumu,<verse eid="LUK 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47"/>mi emebo yange kame iwabelelwa mwa Nyambe omuyoyisi wange,<verse eid="LUK 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48"/>kakuli nalikete oukushuwa no mubika waye!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Komumone okutunda bano amasika onje mbani isana nji wuyu no kufuyolwa,<verse eid="LUK 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49"/>kakuli wuyu no kuneneba Nyambe nani tendele esinu sinene.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:49">Mi okukena lyokame elitina lyaye,<verse eid="LUK 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50"/>cwale amakeke aye kame ali kwaawo amucila</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:50">okutunda ku lusika okuta ku lusika.<verse eid="LUK 1:50"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51"/>Namonisa amaata ni lyoko lyaye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">nahasanya oukuyeema koo mu mihupulo no micima yoo.<verse eid="LUK 1:51"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52"/>Natulula ano kuneneba ba mabona oo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:52">mi natuleke awo no ukushuwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:52"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53"/>Naiyata ano kuyomba ni inu no kuwaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:53">ni kucita asikufuma oku nambulwa simweya.<verse eid="LUK 1:53"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54"/>Natusu omubika waye Isilaele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:54">mu kupuluka amakeke aye.<verse eid="LUK 1:54"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55"/>Kanyi aba ana kwamba kwa njekulyetu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:55">kwa Abulahama ni ku masika aye okuta oku no kwabwa.”<verse eid="LUK 1:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56"/>Cwale Maliya aba ana kusiyalelwa etikweti tin̄atu sebeli ouka ku mundi waye.<verse eid="LUK 1:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okuleiwa kwa Jowani Omukolobezi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57"/>Cwale enako sebeli ikeela eyi no kuleya kwa Elizabeta, mane sebeli oleya omwana no ndumbana. <verse eid="LUK 1:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58"/>Cwale awo ayakile noo ku nyonga nabaaye aba ana kuyupa Ombumu namonisa amakeke no kuneneba kwa yonyene, sebeli awabelelwa naye.<verse eid="LUK 1:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59"/>Cwale ba liywaa no mutanu ni twaatu sebeli atwala olukeke ku mupato, mi kame ana kusinga nji amutumbe Zakaliya elitina lya sitaye. <verse eid="LUK 1:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60"/>Kono inawaye sebeli wamba nji, “Kokuulwa! mbaisaniwa nji Jowani.”<verse eid="LUK 1:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61"/>Cwale sebeli aamba kwa yonyene nji, “Kakwisa kwasi mukowa wowe oisaniwa ni litina eli!” <verse eid="LUK 1:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62"/>Cwale sebeli ambela sitaye ni tiponiso, nji aasimwete elitina elyo asinga okubeeka mwanaye.<verse eid="LUK 1:62"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63"/>Zakaliya sebeli okumbela akabala ni ku n̄olabo nji, “Elitina lyaye ni Jowani.” Mi onje sebeli akomoka! <verse eid="LUK 1:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64"/>Cwale ababo akanwa kaye sebeli kayatuluka ni lulimi lwaye sebeli lunungutuka, ni kwamba, oku lumbeka Nyambe. <verse eid="LUK 1:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65"/>Cwale awo onje ayakile amabapa noo sebeli alemiwa okucila, mi etaba eyo sebeli ihasana mu naha yonje no malundu no Judeya. <verse eid="LUK 1:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66"/>Cwale onje awo ana kwiyupa sebeli aiteula mu micima yoo ni kwamba nji, “Cwale uyu mwanukana kame sa kule oku tenda anyine?” Kakuli elyoko lya Mbumu kame lina kwikala ni yonyene.<verse eid="LUK 1:66"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ounuhi wa Zakaliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67"/>Cwale Zakaliya sitaye sebeli oiyala ni Mebo No Kukena, ni kunuha okwamba nji,<verse eid="LUK 1:67"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68"/>“Ku lumbiwe Ombumu Nyambe no Isilaele!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">Kakuli na poto ni ku liulula aanu aye.<verse eid="LUK 1:68"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69"/>Mi na tulitele omuyoyisi no maata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:69">mu ndoo ya mubika waye Dabida.<verse eid="LUK 1:69"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70"/>Kanyi omo ana kwambela ni tunwa no anuhi aye no kukena oku tunda ku kale<verse eid="LUK 1:70"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71"/>nji kame sa tuyoyisiwe ku ila yetu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:71">ni mu maoko no awo atu timbile.<verse eid="LUK 1:71"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72"/>Oku monisa amakeke ana kusepisiwa kwa anjekulyetu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72">ni ku puluka oulikani waye no kukena<verse eid="LUK 1:72"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73"/>oluci ana kweeta kwa sitetu Abulahama<verse eid="LUK 1:73"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74"/>na ku tusepisa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:74">nji aba tuna mana oku lamulelwa mu maoko no iila yetu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:74">tu mu sebeleze mu kwaacila,<verse eid="LUK 1:74"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75"/>me tuli ano kukena ni kuluka balubala lwaye amaywaa onje no mooyo wetu.<verse eid="LUK 1:75"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76"/>Cale weene, olukeke, kame soisaniwe nji omunuhi wa Nyambe OMWAMBAKANI</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">kakuli kame sote balubala lwa Mbumu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">okalukisa endila yaye,<verse eid="LUK 1:76"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77"/>okuba ezibo no kuyoya kwaanu aye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:77">mu ku lemenwa eibi yoo,<verse eid="LUK 1:77"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78"/>mulibaka no mukekecima wa Nyambe wetu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:78">abo eliywaa aba saliiye beulu yetu okutunda ku wilu<verse eid="LUK 1:78"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79"/>okuba eliseli kwawo ali mu uwi ni mu mwiinda no lifu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">oku simweta amakondo etu mu ndila no kozo.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80"/>Cwale omwana sebeli okula ni koongola mu Mebo, mi kame ana kwikala mu lihalaupa okutwala ba liywaa elyo ana kumonahala mu Isilaele.<verse eid="LUK 1:80"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2"/>
  <para style="s">Oku Leiwa kwa Jesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1"/>Mu tinako tiya sebeli kwiiya etaelo ya Sesale Augasitasi nji elitunga lyonje kutendiwe esipalo. <verse eid="LUK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2"/>Esi neli esipalo no weli, abo Kuiliniyasi yoli omubusisi no Siliya. <verse eid="LUK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3"/>Cwale onje sebeli ata okan̄oliwa, omunu ni munu mu mulenen̄i waye.<verse eid="LUK 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4"/>Josefa ni yonyene sebeli otunda mu Galileya, omulenen̄i na mu Nazaleta okuta ku Judeya, omulenen̄i wa Dabida ona kwiisanwa nji Betelehema, kakuli neli osindoo ni lusika lwa Dabida. <verse eid="LUK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5"/>Sebeli oka n̄oliwa ni Maliya, woyo ana ku beeleza, woyo ona kwimananga mu mundi <verse eid="LUK 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6"/>mi asili omo, enako yaye no kuleya sebeli ikeela. <verse eid="LUK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7"/>Cwale sebeli oleya mwanaye no mweeli, ni ku mufuka eikumango no ukeke niku mu langeka mu silyelo, kakuli naku kuulwa esibaka soo mu ndoo no angenda.<verse eid="LUK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Alisana ni Mangeloi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8"/>Cwale mu sibaka omo kame kuna kwikala alisana mu matema oo, ana ku tonenanga emilaka no mitapi yoo ousiku. <verse eid="LUK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9"/>Cwale elingeloi lya Mbumu sebeli liku monahaza kwa onyene, mi ekanya ya Mbumu sebeli yabeeka mukaci, mane sebeli acila onene, <verse eid="LUK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10"/>kono elingeloi sebeli lyaamba kwa onyene nji, “Mulese kucila! kakuli komumone, kame nina militele eliywi no kuwaba eyo salilite oku wabelelwa no kuneneba oko sakwiiye kwaanu onje. <verse eid="LUK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11"/>Balelo na mu leyelwe Omuyoyisi mu mulenen̄i wa Dabida, yokame Kilesite Ombumu. <verse eid="LUK 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12"/>Cwale eso sasitende esisupo kwaanyi sino, mba mukawana olukeke ona tingiwa etinyambi mi kame alangekilwe mu silyelo.”<verse eid="LUK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13"/>Cwale ababo sebeli kwiiya empi na ku wilu no kupula, sebeli iiya ni lingeloi, ni kulumbeka Nyambe nji,<verse eid="LUK 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14"/>“Ekanya iikale kwa Nyambe mu mawilu na ku wilu, ni banji</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">ni kozo iikale mu litunga mwaanu awo sa shemubiwe!”<verse eid="LUK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15"/>Cwale amangeloi aba ana kwasiya okuukela ku wilu, alisana sebeli akwambisa omujili ku munjili nji, “Twendeni ku Betelehema tu kamone etaba eyo ineeyi, eyo ana tu simwete Ombumu.”<verse eid="LUK 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16"/>Cwale sebeli atako mu kuleluba, mi sebeli akawana Maliya ni Josefa, ni lukeke ona langekilwe mu silyelo. <verse eid="LUK 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17"/>Cwale aba ana kumana okumona, sebeli ata alimukisa okwamba etaba eyo anambelwe no mwana. <verse eid="LUK 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18"/>Mi onje awo ana kwiyupa, sebeli akomoka etaba eyo ambeliwa kwa alisana. <verse eid="LUK 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19"/>Kono Maliya sebeli oteula eyo inu yonje, ni kwimamela mu mucima waye. <verse eid="LUK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20"/>Cwale alisana sebeli auka alemine okukanyisa ni kulumbeka Nyambe kweyo ana yupu neyo ana mono, kanyi omo ana yambelelwe.<verse eid="LUK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Beekiwa Elitina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21"/>Cwale ku mamaneneno no maywaa atanu naatu, aba ana kubeekiwa ku mupato, sebeli amubeeka elitina lya Jesu, elyo ana ku biwa ku lingeloi yo kasi kushimba kale.<verse eid="LUK 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Litiwa mu Keleke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22"/>Mi cwale enako aba ina kukwana no ku kenisiwa okukumanena ku mulawo wa Mushe, sebeli akambamiseta Jesu ku Jelusalema oka mu monahaza kwa Mbumu, <verse eid="LUK 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23"/>kanyi omo ku n̄olelwe mu mulawo wa Mbumu nji, “Omwana no mweeli yonje kame saisanwe nji wa kukena kwa Mbumu.” <verse eid="LUK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24"/>Cwale sebeli ata okaba esitabelo okukumanena mu mulawo wa Mbumu amakwici ayiili simba otwana no tunkwilimba twiili.<verse eid="LUK 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25"/>Cwale kame kuna kwikalanga omulume mu Jelusalema no litina lya Simoni, mi woyo mulume neli wa kuluka ni kucila Nyambe, yo tatelele omuyoyisi no Isilaele, mi Emebo No Kukena na ikwikala mwa yonyene <verse eid="LUK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26"/>mi kame ana kusepisiwa ku Mebo No Kukena nji katamba oku mona elifu yo kasi mona kale Kilesite Ombumu. <verse eid="LUK 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27"/>Cwale sebeli osusuweziwa ku Mebo okwiiya mu Ndoo ya Nyambe. Mi cwale ashemi aba ana kulita omwana yonyene Jesu, nji ku tendahale kwa yonyene okuta mu sizo no mulawo, <verse eid="LUK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28"/>Simoni sebeli omubeeka mu maoko aye ni ku lumbeka Nyambe nji,<verse eid="LUK 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29"/>“Mbumu, cwale olukulule omubika wowe afunduke mu kozo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">okukumanena ku liywi lyowe,<verse eid="LUK 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30"/>Kakuli amiyo ange na mono oku yoyisa kowe,<verse eid="LUK 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31"/>oko ona lukisa balubala no aanu onje,<verse eid="LUK 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32"/>Eliseli limonisa asimacaba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">ni ku lita ekanya kwaanu owe no Isilaele.”<verse eid="LUK 2:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33"/>Sitaye ni inawaye sebeli okomokisiwa kweyo ana kwambiwa mulibaka lyaye. <verse eid="LUK 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34"/>Cwale Simoni sebeli waafuyola ni kwamba kwa Maliya inawaye nji, “Komone, wuyu mwana na beekelwe okufa ni kuyoya kwano kupula no Isilaele. Aikale kanyi esisupo eso sasi kananiwe <verse eid="LUK 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35"/>mi omukwale mba ukuyaa mu mooyo wowe, nji emihupulo itunda mu micima no kupula imonahale.” <verse eid="LUK 2:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36"/>Cwale kame kuna kwikala omunuhi no mukati no litina lya Anna, omwana Faniwelu no mukatana no lusika lwa Asele. Kame ana ku kulubala onene mi na kuyoya ni mbumwaye emyaka itanu ni yaatu oku tunda ba walanjo waye. <verse eid="LUK 2:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37"/>Yoli ombakati konji aba ana ku keela ba myaka makumi atanu ni aatu ni inee (84). Kasi kutunda mu Ndoo ya Nyambe, oku sebeleza Nyambe, ouku yumena eilya ni kulapela ousiku ni munji. <verse eid="LUK 2:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38"/>Mi sebeli oiya ba nako eyeyo nuukutumela kwa Nyambe ni kwamba ya Jesu kwaanu onje awo ana ku tatelela oku liululwa no Jelusalema.<verse eid="LUK 2:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okuuka ku Nazaleta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39"/>Cwale aba ana kumanenena einu yonje okukumanena ku mulawo wa Mbumu, sebeli aukela mu Galileya ku Nazaleta omulenen̄i woo luli. <verse eid="LUK 2:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40"/>Mi omwana sebeli okula ni koongola, ni kwiiyala okushangama, ni sishemo sa Nyambe kame sina kwikala beulu yaye.<verse eid="LUK 2:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ondumbana Jesu yoli mu Keleke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41"/>Cwale ashemi aye kame ana ku taanga ku Jelusalema mu mwaka ni mwaka ku mukiti no Paseka. <verse eid="LUK 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42"/>Cwale Jesu aba ana ku kwanisa emyaka likumi ni yiili (12) sebeli akambamenako okukumanena ku sizo. <verse eid="LUK 2:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43"/>Cwale omukiti aba ona kubwa sebeli aukela kwaawo, ondumbana Jesu sebeli osiyalela mu Jelusalema. Ashemi aye kasi kulimuka eyo, <verse eid="LUK 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44"/>kono mu kupuluka nji ni yonyene na kwikala mu sikwata, sebeli aenda eliywaa lyonje mi sebeli amu saela kwaboo ni kwawo aku limuka noo. <verse eid="LUK 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45"/>Mi cwale aba ana kuulwa oku mu wana, sebeli aukela ku Jelusalema oka mu saela. <verse eid="LUK 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46"/>Munyima no maywaa aatu, sebeli amuwana mu Ndoo ya Nyambe, yo ikalile mukaci no aiyeti, okwa teeteta ni kwa ibanguta etipuzo. <verse eid="LUK 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47"/>Cwale onje awo ana ku muyupa sebeli akomoka mu ku yupisisa kwaye ni tikalabo taye. <verse eid="LUK 2:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48"/>Cwale aba ana ku mu mona sebeli akomoka onene, mi inawaye sebeli omwibnguta nji, “Mwanange, iikene ona tu tendele ngeeso? Komone, sitowe ni mene kame tu lemine oukusaela kame tu ziyelehile.”<verse eid="LUK 2:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji. “Iikene mu ni saelela? Kamu limukile nji kame ni fanena okwikala mu ndoo ya Sitange?” <verse eid="LUK 2:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50"/>Mi onyene kasi ku yupisisa etaba ana kwamba kwa onyene.<verse eid="LUK 2:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51"/>Cwale sebeli oshetumuka noo ni kwiiya ku Nazaleta, kame anoku kokobeza kwa onyene, cwale inawaye sebeli oteula einu eyi yonje mu mucima waye. <verse eid="LUK 2:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wekeza mu kushangama ni mu kukula, ni mu ku wabelisa Nyambe naanu.<verse eid="LUK 2:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3"/>
  <para style="s">Ekutazo ya Jowani Omukolobezi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mateu3.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maleka1.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Jowani1.19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1"/>Mu mwaka no likumi ni mutanu mu puzo ya Tibele Sesale, Ponse Pilato abo yooli omubusisi no Judeya, Heloda neli omwendisi no Galileya, minaye Filipi yooli omwendisi no naha ya Ituliya ni Tilakonita, mi Lisanyasi neli omwendisi no Abilene, <verse eid="LUK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2"/>mi Annasi ni Kayafasi ali apulisita akulu, eliywi lya Nyambe sebeli liiya kwa Jowani omwana Zakaliya mu lihalaupa. <verse eid="LUK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3"/>Cwale sebeli ota mu naha yonje eyo ikubapile ni Jodani yo kutaza ekolobezo no kubaka nji eibi ilemenwe. <verse eid="LUK 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4"/>Kanyi omo ku n̄olelwe mu buka no maywi a Isaya omunuhi wa Nyambe nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">“Eliywi no munjili kame likuweleza mu lihalaupa eli lyaamba nji,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">mu lukise endila no Mbumu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">mubakenye endila yaye nji yoloke!<verse eid="LUK 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5"/>Omusindi onje mba wiyala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">mi akalundu ni lilundu mbei ulululiwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">mi eyi ibetile mbei oloka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">ni tindila no ku tengama mbati lukisiwa.<verse eid="LUK 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6"/>Mi omunu yonje mba mono okuyoyisa kwa Nyambe!’”<verse eid="LUK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7"/>Cwalehe sebeli wambela aanu no kupula awo ana kwiiya ku kukolobeziwa kwa yonyene nji, “Anyi aana no tinyoka! Anyine ona milemusa okucila okutweba oko kwiiya? <verse eid="LUK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8"/>Mu beeke etimbuya eto tifanena nji na mubaka. Mi mulese oku tangisa okwamba mukaci kenu nji, ‘Sitetu ni Abulahama.” Kakuli kame ni myambela nji Nyambe kame atwesa oku shimba amawee aa okwaatenda aana a Abulahama! <verse eid="LUK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9"/>Simba abano esamu kame si beekilwe ba mibisi no itondo, mi cwale esitondo sonje eso suulwa oku beeka embuya no kuwaba kame sitemiwa ni ku siyumbela mu mulilo.”<verse eid="LUK 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10"/>Cwale enyangela sebeli imwibanguta nji, “Iikene cwale sa tutende?”<verse eid="LUK 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11"/>Jowani sebeli waatambula nji, “Woyo yonje okwite eikumango yiili, aku tabele ni woyo waakwite, ni woyo okwite esilya, atende ngeeso ni yonyene.”<verse eid="LUK 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12"/>Atelisi nonyene sebeli aiiya kwa Jowani mu kukolobeziwa, sebeli amwibanguta nji, “Mwiyeti, iikene sa tutende?”<verse eid="LUK 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13"/>Cwale sebeli waambela nji, “Mulese okutelisa oku bitelela eso mu nalaelelwe.<verse eid="LUK 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14"/>Amasole nonyene sebeli amwibanguta nji, “Cwale aci iikene sa tutende?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:14">Cwale sebeli waambela nji, “Mulese okwitela omunu mu kukandimeka simba oku mubyangula, mi musepe etituwelo tenu.”<verse eid="LUK 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15"/>Aanu atatelele, mi onje kame ano kwibanguta mu micima yoo nji mwendi Jowani yokame Kilesite. <verse eid="LUK 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16"/>Jowani sebeli waatambula onje nji, “Mene, kame ni mikolobeza ni meyi, kono woyo onibita ku maata kame akeile, simba etikwele no tinjangwa taye sitwese okuti nungutula, yonyene kame sa mikobeze ni Mebo No Kukena ni mulilo. <verse eid="LUK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17"/>Enumbi yaye kame ili mu lyoko lyaye, mi kame sa fefule oubeke ba patelo niku ungeka ouloto waya mu sishete, kono omuuku kame sa ucin̄iwe mu mulilo no kwaabwa.”<verse eid="LUK 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18"/>Cwale mu tindila tinjili no kupula, kame ana ku kutaza amaywi no kuwaba kwaanu. <verse eid="LUK 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19"/>Kono Ombumu Heloda, sebeli onyaziwa kwa Jowani mu taba no Helodiyasi omukataa minaye, ni mu inu yonje no kwiiba eyo ana ku tenda. <verse eid="LUK 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20"/>Cwale Heloda sebeli oekeza kweyo yonje no kwiiba mu kwingenyeka Jowani mu tolongo.<verse eid="LUK 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ekolobezo ya Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mateu3.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Maleka1.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21"/>Cwale onje aanu aba ana ku kolobeziwa, ni Jesu ni yonyene sebeli okolobeziwa. Yo lapela, eliwilu sebeli liyatuluka, <verse eid="LUK 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22"/>mi Emebo No Kukena sebeli ishetumuka beulu yaye mu siumbiwa sikufeka kanyi elikwici, mi eliywi sebeli litunda ku wilu eli lyaamba nji, “Yawene mwanange woyo osingiwa, ni kukatelwa.”<verse eid="LUK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Olusika lwa Jesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23"/>Jesu aba ana ku tangisa omusebezi waye yoli ni myaka makumi aatu. Yoli omwana, kanyi omo kuna kutendahalela, nji wa Josefa, omwana Heli, <verse eid="LUK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24"/>omwana Matate, omwana Lebi, omwana Meleki, omwana Janai, omwana Josefa, <verse eid="LUK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25"/>omwana Matatiyasi, omwana Amosi, omwana Nahumi, omwana Eseli, omwana Nagayi, <verse eid="LUK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26"/>omwana Maate, omwana Matatiyasi, omwana Semeini, omwana Joseke, omwana Juda <verse eid="LUK 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27"/>omwana Joanani, omwana Lesa, omwana Zalubabele, omwana Shealutiele, omwana Neli, <verse eid="LUK 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28"/>omwana Meleki, omwana Adi, omwana Kosamu, omwana Elimadamu, omwana Ele, <verse eid="LUK 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29"/>omwana Joshuwa, omwana Eliezele, omwana Julimu, omwana Matate, omwana Libi, <verse eid="LUK 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30"/>omwana Simioni, omwana Juda mwana Josefa, omwana Jonami, omwana Eliyakimi, <verse eid="LUK 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31"/>omwana Meleya, omwana Mena, omwana Matasa, omwana Nasani, omwana Dabida, <verse eid="LUK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32"/>omwana Jese, omwana Obedi, omwana Bowasi, omwana Salumoni, omwana Nashoni, <verse eid="LUK 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33"/>omwana Aminadabi, omwana Adamini, omwana Alini, omwana Heziloni, omwana Pelezi, omwana Juda, <verse eid="LUK 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34"/>omwana Jakobo, omwana Isaka, omwana Abulahama, omwana Tela, omwana Naholi, <verse eid="LUK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35"/>omwana Selugi, omwana Leu, omwana Paleki, omwana Ebele, omwana Shela, <verse eid="LUK 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36"/>omwana Kainani, omwana Alifakasadi, omwana Sema, omwana Nuwe, omwana Lameke, <verse eid="LUK 3:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37"/>omwana Metusela, omwana Enoki, omwana Jalidi, omwana Mahalaele, omwana Kainani <verse eid="LUK 3:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38"/>omwana Enosi, omwana Seta, omwana Adama, omwana Nyambe.<verse eid="LUK 3:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4"/>
  <para style="s">Omuliko wa Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mateu4.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Maleka1.12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1"/>Cwale Jesu aba ana kwiyala Emebo No Kukena, sebeli ouka ku Jodani, mi sebeli otwaliwa ku Mebo ku lihaupa, <verse eid="LUK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2"/>sebeli oka ikalamo mu lihalaupa amaywaa makumi anee, yo etekiwa kwa Diyabulosi. Kasi kulya esilya mu maywaa awo, amaywaa awo aba ana kubwa, sebeli oyomba.<verse eid="LUK 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3"/>Odiyabulozi sebeli wamba kwa Jesu nji, “Nji uli mwana Nyambe, olaele amawee aa nji afutuke esinkwa.” <verse eid="LUK 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli omutambula nji, “Kame ku n̄olilwe nji, ‘Omunu katamba kuyoya ba sinkwa feela.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5"/>Cwale Diyabulozi sebeli omutwala aba kulumbiile niku mumonisa emibuso yonje no litunga mu nako eyeyo. <verse eid="LUK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6"/>Odiyabulozi sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Kwa wene kame sa ni kube amaata onje ni kanya yawo yonje, kakuli yonje eye kame ina ibiwi, mi kame niiba kwa woyo ni singa. <verse eid="LUK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7"/>Nji wene, cwale, kame soni lapele, yonje kame saitende yowe.”<verse eid="LUK 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli omutambula nji, “Kame ku n̄olilwe nji, ‘Olapele Mbumu Nyambe wowe ni ku sebeleza yonyene feela!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9"/>Kame sebeli omutwala mu Jelusalema nuukamu beeka ba monngola no Ndoo ya Nyambe, ni kwamba kwa yonyene nji, “Nji uli Mwana Nyambe, oku kondele banji wenyene okutunda bano, <verse eid="LUK 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10"/>kakuli kame ku n̄olilwe nji, ‘Nyambe mba laele amangeloi aye nji aku sileleze.’ <verse eid="LUK 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11"/>Mi ‘Ba maoko oo mba kwakele nji cwale amakondo owe aulwe oukulemeka ku liwee.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli omutambula nji, “Kame ku n̄olilwe nji, ‘Ku twese okweteka Ombumu Nyambe wowe.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13"/>Cwale Diyabulosi aba ana kumana oku mweteka mu mikwa yonje, sebeli otunda kwa yonyene, oku twala ba nako injili.<verse eid="LUK 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Tateka Omusebezi Waye mu Galileya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mateu4.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Maleka1.14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli oukela ku Galileya mu maata no Mebo, mi elibubo lyaye sebeli lita okakeela mu maneku onje no naha. <verse eid="LUK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15"/>Cwale sebeli oiyeta mu tindoo too no milapelo ni kububekwa ku munu yonje.<verse eid="LUK 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Kaniwa mu Nazaleta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mateu13.53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Maleka6.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16"/>Cwale sebeli oiya mu Nazaleta, omu ana kulitiwa, mi sebeli ota mu ndoo no milapelo kanyi omo ana kwikalela omukwa waye ba liywaa no Pumulo. Sebeli oimana okubala <verse eid="LUK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17"/>mi omo sebeli obiwa ebuka no munuhi Isaya. Yonyene sebeli ofukula ebuka ni kuwana aba ku n̄olilwe nji,<verse eid="LUK 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18"/>“Emebo ya Mbumu kame ili beulu yange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">kakuli nani kete oku kutaza eliywi no kuwaba kwaa ashebile.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Kame anani tumu oku kutaza etukuluho no awo ali mu ukoba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">ni kubalisa amiyo no ibofu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">ni kulukulula awo ayandisiwa<verse eid="LUK 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19"/>mi naambe omwaka ona kupumenenwa wa Mbumu.”<verse eid="LUK 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli ofuka ebuka, ni ku yuusa ku mubika, mi sebeli oikala banji. Amiyo no awo onje ana kwikala mu ndoo no milapelo sebeli amwaliketa. <verse eid="LUK 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21"/>Cwale sebeli otangisa okwamba kwa onyene nji, “Balelo elin̄olo eli nali iyatetetwa, me mu kuyupela.”<verse eid="LUK 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22"/>Cwale onje sebeli aamba wino eyaye, ni ku komoka amaywi aye no musa ana ku tunda mu kanwa kaye, sebeli aamba nji, “Kana wuyu, kasa yokame Mwana Josefa?”<verse eid="LUK 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Luli mba mu nambele enguli eyi, ‘Onganga, oku balise wenyene.’ Eyo tuna yupu ona tende mu kapenauma, witende ngeeso ni muno mu naha yowe. <verse eid="LUK 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24"/>Cwale sebeli wamba nji, “Niti luli kame nimyambela nji, kakwisa omunuhi okutekiwa mu naha yaye.<verse eid="LUK 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25"/>Kono niti luli, kame nimyambela nji kame kuna kwikalanga ambakati no kupula mu Isilaele mu maywaa a Eliya, abo eliwilu aba lina ku fukiwa mu myaka yaatu ni tikweti mutanu ni kamweya, mi kame kuna kwikala elishebo linene mu naha yonje. <verse eid="LUK 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26"/>Cwale Eliya kasiku tumiwa ku munu yonje kono konji feela kwa Zalefasi, mu naha no Sidoni ku mukati no mbakati. <verse eid="LUK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27"/>Mi kame kuna kwikalanga asimbingwa no kupula mu Isilaele mu nako ya munuhi Elisha, mi kakwisa woyo ona kubalisiwa, kono konji feela Naamani Omusiliya.”<verse eid="LUK 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28"/>Cwale aba ana kuyupa eyi, onje mu ndoo no milapelo sebeli atweba. <verse eid="LUK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29"/>Cwale sebeli aimana ni ku mucita mu mulenen̄i, ni ku mutwala ba lin̄ope no lilundu elyo ana ku yakela omulenen̄i woo, nji amu kwisete kunji. <verse eid="LUK 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30"/>Kono sebeli waabita mukaci koo nuukutela.<verse eid="LUK 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Omulume ona Kwikala ni Mebo no Kwiiba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Maleka1.21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli ota ku Kapenauma, omulenen̄i no Galileya, mi na kwaaiyeta ba liywaa no Pumulo. <verse eid="LUK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32"/>Cwale kame ana ku komoka onene etuto yaye, kakuli amaywi aye kame ana kwikala ni maata. <verse eid="LUK 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33"/>Mi mu ndoo no milapelo kame kuna kwikala omulume osi mebo no kwiiba, cwale sebeli okuwa ni liywi no kuneneba nji, <verse eid="LUK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34"/>“Etaba yetu ni wene ibine, Jesu no Nazaleta? Kame oneeyi muku tusinya? niku limukile nji tiwe anyine, tiwe no Kukena wa Nyambe!”<verse eid="LUK 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35"/>Kono Jesu sebeli omukalimela nji, “Ondoka, mi otunde mwa yonyene!” Mi cwale emebo aba inaku mukwiseta banji mukaci no aanu, cwale sebeli itunda mwa yonyene eyulwile okumutenda esi no kwiiba.<verse eid="LUK 4:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36"/>Cwale onje sebeli akomoka nuukwambisa omunjili ku munjili nji, “Eliywi eli libine? Kame ali ni tukelo ni maata no ku laelela emebo no kwakena, mi kame itunda!” <verse eid="LUK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37"/>Cwale elibubo lyaye sebeli lita mu ibaka yonje itingulukile enaha eyo.<verse eid="LUK 4:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Balisa Aanu no Kupula</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mateu8.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Maleka1.29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38"/>Jesu sebeli otunda mu ndoo no milapelo, ni kwingena mu ndoo ya Simoni. Njemunwa Simoni yo langanine yotomine onene elitomapa, mi sebeli aamba eyaye kwa Jesu. <verse eid="LUK 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli oimana ku nyonga yaye ni ku kalimela litomapa, mi sebeli litunda mwa yonyene, cwale ababo sebeli oinguka ni kwaa sebeleza.<verse eid="LUK 4:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40"/>Cwale eliywaa aba lina kwiika, onje awo ana kwikalanga naanu no meeti no oukusiya-siya sebeli aalita kwa Jesu, mi sebeli wabeeka amaoko aye beulu ni kwaabalisa. <verse eid="LUK 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41"/>Cwale emebo no kupula no kwiiba sebeli itunda, eyi kuwa nji, “Tiwe Mwana Nyambe!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:41">Kono Jesu sebeli oikalimela, ni kwilaela nji ilese okwamba, kakuli naiku limuka nji yokame Kilesite.<verse eid="LUK 4:41"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Kutaza mu Tindoo no Milapelo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Maleka1.35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42"/>Cwale eliywaa aba lina kupa, Jesu sebeli ofunduka ni kuta okaikala mu sibaka yomboci. Mi aanu sebeli amusaela ni kwiiya kwa yonyene nji amu kanise okwasiya. <verse eid="LUK 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43"/>Kono sebeli waatambula nji,“Kame nifanena okakutaza eliywi no kuwaba no mubuso wa Nyambe mu milenen̄i injili ngeeso, kakuli sokame eso ina tumenwe.”<verse eid="LUK 4:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44"/>Cwale sebeli okutaza mu tindoo no milapelo mu Judeya.<verse eid="LUK 4:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5"/>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Isana Aiyetwa no Weeli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mateu4.18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Maleka1.16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1"/>Jesu yoli ba likamba no lisa lya Genesaleta, aanu sebeli amusheeteta onene nji ayupe eliywi lya Nyambe. <verse eid="LUK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2"/>Cwale sebeli omona amato ayiili mu lisa, kono ayambi natundumo mi alemine oku yowisanga otunyandi too. <verse eid="LUK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3"/>Jesu sebeli oingena mu wato omunjili wa Simoni, sebeli omwambela nji aufule kanyonyo okutunda ba likamba. Cwale sebeli oikala banji ni kwiyeta aanu no kupula yoli mu wato. <verse eid="LUK 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4"/>Cwale aba ana kumana okwamba sebeli wambela Simoni nji, “Obeeke aba no kutunga onene mi oyambe otunyandi towe.”<verse eid="LUK 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5"/>Cwale Simoni sebeli otambula nji, “Molyange, natu yamba ousiku wonje kono kakwisa esi tuna wana. Kono okuta mu liywii lyowe kame niyamba otunyandi.” <verse eid="LUK 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6"/>Cwale aba ana kutenda ngeeso, sebeli akuuya elibunda linene no tindi, mane akanyandi sebeli ka kauka. <verse eid="LUK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7"/>Cwale sebeli akobeta alikani oo nji aiye mukwaatusa. Cwale sebeli aiya ni kwiiyata amato ayiili mane sebeli atateka okutika. <verse eid="LUK 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8"/>Kono Simoni Pitolosi abana kumona ngeeso, sebeli okukwiseta banji ni manwi aye kwa Jesu ni kwamba nji, “Otunde kwa mene, kakuli mene kame nili osiku tenda eibi, Mbumu!” <verse eid="LUK 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9"/>Mulibaka elyo kame ana kukomoka onene naawo ana kwikala naye ba ku mona okupula no tindi anaku kuuya. <verse eid="LUK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10"/>Cwale sebeli ku tendahala ngeeso ni kwa Jacobo ni Jowani aana a Zebedeya, alikani a Simoni, mi Jesu sebeli wambakwa Simoni nji “Olese ku cila, okutunda bano mbuyamba aanu.”<verse eid="LUK 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11"/>Cwale aba ana kulita amato oo ku likamba, sebeli asiya einu yonje ni ku mukon̄a<verse eid="LUK 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Balisa Omulume</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mateu8.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Maleka1.40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12"/>Jesu yoli mu mulenen̄i munjili, sebeli kwiiya omulume osi kutoma embingwa, mi aba ana kumona Jesu, sebeli okwela banji ni lubala lwaye ni kwamba nji, “Mbumu, nji kame osinga, kame otwesa okuni balisa!”<verse eid="LUK 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli oolola elyoko lyaye ni ku mulema ni kwamba nji, “Nisinga, obale!” Mi ababo embingwa sebeli ibwa. <verse eid="LUK 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14"/>Cwale sebeli omulaelela nji alese okwambela omunu, “Kono ote oka kumonahalise kwa mupulisita, mi olite enubu no ku balisiwa kanyi omu ana ku laelela Mushe, itende oupaki kwaanu.” <verse eid="LUK 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15"/>Kono cwale elibubo lyaye sebeli lihasana, mi aanu no kupula sebeli aungana oku muteeteteta ni ku balisiwa ku meeti oo. <verse eid="LUK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16"/>Kono sebeli ota mu lihalaupa oka lapela.<verse eid="LUK 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Balisa osi Lun̄an̄ali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mateu9.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Maleka2.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17"/>Ba liywaa elinjili yo iyeta, kame kuna kwikala Afalisi na iyeti no mulawo awo nakwiiya okutunda mu mindi yonje no Galileya ni Judeya ni mu Jelusalema, mi amaata a Mbumu kame ana kwikala kwa yonyene oku balisa aanu. <verse eid="LUK 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18"/>Komumone, sebeli kwiiya alume ashimbile omulume ba saala osi lun̄an̄ali, mi sebeli akumbela oku mwingenyika mukaci ni ku mu langeka ba lubala lwa Jesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19"/>Kono kasi kuwana esibaka no kwingena, mulibaka no aanu okupula, sebeli atina ba lituwa no ndoo ni ku mu shulumukiseta ni saala saye mukaci no aanu balubala lwa Jesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20"/>Cwale Jesu aba ana kumona etumelo yoo, sebeli wamba nji, “Mulume, eibi yowe na wilemenwe.”<verse eid="LUK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21"/>Cwale aiyeti no mulawo na Falisi sebeli atangisa okwibanguta aamba nji, “Anyine wuyu mulume woyo wamba mu malimbuluti? Woyo so twesa okulemena eibi konji feela konji Nyambe yomboci.”<verse eid="LUK 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22"/>Cwale Jesu aba ana kulimuka etipuzo too, sebeli waatambula nji, “Ngasibine aba mukwibanguta mu micima yenu? <verse eid="LUK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23"/>Sibine esi sootobile, okwamba nji, ‘Eibi yowe nwilemenwe,’ ni kwamba nji, ‘Oimane mi weende?’ <verse eid="LUK 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24"/>Kono nji mulimuke nji Omwana no munu kame akwite etukelo no kulemena eibi bano banji.” sebeli wambela omulume osi lun̄an̄ali nji, “Kame nikwambela nji, oimane, oshimbe oulangano wowe mi ote ku mundi!”<verse eid="LUK 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25"/>Cwale ababo sebeli oimana ba lubala loo onje, ni ku shimba oulangano waye, ni kuta ku mundi waye yo yeema Nyambe. <verse eid="LUK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26"/>Sebeli akomoka onene onje, ni ku yeema Nyambe mane sebeli aiyala okucila aamba nji, “Balelo na tumono einu indina no ku komokisa!”<verse eid="LUK 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Isana Lebi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mateu9.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Maleka2.13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27"/>Eyo aba ina kubwa, Jesu sebeli otundamo, mi sebeli omona Lebi omutelisi yo ikalile ba ofisi no mutelo, mi sebeli omwambela nji, “Onikon̄e.” <verse eid="LUK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28"/>Cwale Lebi sebeli osiya einu yonje, ni ku mu kon̄a<verse eid="LUK 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29"/>Cwale Lebi sebeli otendeliwa omukiti no kuneneba mu ndoo yaye, mi kame kuna kwikala atelisi anjili no kupula naanjili ana kwikala noo ku tafule. <verse eid="LUK 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30"/>Cwale Afalisi naa iyeti no mulawo sebeli an̄un̄uta ni kwambela aiyetwa aye nji, “Iikene aba mulya ni kunwa na telisi na sikutenda eibi?”<verse eid="LUK 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli waatambula nji, “Aanu awo ayoya wino kasaele onganga, kono awo atomine okame amusaela. <verse eid="LUK 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32"/>Kani siiya mu kwisana awo alukile, kono awo asikutenda eibi nji abake.”<verse eid="LUK 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Epuzo kweyo no ouku Yumena Eilya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mateu9.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Maleka2.18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33"/>Cwale aanu sebeli aamba kwa Jesu nji, “Aiyetwa a Jowani aka no kupula kame aku yumenanga eilya mi kame alapelanga, na iyetwa no Afalisi kame atendanga ngeeso, kono aiyetwa owe kame alya ni kunwa.”<verse eid="LUK 5:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli waambela nji, “Kame ku twesahala nji alikani no mukwati aku yumene eilya omukwati yoli noo? <verse eid="LUK 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35"/>Amaywaa mba iiyi omukwati aba sa tundisiwe kwa onyene, mi cwale kame saaku yumene eilya mu maywaa awo.” <verse eid="LUK 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36"/>Jesu kame sebeli waambela enguli injili nji, “Kakwisa omunu otwesa oku tundisa esimanahanyi ba sikumango no ubya nji asi beeke ba sikumango no ku kulubala. Nji atende ngeeso, mba kaula esikumango no ubya, mi esimanahanyi no ubya kasi tamba oku lumelelana ni sikumango noku kulubala. <verse eid="LUK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37"/>Kakwisa omunu otwesa oku beeka ewaine no ubya mu sindunga no ku umbiwa ba itumba no ku kulubala, nji atende ngeeso, ewaine no ubya mbai kaula eitumba mane ni kwiteka, ni itumba mbai sinyehe. <verse eid="LUK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38"/>Kono ewaine no ubya kame ifanena okwibeeka mu indunga no kuumbiwa ba itumba no ubya. <verse eid="LUK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39"/>Cwale kakwisa omunu so tateka okunwa ewaine no kale nji asinge eyi no ubya, kakuli kame saambe nji, ‘Ewaine no kale ya kuwaba okubita eyi no ubya.”<verse eid="LUK 5:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6"/>
  <para style="s">Epuzo okukumanena ni Liywaa no Pumulo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mateu12.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Maleka2.23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1"/>Ba liywaa linjili no Pumulo, Jesu yo bita mu matema no ubeke, aiyetwa aye sebeli ayangula amakunka no ubeke, ni kwapolola mu maoko oo ni kulya oubeke. <verse eid="LUK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2"/>Kono anjili no Afalisi sebeli aamba nji, “Iikene aba mutenda eyi no kwafanena ba liywaa no Pumulo?”<verse eid="LUK 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli otambula nji, “Kamwa sikubala eyo ana ku tenda Dabida yo yombile, yonyene naawo ana kwikala naye? <verse eid="LUK 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4"/>Omo ana kwingenena mu ndoo ya Nyambe, noomo ana kushimbela ni kulya esinkwa sina ku lukisetwa Nyambe, eyo nakwafanena okuliwa ku munu yonje konji apulisita, mi sebeli obako nawo ana kwikala naye.”<verse eid="LUK 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Omwana no Munu ni Mbumu no Pumulo.”<verse eid="LUK 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Omulume osi Lyoko no Lun̄an̄ali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mateu12.9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Maleka3.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6"/>Ba liywaa elinjili no Pumulo, Jesu aba ana kwingena mu ndoo no milapelo ni kwiyetamo, na ku kwikala omulume osi ku kukutela olun̄an̄ali ku lyooko no silyo. <verse eid="LUK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7"/>Afalisi anjili na iyeti no mulawo sebeli aaliketa Jesu oku mona nji mba balisa omunu ba liywaa no Pumulo, nji cwale awane elibaka no kumununga eyambo. <verse eid="LUK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8"/>Kono Jesu sebeli olimuka emihupulo yoo, mi sebeli wamba ku mulume osiku kukutela elyoko nji, “Wiiye wimane bano.” Cwale sebeli oimana ni kuta ba lubala no aanu. <verse eid="LUK 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Kame nimi ibanguta nji, kakufanene eli no Pumulo okutenda eyi no kuwaba simba okutenda ouyi? Oku yoyisa omooyo nji okuusinya?” <verse eid="LUK 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10"/>Cwale sebeli waaliketa onje ni kwambela woyo mulume nji, “Oolole elyooko lyowe.” Mi sebeli otenda ngeeso, cwale elyoko lyaye sebeli libala.<verse eid="LUK 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11"/>Kono sebeli aiyala okutweba nuukwambisa mukaci koo eso sa fanene okutenda kwa Jesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Keta Atumiwa Aye no kukwana Likumi ni Twiili (12)</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mateu10.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Maleka3.13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12"/>Mu maywaa aa Jesu sebeli ota ku lilundu oka lapela, mi usiku onje yotwalelela okulapela kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="LUK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13"/>Cwale aba lina kupa eliywaa, sebeli oisana aiyetwa aye, ni kuketa mwa onyene aa no kukwana likumi na yiili, awo ana kubeekiwa nji atumiwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14"/>Simoni, ana kubeeka elitina lya Pitolosi, ni Adiliyasi minaye, Jakobo, ni Jowani, ni Filipi, ni Batolome, <verse eid="LUK 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15"/>ni Mateu, ni Tomasi ni Jakobo omwana Alufeya, ni Simoni wisanwa nji Zeloti, <verse eid="LUK 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16"/>ni Judasi Mwana Jakobo, ni Judasi Isikaliota, omubeteki.<verse eid="LUK 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Iyeta ni ku Balisa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Mateu4.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17"/>Cwale sebeli oshetumuka noo ni kwimana ba saana, ni kupula no aiyetwa aye naanu no kupula ana ku tunda mu Judeya monje ni mu Jelusalema ni ba likamba lya Tile ni Sidoni, ana kwiiya mu kumuteeteta ni ku balisiwa ku meeti oo, <verse eid="LUK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18"/>naawo ana ku ziyeleha ku mebo no kwiiba naku balisiwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19"/>Cwale oundi no aanu sebeli ayeya nji amuleme, kakuli amaata kame ana kutunda kwa yonyene ni kwaa balisa onje.<verse eid="LUK 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Oku Wabelelwa ni Kweena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Mateu5.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20"/>Cwale sebeli waliketa aiyetwa aye ni kwamba nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">“Embuyoti ni yenu anyi mushebile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">kakuli omubuso wa Nyambe ni wenu!<verse eid="LUK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21"/>Embuyoti ni yenu anyi mu yombile bano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">kakuli mba mwikuta!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Embuyoti ni yenu anyi mu lila bano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">kakuli mba musheke!<verse eid="LUK 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22"/>“Embuyoti ni yenu aba mutimbiwa kwaanu, naaba amicita, naaba amyangola, ni kukana elitina lyenu kanyi lyakwiiba, mulibaka lya Mwana no Munu! <verse eid="LUK 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23"/>Mu wabelelwe mu liywaa elyo, mu nenge mu ku nyakalala, kakuli komone, omupuzo wenu ni wakuneneba ku wilu, kakuli anjekulyenu naaku tenda ngeeso kwa nuhi a Nyambe.<verse eid="LUK 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24"/>“Kono oumai ni wenu asikufuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">kakuli na mu tambula omooyo no kotoba!<verse eid="LUK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25"/>Oumai ni wenu anyi mwiikutile bano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">kakuli mba muyombo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Oumai ni wenu anyi musheka bano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">kakuli mbamweene ni ku lila.<verse eid="LUK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26"/>“Oumai ni wenu, abo aanu onje aba aamba ouwa wenu, kakuli anjekulyoo kame ana kutenda ngeeso kwa nuhi no mapwa.<verse eid="LUK 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Elilato ku Iila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Mateu5.38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12a">7.12a</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27"/>“Kono kame namba kwaanyi muyupa, mu singe eila yenu, mu tende wino kwawo ami timbile, <verse eid="LUK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28"/>mu fuyole awo amikuta, mu lapelele awo ami timbile. <verse eid="LUK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29"/>Woyo okufula ku litama limweya omube akufule kame ku litama linjili, mi omunu nji aku byangule ebaki yowe omube mane ni hembe yowe. <verse eid="LUK 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30"/>Obe woyo okumbela kwa wene, ni woyo oshimba einu yowe olese ku mubyangulayo kame. <verse eid="LUK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31"/>Cwale omu musingela nji aanu ami tendele, naanyi mutende ngeeso kwa onyene.<verse eid="LUK 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32"/>“Nji kame musinga awo ami singa, kawitumelo sa mu mone? Kakuli simba asikutenda eibi kame asinga awo aasinga! <verse eid="LUK 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33"/>Cwale nji otenda ouwa kwaawo atenda ouwa kwa wene, ka witumelo sau mone? kakuli simba nonyene asi kutenda eibi mwatendela ngeeso! <verse eid="LUK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34"/>Cwale nji kame mukalima awo mu sepile nji mba myusete, ka witumelo sa mu mone? Simba asiku tenda eibi, kame akalimana nawo atenda eibi, nji ausetwe mukupula ngeeso. <verse eid="LUK 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35"/>Kono mu singe eila yenu, mwaa tende wino, mwaa kolotise me mwabilaele nji muusetwe esinjili, mi omupuzo wenu kame saunenebe, mi kame sa mu tende aana a Nyambe Oli Beulu, kakuli yonyene niwa sishemo kwaawo no kwaku tumela naawo akusinga onyene. <verse eid="LUK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36"/>Mwikale ni makeke kanyi Sitenu aba ali ni makeke.<verse eid="LUK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okwatula Akwenu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Mateu7.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37"/>“Mu lese kwatula nji naanyi muulwe okwatuliwa, mu lese oku nyaza nji naanyi muulwe oku nyaziwa, mu lemene akwenu nji naanyi mu lemenwe. <verse eid="LUK 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38"/>Mube, nji naanyi mubiwe, niti luli kame sa mu tambule empo no utokwa eyo saibeekwe mu makaa enu. Kakuli esikala no kuwaba, mwetela banji mane mwinyunge bamweya, mwituke beulu mi mbaibekiwa ba yeelo yenu. Kakuli esikala muba kwa kwenu, naanyi sokame eso sa muwane.”<verse eid="LUK 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39"/>Kame Jesu sebeli waambela enguli nji, “Kana esibofu kame sitwesa oku twaletela esibofu sinjili? Yonje kaitamba okukwela mu wina?” <verse eid="LUK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40"/>Omwiyetwa katwese okubitelela omwiyeti waye, kono omunu yonje aba ana mana okwiyetiwa kame safeke kanyi omwiyeti waye. <verse eid="LUK 6:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41"/>Ngasibine waliketa esoopu sili mu litiyo no mwabowe, kono wene kumono omusumo oli mu litiyo lyowe? <verse eid="LUK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42"/>Simba nji ngasibine so twesete okwambela omwabowe nji, ‘Mwabange, tumone ni kutundise esoopu sili mu litiyo lyowe,’ abo weene kumono omusumo owo oli mu litiyo lyowe? Wene osikukuba, oweli otundise omusumo oli mu litiyo lyowe, okubinda cwale somone wino oku tundisa esoopu sili mu litiyo no mwabowe.<verse eid="LUK 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Esitondo ni Mbuya Yaso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Mateu7.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12.33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43"/>“Kakuli kakwisa esitondo no kuwaba sibeeke embuya no kwiiba, simba nji kame esitondo no kwiiba sibeeke embuya no kuwaba. <verse eid="LUK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44"/>Mulibaka elyo esitondo sonje kame silimukelwa ku mbuya yaso sibeeka, kakuli etifeiga kati yangulwa ku mikakani, simba esisansa no beine kasi yangulwa ku mukona. <verse eid="LUK 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45"/>Omunu no kuwaba kame atundisa eyi no kuwaba mu sitewelo na mu mucima waye, mi omunu no kwiiba kame atundisa eyi no kwiiba mu sitewelo saye no kwiiba, kakuli akanwa no munu kame kaamba eso siiyalile mu mucima waye.<verse eid="LUK 6:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ayaki Ayiili no Ndoo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mateu7.24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46"/>“Ngasibine aba mu niisana nji ‘Mbumu, Mbumu,’ mi ka mutende eso ni myambela? <verse eid="LUK 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47"/>Omunu yonje woyo wiiya kwa mene ni ku teeteta ku maywi ange ni kwasebelisa, mbimi simwete eso aku fekile naso. <verse eid="LUK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48"/>Kame aku fekile kanyi omulume oyaka endoo yaye, woyo ona kutungisa onene bakutombola, ni kuyaka omutomo waye ba liwee, mi cwale omuunda aba wiiya, ameyi aba afula onene ba ndoo, mi katwese okunyanganyisa endoo eyo, kakuli kame iyakilwe wino. <verse eid="LUK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49"/>Kono woyo oyupa amaywi ange mi kaasebelisa, kame akufekile kanyi omulume oyaka endoo yaye ba mumbu feela aba nambulwa omutomo, mi ameyi aba afulabo onene ababo kame ikwa, mi oku sinyeha no ndoo eyo kame sakutende oku no kuneneba onene!”<verse eid="LUK 6:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7"/>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Balisa Omubika no Mukulu no Masole no Muloma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mateu8.5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1"/>Cwale Jesu aba ana kumana okwambela aanu sebeli oingena mu Kapenauma. <verse eid="LUK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2"/>Cwale omukulu no masole kame ana kwikalanga ni mubika waye ona ku singiwangwa onene, ona ku tomanga mi kame ana kwikala abeebi ni kufa. <verse eid="LUK 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3"/>Cwale aba ana kuyupa eya Jesu, sebeli omutumena akulu no Majuda oka mukumbela nji aiye mu kubalisa omubika waye. <verse eid="LUK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4"/>Mi cwale awo aba ana kwiiya kwa Jesu, sebeli amu kumbela onene mu likute aamba nji, “Kame ku fanena nji wene omutendele eyi ngeeso. <verse eid="LUK 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5"/>Kakuli kame asinga aanu etu, mane na tuyakele endoo no milapelo.”<verse eid="LUK 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli ota noo. Abana ka keela ku nyonga no ndoo, omukulu no masole sebeli omutumena alikani, sebeli aiya mukwamba kwa yonyene nji, “Mbumu olese oku kataza kakuli silukele nji wene wingene munji no lituwa no ndoo yange, <verse eid="LUK 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7"/>bokame nina ku mona nji simba oukumonahaza kwa wene sifanene. Kono waambe eliywi mi omubika wange mba bala. <verse eid="LUK 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8"/>Kakuli mene naba nili munji no maata no akwange, kame nili ni masole ange, mi aba naamba ku munjili nji, ‘Ote!’ kame ata, ni ku munjili nji, ‘Wiiye!’ kame aiya, ni ku mubika wange aba naamba nji, ‘Otende esi!’ mi kame asi tenda.”<verse eid="LUK 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9"/>Cwale Jesu aba ana kuyupa eyi sebeli okomoka, niku siulukela kwaanu ana ku mukon̄a ni kwaambela nji, “Kame ni myambela, simba mu Isilaele kani siwana etumelo iku fekile kanyi eyi!”<verse eid="LUK 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10"/>Mi cwale awo ana ku tumiwa aba ana kuukela ku ndoo, sebeli aka wana omubika yooli wino.<verse eid="LUK 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Ingula Omwana no Mbakati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11"/>Munyima nweyo, Jesu sebeli ota mu mulenen̄i wisanwa Naine, na iyetwa aye ni undi no aanu sebeli ata naye. <verse eid="LUK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12"/>Ababo yo keela feela ba mwelo no mulenen̄i, sebeli okwangana naanu ashimbile omufu, neli mwana mumweya no ndumbana kwa inawaye mi neli mbakati, naanu no kupula ana ku tunda mu mulenen̄i aenda naye. <verse eid="LUK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13"/>Cwale Ombumu aba ana kumona omukati woyo, sebeli omuyupela amakeke ni ku mwambela nji, “Olese ku lila” <verse eid="LUK 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14"/>Cwale sebeli wiiya ni ku lema ba lukutu, mi awo ana ku lushimba sebeli aimana. Cwale sebeli wamba nji, “Ndumbana, kame naamba kwa wene nji, inguka!” <verse eid="LUK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15"/>Cwale omunu ona kufa sebeli oimana ni kutangisa okwamba, mi Jesu sebeli omuusa kwa inawaye.<verse eid="LUK 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16"/>Cwale onje sebeli aingenwa okucila, ni kuyeema Nyambe aamba nji, “Omunuhi munene wa Nyambe na monahala mukaci ketu!” mi “Nyambe na potele aanu aye!” <verse eid="LUK 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17"/>Cwale elibubo lyaye sebeli lihasana mu naha yonje no Judeya ni mu tinaha tonje tiku bapile nayo.<verse eid="LUK 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Elin̄usa Okutunda kwa Jowani Omukolobezi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Mateu11.2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18"/>Aiyetwa a Jowani sebeli amwambela einu yonje. <verse eid="LUK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19"/>Cwale Jowani sebeli oisana aiyetwa aye ayiili, ni kwatuma kwa Mbumu nji akaibangute nji, “Kana yawene woyo fanene okwiiya, nji tu tatelele omunjili?”<verse eid="LUK 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20"/>Cwale alume awo aba ana kukeela kwa Jesu, sebeli aamba nji, “Jowani Omukolobezi natu tumu kwa wene mukwibanguta nji yawene onafanene okwiiya, nji tutalele omunjili?’” <verse eid="LUK 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21"/>Mu nako eyo Jesu na kubalisa aanu no kupula ku meeti oo ni iyanga ni mebo no kwiiba, ni ibofu no kupula sebeli oimonisa. <verse eid="LUK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli waatambula nji, “Mute mi mukambele Jowani eyi muna mono neyi muna yupu, eibofu kame imona, eiyanga kame yeenda, asi mbingwa kame akenisiwa, aafu kame aingulwa, mi aa ashebile kame aambelwa eliywi no kuwaba. <verse eid="LUK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23"/>Cwale embuyoti niya woyo oulwa oku sitatala kwa mene!”<verse eid="LUK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24"/>Cwale awo ana kutumiwa kwa Jowani aba ana kuuka, Jesu sebeli otangisa okwamba eyi ya Jowani kwaanu no kupula nji, “Iikene muno kamona aba muna kuta mu lihaupa, neli olutaka luna ku nyanganyisiwa ku mebo? <verse eid="LUK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25"/>Iikene cwale muna kutela oka mona? Nji neli omunu ona kukufuka eikumango no kotoba? Komumone, awo aku fukile eyi no kubenya ni ku yoya wino kame ali mu tindoo no Ambumu! <verse eid="LUK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26"/>Cwale iikene muna kutela oka mona? Neli omunuhi wa Nyambe? Ee, kame nimyambela nji, mane okubitelela omunuhi wa Nyambe. <verse eid="LUK 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27"/>Eyi yokame eyaye in̄olilwe nji, ‘Komumone, kame nituma onumwana wange ba lubala no lubala lowe yokame solukisa endila yowe balubala lowe.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28"/>Kame ni myambela nji, “Kwaaawo ana leiwa kwaakati kakwisa woyo no kuneneba kwa Jowani, kono woyo no kucaniba mu mubuso wa Nyambe yo munene okubita Jowani.”<verse eid="LUK 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29"/>Aanu onje aba ana kumuyupa na telisi sebeli ayeema Nyambe ni ku kolobeziwa mu kolobezo ya Jowani omukolobezi. <verse eid="LUK 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30"/>Kono Afalisi na iyeti no mulawo sebeli akana omulelo wa Nyambe mu kukolobeziwa mu kolobezo ya Jowani.<verse eid="LUK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31"/>Cwale aanu no lusika olu kame sana fanikete ni siikene? Mi iikene aku fekile nayo? <verse eid="LUK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32"/>Kame aku fekile kanyi anukana awo aikalile mu sibaka no musika akwisana omunjili ku munjili nji, ‘Natu mipetele, kono kamwa sinenga! Natu miimbele etindimo no malilo kono kamwa silila! <verse eid="LUK 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33"/>Kakuli Jowani nakwiiya yo kali esinkwa ni kunwa ewaine, mi kame mwamba nji, ‘Kame akwete emebo no kwiiba!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34"/>Omwana no Munu kame aneeyi yoolya ni kunwa, mi kame mwamba nji, ‘Komumone, kame alya ni kunwa, omulikani no atelisi na sikutenda eibi!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35"/>Kono oku shangama na kukenisetwe anaye onje.”<verse eid="LUK 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yoli ku Ndoo ya Simoni Omufalisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36"/>Omujili no Afalisi sebeli okumbela Jesu nji akalye naye, mane sebeli ota mu ndoo no mufalisi nukekala ba tafule. <verse eid="LUK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37"/>Mi omukati na mu mulenen̄i, osi kutenda eibi aba ana kuyupa nji Jesu kame ali mu ndoo no Mufalisi, sebeli olita esitewelo no maati siisaniwa alabasita <verse eid="LUK 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38"/>ni kwimana ku nyonga ya Jesu ku makondo aye, sebeli olila ni kombisa amakondo a Jesu ni myooti yaye. Cwale sebeli otundisa emyooti ni tin̄uki na ku mutwi waye, ni kwatubeta, okwawaa ni maati. <verse eid="LUK 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39"/>Cwale Omufalisi woyo ona ku mwisana aba ana ku mona eyo, sebeli okwambisa yomboci nji, “Kambe wuyu mulume munuhi wa Nyambe luli, kambe kame amulikile wuyu mukati omulema ni ku limuka eyi atenda nji osiku tenda eibi!”<verse eid="LUK 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli otambula ni kwamba kwa yonyene nji, “Simoni, kwasili eso ni singa okwamba kwa wene.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">Mi sebeli otambula nji, “Iikene eyo, Mwiyeti?”<verse eid="LUK 7:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41"/>Omunu munjili kame ana ku kolotisa alume ayiili amali, omunjili sebeli omukolotisa amali no ku kwana ba myaanda itanu, mi omunjili kame sebeli omuba makumi atanu. <verse eid="LUK 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42"/>Cwale aba ana ku kwangwa oku teneka sebeli walemena onje. Cwale kwaawo ayiili anyine somu singa onene?”<verse eid="LUK 7:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43"/>Simoni sebeli otambula nji, “Kame ni kakanya nji woyo ona lemeniwa onene.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:43">Cwale Jesu sebeli omwambela nji, “Nu atula wino.” <verse eid="LUK 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli ofutukela ku mukati ni kwamba kwa Simoni nji, “Omwine wuyu mukati, ine ingene mu ndoo yowe, kausiniba ameyi no ukuyowa ku makondo ange, kono wuyu mukati na ombisa amakondo ange ni myooti yaye ni kwitundisa ni tin̄uki taye. <verse eid="LUK 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45"/>Kawasi nitubeta, kono oku tunda ba nako ina ingene muno, kasi lesela oku tubeta amakondo ange. <verse eid="LUK 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46"/>Kausi waa omutwi wange ni maati, kono yonyene na waa amaati ku makondo ange. <verse eid="LUK 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47"/>Cwalehe kame ni kwambela nji, eibi yaye eyo itendile nji yakupula, nai lemenwe kakuli kame anisinga onene, kono woyo olemeniwa mbicani kame asinga mbicani.”<verse eid="LUK 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wambela omukati nji, “Eibi yowe nwilemenwe.” <verse eid="LUK 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49"/>Cwale awo ana kwikala naye ku tafule sebeli atangisa okwambisa mu micima yoo nji, “Anyine wuyu, wuyu otwesa simba oku lemena eibi?”<verse eid="LUK 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba ku mukati nji, “Etumelo yowe naiku yoyisa, weende mu kozo.”<verse eid="LUK 7:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8"/>
  <para style="s">Akati ana ku Sindeketa Jesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1"/>Munyima no eyo Jesu sebeli ota mu milenen̄i ni mu mindi yo iyeta Eliywi no kuwaba no mubuso wa Nyambe. Aiyetwa aye no ku kwana likumi na yiili aali naye <verse eid="LUK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2"/>nakati ngeeso ana ku balisiwa ku mebo no kwiiba ni ku meeti. Maliya ona kwiisaniwa nji Magadalena woyo ona ku tundisiwa emebo no kwiiba itanu ni yiili (7), <verse eid="LUK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3"/>ni Joana omoywa Chuza, esikombwa sa Heloda, ni Suzana, nanjili ngeeso ano kupula, ana ku sebeleza Jesu ni ufumu woo.<verse eid="LUK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Enguli no Mukuni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mateu13.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Maleka4.1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4"/>Cwale oundi no aanu aba ona kumana oukuwana, naanu ana ku tunda mu titolopo tonje sebeli aiya kwa Jesu, sebeli waambela enguli nji, <verse eid="LUK 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5"/>“Omukuni nakuta muku kuna embuto yaye, mi yo lemine okukuna ngeeso, injili embuto sebeli ikwela mu ndila, mi sebeli ilyatangiwa ni makondo, mi otuyunyi na mu wilu sebeli iilya. <verse eid="LUK 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6"/>Injili sebeli ikwela ba mawee, eikula sebeli iletuka, kakuli kakwa sikwikala omukamo. <verse eid="LUK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7"/>Cwale einjili sebeli ikwela mu mikakani, mi emikakani aba ina kukulelela bamweya sebeli iyowelisa embuto. <verse eid="LUK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8"/>Cwale injili mbuto sebeli ikwela mu mumbu no kuwaba niku kula wino ni kubeeka omwaanda no etimbuto.” Yo amba ngeeso, sebeli okuweleza nji, “Woyo oli ni matwi no ku yupisa, ayupe!”<verse eid="LUK 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Etuso no Tinguli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mateu13.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Maleka4.10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9"/>Cwale aiyetwa aye aba ana ku mwibanguta etaluso no nguli eyo, <verse eid="LUK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10"/>sebeli wamba nji, “Anyi na mubiwi oku limuka etikunutu no mubuso wa Nyambe, kono anjili kame atalusetwa mu tinguli, nji cwale oku mona kame amona kono kayupisisa.<verse eid="LUK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Talusa Enguli no Mukuni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mateu13.18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Maleka4.13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11"/>Cwale enguli kame italusa ngeesi nji, embuto eliywi lya Nyambe. <verse eid="LUK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12"/>Embuto ina ku kwela mu ndila okame awo ana yupu eliywi, cwale Diyabulosi aba aiya kame atundisa eliywi ana yupu mu micima yoo nji alese oku pumena ni ku yoyisiwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13"/>Embuto eyo ili ba liwee okame awo, aba amana okuyupa eliywi, kame alitambula mu kuwabelelwa, kono kakwite emibisi mi kame alitambula mu nako icana feela, cwale emiliko aba iiya kame akwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14"/>Mi kweyo ina kwele mu mikona, okame awo ayupa eliywi, kono aba ata mu ndila yoo kame akeshebiswa ni tipilaelo ni ufumu, ni myelembo no mooyo, mi embuya yoo kayiimbi. <verse eid="LUK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15"/>Mi kweyo mbuto ili mu mumbu no kuwaba, okame awo ayupa eliywi ni ku litambula muwangu ni mu ku sepahala ni micima no kuwaba, ni ku beeka embuya mu ku tundamena.<verse eid="LUK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Elambi munji no Siwana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Maleka4.21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16"/>Kakwisa omunu otwesa oku monyeka elambi ni kwifukela munji no siwana, simba okwibeeka munji no mumbeta, kono ibeekiwe ba lutala nji omunu aba aingena amone eliseli.<verse eid="LUK 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17"/>Kakuli kakwisa eso sishweekiwa eso sasi ulwe oku shootolwa, simba esi sili kuuwi sasi ulwe oku limukiwa ni kwiiya ba liseli.<verse eid="LUK 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18"/>Cwale mumamele omu muyupela, kakuli woyo okwite eso ali naso, mba beekelwa, kono awo aulwile esinjiili, simba eso apuluka nji kame ali naso mbasi byanguliwa.”<verse eid="LUK 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Inawaye Jesu na Inaaye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mateu12.46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Maleka3.31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19"/>Cwale inawaye Jesu na inaaye sebeli aiya kwa yonyene, kono kasi ku twesa okukeela ku nyonga yaye, mulibaka no kupula no aanu. <verse eid="LUK 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wambeliwa nji, “Inaowe na inoowe kame aimanine bandee, kame ashukele oukumona.” <verse eid="LUK 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21"/>Kono Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Inawange na inaange okame awo ayupa eliywi lya Nyambe niku libelekisa.”<verse eid="LUK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Ondota Elin̄ungwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mateu8.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Maleka4.35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22"/>Eliywaa linjili Jesu sebeli okulonga na iyetwa aye mu wato ni kwamba kwa onyene nji, “Tu lutelenyi mu linjaliya no lisa.” Cwale sebeli afuula. <verse eid="LUK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23"/>Alemine okuluta ngeeso, Jesu sebeli olangana okutela ba tulo. Cwale emebo no lin̄ungwa sebeli iinguka ba lisa, mane sebeli asinga okutika ku meyi mi kame ana kwikala mu utata no kuneneba. <verse eid="LUK 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24"/>Aiyetwa sebeli ata kwa Jesu oka mwingula aamba nji, “Molyetu, Molyetu! kame tufa!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Mi Jesu sebeli oinguka ni ku kalimela elin̄ungwa ni mandinda, mi sebeli iimana ni kondoka tuu. <verse eid="LUK 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba kwa iyetwa aye nji, “Etumelo yenu ibine?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">Mi sebeli acila ni ku komoka nuukwambisa omunjili ku munjili nji, “Anyine cwale wuyu mulume? Nji mane kame alaela emebo ni meyi, mi kame imukuteka!”<verse eid="LUK 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Balisa Omulume no Mebo no Kwiiba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mateu8.28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Maleka5.1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26"/>Cwale Jesu na iyetwa aye sebeli aka fuweka mu naha no Magelasenesi, eyo ikubapile ni Galileya. <verse eid="LUK 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27"/>Cwale Jesu yosi longoka feela okuta ba likamba, sebeli okwangana ni mulume ona ku tunda mu mulenen̄i osi mebo no kwiiba, ba nako no kuleba kasi kumanganga eikumango mane kasi ku yoyanga mu ndoo, kono mu mayumbelo. <verse eid="LUK 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28"/>Cwale omulume woyo aba ana kumona Jesu, sebeli okuweleza ni liywi no kuneneba ni ku mukubamena balubala lwaye ni kwamba niliywi linene nji, “Iikene osaela oku tenda ni mene, Jesu Mwana Nyambe OMWAMBAKANI oli beulu? Kame niku kumbela, olese oku ni yandisa!” <verse eid="LUK 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29"/>Kakuli Jesu kame ana ku laela emebo no kwiiba oku tunda mwa woyo mulume. Kakuli mu tinako no kupula kame ina ku katazanga onene, mane kame ana ku babalelwangwa yo nungilwe ni tungongolo, ni yoondo ku makondo, kono kame ana kucola otungongolo, mi emebo no kwiiba sebeli imu twala mu lihalaupa.<verse eid="LUK 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30"/>Jesu cwale sebeli omwibanguta nji, “Tiwe anyine elitina?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:30">Mi sebeli otambula nji, “Time empi,’” kakuli emebo no kupula no kwiiba kame ina ku mwingena. <verse eid="LUK 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31"/>Cwale emebo no kwiiba sebeli ikumbela Jesu nji alese okwilaela nji ite mu wina.<verse eid="LUK 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32"/>Cwale omulaka no kuneneba no angulube kame ona ku lyelanga ba lilundu, mi cwale emebo no kwiiba sebeli ikumbela Jesu nji iingene mu tingulube, sebeli oipumenena okaingenamo. <verse eid="LUK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33"/>Cwale emebo no kwiiba sebeli itunda ku mulume nukaingena mu tingulube, mi omulaka sebeli witukela mu lin̄ope no lisa ni ku mina ameyi.<verse eid="LUK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34"/>Cwale aanu aba ana kumona eyo ina tendahala, sebeli acila nuukabiha etaba eyo mu mulenen̄i ni mu naha. <verse eid="LUK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35"/>Cwale aanu sebeli ata oka mona eyo ina tendahala, mi sebeli aiya kwa Jesu nuukawana omulume ona ku tundisiwa emebo no kwiiba yo ikalile ba makondo a Jesu, yo ku fukile yo ku ketile wino ni tingana taye, cwale sebeli acila. <verse eid="LUK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36"/>Cwale awo ana ku mona eyo sebeli aambela aanu omu ana ku yandisetwa ku mebo no kwiiba nomo ana balisetwe. <verse eid="LUK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37"/>Cwale aanu onje na mu manyonga no naha no Magelesani sebeli akumbela Jesu nji aasiye kakuli kame ana ku lemiwa ku kucila onene, mi sebeli oingena mu wato ni kuuka. <verse eid="LUK 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38"/>Omulume woyo ona ku tundisiwa emebo no kwiiba sebeli okumbela Jesu nji ate naye,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:38">Kono Jesu sebeli omulukulula nji akutele ni ku mwamba nji, <verse eid="LUK 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39"/>“Ouke ku mundi wowe, mi okaambe einu no kuneneba ana tende Nyambe kwa wene.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:39">Mi woyo mulume sebeli okutela okaamba eyo inene ana tendelwe kwa Jesu mu mulenen̄i monje.<verse eid="LUK 8:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Omwana Jailosi no Mukatana ni mukati ona ku Lema Jesu ku Mukanjo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mateu9.18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Maleka5.21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40"/>Cwale Jesu aba ana kuuka, oundi no aanu sebeli omu tambula, kakuli onje kame ana ku mu tatelela. <verse eid="LUK 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41"/>Cwale sebeli kwiiya omulume no litina lya Jailasi, omwendisi no ndoo no milapelo, ni ku kwela ku makondo a Jesu, mi sebeli omu kumbela nji ate ku ndoo yaye, <verse eid="LUK 8:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42"/>kakuli kame ana kwikalanga ni mwana mumweya no mukatana, osi myaka likumi ni yiili, mi kame ana kwiikala beebi ni kufa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Cwale Jesu yo seenda, aanu sebeli amuumbelela. <verse eid="LUK 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43"/>Cwale omukati ona ku tomanga oweeti no mweeya mu myaka likumi ni yiili, kasi ku twesahala oku balisiwa ku munu, <verse eid="LUK 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44"/>sebeli wiiya munyima ya Jesu, ni kulema ku mungundo no mukanjo waye, mi ababo sebeli obala ku weeti waye no mweeya. <verse eid="LUK 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli oibanguta nji, “Anyini ona nileme?” Cwale aanu onje sebeli akana, mi Pitolosi sebeli wamba nji, “Molyange, oundi no aanu akuumbelele, mi kame aku sinanisa.”<verse eid="LUK 8:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46"/>Kono Jesu sebeli wamba nji, “Omunjili nani leme, kakuli kame ni lemuha nji amaata anjili naabu mwa mene.” <verse eid="LUK 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47"/>Cwale omukati abana kumona nji katwese oukushweeka, sebeli oiya kwa Jesu yo cilile, ni ku mukubamena ni kwamba balubala no aanu eso ana ku mulemena noomo ana balele muwangu-wangu. <verse eid="LUK 8:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Mwanange, etumelo yowe naiku yoyisa. Ote mu kozo.”<verse eid="LUK 8:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49"/>Jesu yo saamba, sebeli kwiiya omulume ona ku tundelela ku ndoo no mwendisi ni kwamba nji, “Mwanowe nafu, olese oku kataza Omwiyeti.”<verse eid="LUK 8:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50"/>Kono Jesu aba ana kuyupa ngeeso, sebeli wambela Jailosi nji, “Olese ku cila, opumene feela, mi mwanowe mba yoyisiwa.”<verse eid="LUK 8:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51"/>Cwale aba ana ku keela ku ndoo, kasi ku pumenena omunu okwingena mu ndoo, konji Pitolosi, ni Jowani, ni Jakobo, sitaye ni inawaye omwanukana. <verse eid="LUK 8:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52"/>Cwale onje aanu kame anaku lilanga ni ku musilisa, kono Jesu sebeli waambela nji, “Mulese kulila, omwanukana kasifa, kono kame alanganine feela!”<verse eid="LUK 8:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53"/>Cwale onje sebeli asheka Jesu, muku limuka nji omwanukana nafu. <verse eid="LUK 8:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54"/>Jesu sebeli omulema ku lyooko ni ku mwisana nji, “Mwanukana, inguka!” <verse eid="LUK 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55"/>Cwale emebo yaye sebeli yukela mwa yonyene, mi ababo omwanukana sebeli oinguka, cwale Jesu sebeli olaela nji omwanukana alukisetwe esi no kulya nji alye. <verse eid="LUK 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56"/>Cwale ashemi aye sebeli akomoka, kono Jesu sebeli waalaelela nji alese okwambela omunu eyo ina tendahala.<verse eid="LUK 8:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9"/>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Tuma Aiyetwa ano Kukwana Likumi na Yiili (12)</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mateu10.5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Maleka6.7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1"/>Cwale sebeli oisana aiyetwa no kukwana likumi ni twiili bamweya mi sebeli waaba amaata ni tukelo beulu no mandimona onje mane ni ku balisa ameeti. <verse eid="LUK 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli waatuma nji akaiyete eino mubuso wa Nyambe mane nuka balisa awo akola ameeti, <verse eid="LUK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3"/>mi sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Mulese okushimba esinu sinjili ba mwendo, simba olusata, simba esipaupau, simba esinkwa, simba amali, mane mulese okushimba etihembe timbili. <verse eid="LUK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4"/>Endoo yonje mwingena mi kame amitambula, mwikalemo okubitela abo samutunde mu mulenen̄i omo, <verse eid="LUK 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5"/>mi oko konje samwingene nji kamitambula, aba mutunda mu tolopo omo, mutotomone amaluli na kumakondo enu nji atende oupaki kwa onyene.” <verse eid="LUK 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6"/>Aiyetwa sebeli ata mu mindi yonje aka iyete eliywi ni kubalisa asikutoma ameeti mu ibaka yonje.<verse eid="LUK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okulyangana kwa Heloda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mateu14.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Maleka6.14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7"/>Cwale Heloda, omubusisi abana kuyupa eyo ina kutendahala yonje, sebeli okomoka onene kakuli anjili kame ana kwambanga nji Jowani omukolobezi nainguka kwaafu. <verse eid="LUK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8"/>Anjili kame ana kwambanga nji Eliya wamonahala kale, mi anjili kame ana kwambanga nji omunjili no anuhi a Nyambe nakukale nainguka. <verse eid="LUK 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9"/>Heloda sebeli wamba nji, “Jowani woyo nina kupatula omutwi, kono anyine woyo niyupa eyaye?” Mi sebeli osaela okumona Jesu.<verse eid="LUK 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Fepa Aanu no kukwana Eikitti Mutanu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mateu14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maleka6.30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Jowani6.1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10"/>Atumiwa aba ana kuuka sebeli ambela Jesu einu yonje ana tende. Cwale sebeli washimba ni kuta noo ku mulenen̄i oisaniwa Betisaida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11"/>Cwale aanu no kupula aba ana kuyupa ngeeso, sebeli amukon̄a mi sebeli waatambula wino ni kwamba kwa onyene eyo no mubuso wa Nyambe mane sebeli obalisa awo ana kusinga okublisiwa.<verse eid="LUK 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12"/>Abo eliywaa elita mu kwiika, atumiwa no kukwana elikumi na yiili sebeli aiya kwa Jesu ni kwamba nji, “Ouse aanu nji akutele mu mindi ni mwilalanda monje ili beebi nji aka kusaelele oko sakalangane neso no kulya kakuli muno tuli ni mu sibaka sikushweekile.”<verse eid="LUK 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13"/>Kono Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Anyi luli mwaabe eyi no kulya.” Cwale sebeli atambula nji, “Kame tuli feela ni inkwa itanu ni tindi timbili, konji aba satute nji tukaa ulele eino kulya onje. <verse eid="LUK 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14"/>Oko kame kuna kwikalanga alume no kukwana eikiti itanu (5;000)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba kwa iyetwa aye nji, “Mwambele aanu aikale banji mu ikwata akwanine eititi makumi atanu mu sikwata ni sikwata (50).”<verse eid="LUK 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15"/>Cwale sebeli atenda ngeeso mane ni kwikala mu ikwata ni kwikala onje banji, <verse eid="LUK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16"/>cwale Jesu sebeli olonda einkwa itanu ni tindi timbili, sebeli waliketa kuwilu ni kuba etumbo mane ni kwipatola ni kwiiba kwa iyetwa aye nji atabele aanu. <verse eid="LUK 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17"/>Cwale onje sebeli alya ni kwikuta, mane sebeli atolabo amatanda no kukwana likumi ni twiili no ubulumusi onaku siyalako.<verse eid="LUK 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pitolosi yo Amba eyi ya Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:13-19">Mateu6.13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Maleka8.27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18"/>Cwale Jesu yoli yomboci yolapela aiyetwa sebeli aiya kwa yonyene mi sebeli waibanguta nji, “Kandi aanu kame aamba nji time anyine?”<verse eid="LUK 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19"/>Mi sebeli atambula nji, “Kame aamba nji tiwe Jowani omukolobezi, aanjili nji tiwe Eliya, mi anjili kame aamba nji omunjili no anuhi naku kale nainguka.” <verse eid="LUK 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli waibanguta nji, “Cwale anyi kame mwamba nji time anyine?” Mi Pitolosi sebeli otambula nji, “Tiwe Kilesite wa Nyambe.”<verse eid="LUK 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Amba eyi no Mayando ni lifu Lyaye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Mateu16.20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:1">Maleka9.1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21"/>Kono cwale Jesu sebeli waaba emamela nji alese okwambela omunu yonje <verse eid="LUK 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22"/>nji, “Omwana no munu kame afanena okuyanda einu no kupula, mi akaniwe kwa kulu ni kwa kulu no apulisita mane na sikun̄ola, mi aibaiwe mane nji ba liywa no waatu aingulwe kwaafu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23"/>Cwale sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Omunu yonje woyo osaela oku nikon̄a akutobohe yonyene mi akutweke esifapano saye mu maywaa onje cwale anikon̄e. <verse eid="LUK 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24"/>Abo kwa woyo osaela okuyoyisa omooyo waye mbau taukelwe, mi woyo otaukelwa omooyo waye mulibaka lyange mba yoyisiwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25"/>Siikene sawane omunu aba amuna elitunga lyonje, ni kutaukelwa omooyo waye simba okukomiwa? <verse eid="LUK 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26"/>Woyo yonje soni enene mane ni maywi ange, ni yonyene Omwana no munu mba mwenene aba saiye mu kanya yaye ni mu kanya ya sitaye neyi no mangeloi no kukena. <verse eid="LUK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27"/>Kono kame ni myambela eniti luli nji kwaali anjili aimanine bano awo katamba okufa akasi mona kale omubuso wa Nyambe.”<verse eid="LUK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okufutuka kwa Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Mateu17.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Maleka9.2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28"/>Munyima no maywaa atanu naatu Jesu aba ana kumana okwamba eyi sebeli oshimba Pitolosi, Jowani ni Jakobo ni kuta noo ba lilundu okalapela. <verse eid="LUK 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29"/>Jesu yo lapela, sebeli omonahala olutu ni ikumango yaye okufutuka mane sebeli itenda eyi no likena too onene. <verse eid="LUK 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30"/>Ababo sebeli kumonahala alume ayiili aambola ni Jesu. Awo neli Mushe ni Eliya <verse eid="LUK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31"/>awo ana kumonahala mu kanya aamba eyi no kuta kwaye eyo ana kufanena oka manenena ku Jelusalema. <verse eid="LUK 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32"/>Cwale Pitolosi nawo ana kwikala noo kame nalangananga onene ba tolo, cwale aba ana kwinguka sebeli amona ekanya ya Jesu na lume ayiili awo ana kwimananga naye. <verse eid="LUK 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33"/>Cwale alume aba ana kusiya Jesu, Pitolosi sebeli wamba kwa Jesu nji, “Molyange, nikwakuwaba ngasibine nji twikale feela bano! Tuyake eikun̄wa yaatu, esinjili sitende sowe, esinjili sa Mushe mane esinjili sitende sa Eliya.” Mukwalimuka eso ana kwamba.<verse eid="LUK 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34"/>Abo yo amba eyo, sebeli kwiiya elikumbi ni kwafuka, mi sebeli acila aba ana kufukiwa ku likumbi. <verse eid="LUK 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35"/>Cwale eliywi sebeli litunda mu likumbi eli lyamba nji, “Wuyu ya Mwanange woyo ni nakete, mumuyupe!”<verse eid="LUK 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36"/>Cwale eliywi aba lina kumana okwamba, Jesu sebeli okumona nji kame ali yomboci. Aiyetwa sebeli aondoka feela nambulwa okwambela omunu kweyi ana mono.<verse eid="LUK 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Balisa Ondumbana no Mebo no Kwiiba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Mateu17.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Maleka9.14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37"/>Eliywaa linaku tatamako Jesu na iyetwa aatu aba ana kushetumuka okutunda ba lilundu, cwale aanu no kupula sebeli akuwana ni Jesu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38"/>Cwale komumone, omulume sebeli okuwa okutunda mwaanu no kupula nji, “Mwiyeti! Kame ni kukumbela nji oni monene mwanange, kakuli yomwanange nili naye nisepile yomboci! <verse eid="LUK 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39"/>Cwale komumone emebo no kwiiba kame imulemanga muwanguwangu ni kulila onene ni kumoowa okutwala abo sakatundele olufulo ku kanwa mane ni kumukwiseta banji yonyakola eyisi mulemine. <verse eid="LUK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40"/>Cwale kame nina kumbele aiyetwa owe nji aitundise kono nakwangwa.”<verse eid="LUK 9:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41"/>Jesu sebeli otambula nji, “Anyi aanu nakwapumena ni lusika nakwayupa! Ba nako no kukuma babine saniikale naanyi? Ba nako no kukuma babine sani miiyete? Kolite mwanowe kuno.”<verse eid="LUK 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42"/>Ababo ondumbana yokeyile, emebo no kwiba sebeli ingena mwayonyene okumulyanganisa. Kono Jesu sebeli olaela emebo no kwiiba, sebeli obalisa ondumbana ni kumuba kwa sitaye. <verse eid="LUK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43"/>Mi onje kame ana kukomoka amaata no kuneneba a Nyambe.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 9:43">Jesu yo Amba kame eyi no Lifu Lyaye</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mateu17.22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Maleka9.30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Kono abo aanu asikomokile kweyo yonje anatende, sebeli wamba kwa iyetwa aye nji, <verse eid="LUK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44"/>“Muteetete wino ku maywi awo sanambe bano, Omwana no munu mbabeekiwa mu maoko no aanu. <verse eid="LUK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45"/>Kono kasi kuyupisisa omwambelo ou, kakuli kame ona kushwekiwa kwa onyene, nji alese okuyupisisa wino mi kame ana kucilanga okumwibanguta etaluso no mwambelo owo.<verse eid="LUK 9:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Anyine No Kuneneba Onene?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mateu18.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Maleka9.33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46"/>Cwale etin̄ananyi sebeli tiinguka mukaci koo nji anyine no kuneneba mukaci koo. <verse eid="LUK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47"/>Kono Jesu aba ana kumona emihupulo eli mu micima yoo, sebeli oshimba omwanuke ni kumwimeka kunyonga yaye, <verse eid="LUK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48"/>cwale sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Woyo yonje sotambula wuyu mwanuke mu litina lyange natambula mene, mi woyo yonje sotambula mene natambula woyo ona nitumu. Mi cwale woyo no mamaneneno mukaci kenu yo munene kwaanyi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:48"/></para>
  <para style="s">Omunu yonje nji Kakulwisi kame Ali ni Wene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:39-40">Maleka9.39-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49"/>Jowani sebeli otambula nji, “Molyange, natumono omulume woyo otundisa amandimona mu litina lyowe natu mukanisa, kakuli kasa wetu. <verse eid="LUK 9:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50"/>Kono cwale Jesu sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Mulese okumu kanisa kakuli nji omunu kakulwisi woyo kame ali kwa wene.” <verse eid="LUK 9:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51"/>Cwale amaywaa aba ana kusheeteta abeebi nji atambuliwe ku wilu, sebeli okutukiseta okuta ku Jelusalema. <verse eid="LUK 9:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52"/>Cwale sebeli otuma atumiwa balubala mu mundi wisaniwa nji Samalitani nji aka mulukisete einu. <verse eid="LUK 9:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53"/>Kono aanu kasiku mutambula kakuli olubala lwaye kame luna kulukisetwa okuta ku Jelusalema. <verse eid="LUK 9:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54"/>Mi cwale aiyetwa aye Jakobo ni Jowani aba ana kumona ngeeso, sebeli aamba nji, “Mbumu, kame usinga nji aci tukumbele omulilo okutunda ku wilu nji wiiye mukwa cin̄a?<verse eid="LUK 9:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55"/>Kono Jesu sebeli ofutuka ni kwakalimela. <verse eid="LUK 9:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56"/>Cwale sebeli aekeza okuta mu mundi munjili.<verse eid="LUK 9:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Awo Afanena Okutenda Akon̄eleli a Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Mateu8.19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57"/>Cwale akatile ngeseo mu mweendo woo, omulume munjili sebeli wamba kwa Jesu nji, “Kame sani kukon̄e oko konje soote.”<verse eid="LUK 9:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Aluwawa kame akwite emina, mi otuyunyi oto tutuka mu mebo kame tukwite eiyaleto, kono Omwana no munu kakwite naba no kusama omutwi waye.”<verse eid="LUK 9:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59"/>Ku munjili sebeli wamba nji, “Onikon̄e.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">Kono sebeli wamba nji, “Mbumu oweli nite nika pumbeke sitange.”<verse eid="LUK 9:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli otambula nji, “Mulesele aafu apumbeke aafu oo, cwale kono wene ote oka iyete eyi no mubuso wa Nyambe.”<verse eid="LUK 9:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61"/>Kame omunjili kwa onyene sebeli wambela Jesu nji, “Mbi kukon̄o, kono oweli nite nikalaane asi ndoo yange.”<verse eid="LUK 9:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62"/>Jesu sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Kakwisa omunu olemine ku sikekele ni kwaliketa kunyima woyo kafanene mu mubuso wa Nyambe.”<verse eid="LUK 9:62"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10"/>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Tuma ano kukwana Makumi Atanu na Yiili naanu Ayiili (72)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1"/>Munyima noeyi, Ombumu sebeli oketa ano kukwana makumi atanu nayili naanu ayiili, mane ni kwatuma balubala lwaye ayiili mu milenen̄i yonje ni mu sibaka eso afanena yonyene okuta. <verse eid="LUK 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2"/>Cwale sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Kame kuli ekutulo inene kono asi kuyangula acana, mulapele nji Ombumu no kuyangula atume asikuyangula mu iyangulo yaye. <verse eid="LUK 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3"/>Mute cwale! Komumone kame ni mituma kanyi emikoko mukaci no andiwi. <verse eid="LUK 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4"/>Mulese okushimba esikwama no mali, simba esipaupau, simba etinjatangwa mi mulese kwimana nji mukeete omunu mu ndila. <verse eid="LUK 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5"/>Endoo samwingene yonje, oweli mwambe nji, ‘Ekozo iikale mu ndoo muno.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6"/>Cwale nji omunu woyo osinga ekozo mwaali mwa onyene cwale ekozo yenu mbaiikala noo, kono nji kasamo ekozo yenu mbayuuku kwaanyi. <verse eid="LUK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7"/>Cwale mwikale mu ndoo eyo mulye mane ni kunwa eyo samubiwe kakuli omubeleki kame afanena okubiwa okutenikiwa kwaye, mulese kuta endoo ni ndoo. <verse eid="LUK 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8"/>Aba mwingena mu tolopo mi kame amitambula, mulye eso samubiwe, <verse eid="LUK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9"/>mubalise asikutoma omo mu ndoo mi mwambe kwa onyene nji, ‘ Omubuso wa Nyambe nawiyi abeebi kwaanyi.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10"/>Kono aba mwingena mu tolopo nji kamitambula, mute mu mikwakwa yayo mi mwambe nji, <verse eid="LUK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11"/>‘Simba eliluli na mu tolopo yenu elyo lina kakatele ku tinjatangwa tetu, kame tumi totomonena lyo, kono cwale mulimuke nji omubuso wa Nyambe nawiyi abeebi!’ <verse eid="LUK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12"/>Kame nimyambela nji, ba liywaa no katulo, Nyambe mba monisa esishemo ku mulenen̄i no Sodoma okubita etolopo iya! <verse eid="LUK 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13"/>Oumai niwenu Asikolazini! Oumai niwenu kame asi Besesaida! Abo kambe etimakazo tina kutendiwa mwaanyi kambe nati kutendiwa mu Tile ni Sidoni, kambe naakubaka kale mane ni kukumanga eikumango no masaka ni kulangana ba mute! <verse eid="LUK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14"/>Kono Nyambe mba monisa esishemo onene mu katulo no Tile ni Sidoni okubita aanyi. <verse eid="LUK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15"/>Mane ni wene Kapenauma kame solumbekwe ku wilu? mbu kwisetwe banji mu lyangalilo.<verse eid="LUK 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16"/>“Cwale omunu yonje woyo omiyupa kame ayupa mene, mi kame woyo omikana kame akana mene, mi woyo okana mene kame akana ni woyo ona nitumu.”<verse eid="LUK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okuuka kwawo no kukwana Makumi Atanu na Yiili naanu Ayiili (72)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17"/>Ano kukwana makumi atanu na yiili naanu ayiili sebeli akauka awabelelwe onene, ni kwambela Jesu nji, “Mbumu, simba amadimona kame atuyupa aba twa kalimela mu litina lyowe!”<verse eid="LUK 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Kame nina mono Satani yokwa okutunda ku wilu kanyi olumonyi no mbula. <verse eid="LUK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19"/>Komumone! Kame nina mibi amaata no kwenda ba tinyoka ni tubanse, mane ni maata onje beulu no ila, mi cwale kakwisa eso sasi milemeke. <verse eid="LUK 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20"/>Kono simba kuli ngeeso mulese kuwabelelwa mwesi nji abo emebo kame imiyupa, kono muwabelelwe nji amatina enu nan̄oliwa mu wilu.”<verse eid="LUK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Wabelelwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Mateu11.25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16">13.16</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17">17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21"/>Mu hola eyeyo luli Jesu sebeli owabelelwa mu Mebo No Kukena ni kwamba nji, “Kame ni kutumela kwa wene Sitange, Ombumu no liwilu ni litunga, kakuli namushweeke eyi inu kwawo no kushangama na sikukwiyeta mi namwi shootwele anuke acana. Eee, Sitange, kakuli mona kusingela nji kutendahalele.<verse eid="LUK 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22"/>“Einu yonje nai kubiwa kwa mene okutunda kwa Sitange. Mi kakwisa woyo olimukile Omwana konji Sitaye, simba woyo olimukile Sitaye konji Omwana, simba awo anakete Omwana okwaa shotwela Sitaye.”<verse eid="LUK 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli osiulukela kwa iyetwa aye kunyonga ni kwamba nji, “Embuyoti niyawo amiyo awo amona eyi mumona! <verse eid="LUK 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24"/>Kono kame nimyambela nji, Anuhi no kupula na mbumu nashukele okumona eyi mumona, kono kasiimona, mane ni kuyupa eyi muyupa, kono kasiiyupa.<verse eid="LUK 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Enguli no Musamaliya no Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25"/>Cwale komumone! omwiyeti no mulawo sebeli oimana ni kweteka okulema Jesu mukwamba nji, “Mwiyeti,” ngasibine sanitende nji nikaingene mu mooyo no kwaabwa?<verse eid="LUK 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli omutambula nji, “Siikene sin̄olilwe mu mulawo? Ngasibine mubalanga?”<verse eid="LUK 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27"/>Cwale sebeli otambula nji, “Osinge Mbumu, Nyambe wowe ni mucima wowe wonje, ni mooyo wowe wonje, ni maata owe onje, ni tingana towe tonje, mi osinge awo oyakile noo kanyi omo okusingela wenyene.”<verse eid="LUK 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Nwaamba eniti,” “Otende ngeeso mi mbuyoyo.”<verse eid="LUK 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29"/>Kono yonyene omulume woyo nakushukela oukukenisa yonyene sebeli wambela Jesu nji, “Anyine woyo ni yakile naye kunyonga?”<verse eid="LUK 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30"/>Jesu sebeli otambula nji, “Omulume kame ana kuta ku Jeliko okutunda ku Jelusalema, mi ababo sebeli okuwana na mbuyi sebeli amubyangula eikumango ni kumufula mane sebeli akutela okumusiya yo langanine mu mandingwe no lifu. <verse eid="LUK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31"/>Cwale omupulisita sebeli obita endila eyo, mi aba naku mumona sebeli oyauka ni kumusiya. <verse eid="LUK 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32"/>Mu mukwa mumweya owo, omulebi ni yonyene sebeli obita endila eyo mi sebeli omumona mi ni yonyene sebeli oyauka ni kumubitelela. <verse eid="LUK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33"/>Kono Omusamaliya yo enda mu ndila eyo sebeli okeela abo ana kwikala omulume woyo ona kulemekiwa, aba ana kumumona omo aikalele, sebeli omufela amakeke. <verse eid="LUK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34"/>Seli osheeteta kwa yonyene ni kwitela amaati ni waine ba itombo yaye mane ni kunungabo, mi sebeli omubeeka ba mbongolo yaye mane ni kumutwala ku ndoo no angenda oko ano kamu babalela. <verse eid="LUK 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35"/>Cwale eliywaa lina kutatamako sebeli olita amali no muwayawaya no silibela, ni kwaaba kwa babaleli ni kwamba nji, ‘Mubabalele wuyu munu, mi mbi miteneke kweyo samu sinyehelwe aba saniuke oku nikatile.’”<verse eid="LUK 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli omana mukwamba nji, “Anyine mu waatu woo, woyo ona monisa nji mwabaye woyo mulume onaku fuliwa kwa mbuyi?”<verse eid="LUK 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37"/>Omwiyeti no mulawo sebeli otambula nji, “Woyo ona monisa amakeke kwa yonyene.” mi Jesu sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Ote mi okatende ngeeso.”<verse eid="LUK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Singula Maleta ni Maliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38"/>Cwale ababo Jesu na iyetwa aye aba ana kutaanga mu ndila yoo, sebeli aingena mu mundi omunjili mi omukati oisaniwa Maleta sebeli omutambula mu ndoo yaye. <verse eid="LUK 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39"/>Cwale kame ana kwikalanga ni minaye no litina lya Maliya woyo ona kwikala ku makondo a Mbumu okuteeteta ku kutazo yaye. <verse eid="LUK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40"/>Kono Maleta yonyene kame ana kupatehanga okulukisa eyi no kulya, cwale sebeli ota kwa Jesu oka mwambela nji, “Mbumu, kumwine nji Maliya nanisiyi memboci okulukisa eyi no kulya? Omwambele nji aiye anituse!”<verse eid="LUK 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41"/>Kono Ombumu sebeli omutambula nji, “Maleta, Maleta! Kame unyolelwe ni kushupiwa kwiinu no kupula, <verse eid="LUK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42"/>esinu simweya kame sisaeliwa. Maliya nakete esinu simweya no kuwaba eso kasitamba kubyanguliwa kwa yonyene.”<verse eid="LUK 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11"/>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Iyeta omo no Kulapela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Mateu6.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7.7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1"/>Kame ana kulapelelanga mu sibaka sinjili, mi aba ana kumana, omunjili no aiyetwa aye sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Mbumu, otwiyete okulapela kanyi Jowani aba ana kwiyeta aiyetwa aye.”<verse eid="LUK 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli waambela nji, “Aba mulapela, mwambe nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">‘Sitetu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">elitina lyowe liikale eli no kukena,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">kwiiye omubuso wowe.<verse eid="LUK 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3"/>Otube balelo esilyanu setu omo otubelanga mu liywaa ni liywaa.<verse eid="LUK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4"/>Otu lemene emibonda yetu kanyi omo tulemenanga akwetu awo atu foseza.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">Ole kutu leselela okwingena mu miliko.’”<verse eid="LUK 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5"/>Cwale sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Anyine kwaanyi woyo otwesa okuta kwa mulikani waye bakaci no usiku nuka mwambela nji, ‘Mulikani, onibeko einkwa yaatu. <verse eid="LUK 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6"/>Omulikani wange naiyi mi sikwite esi no kumuyumbula. <verse eid="LUK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7"/>Cwale kame satambule yoli mukaci nji, ‘Ole kunikataza esaandi nasi yatiliwa kale, mene na naange twalangana kale mi sitwese okwinguka okukuba eso osaela.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8"/>Kame nimyambela nji, simba nji katamba okwiinguka okumuba eso asaela kakuli mulikani waye, kono mbainguka mane nikukuba eyo asaela yonje kakuli kaene okutwalelela okukumbela.<verse eid="LUK 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9"/>Cwale kame nimyambela nji, mukumbele mi mba mubiwi, musaele mi mba muwana, mungongote mi mba muyatulelwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10"/>Kwa woyo yonje okumbela mba biwi, woyo osaela mbawana mi woyo ongongota mba yatulelwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11"/>Anyine omushemi mukaci kenu, nji mwanaye kame akumbela ondi, kana kame atwesa okumuba enyoka okubita ondi? <verse eid="LUK 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12"/>Simba nji kame akumbela eliki kame otwesa okumuba esoowa? <verse eid="LUK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13"/>Cwale nji anyi no kwiiba mulimukile okuba anenu eyi no kuwaba aba amikumbela, cwale mbakwikala ngasibine kwa Sitetu nakuwilu kwawo amukumbela Emebo No Kukena!”<verse eid="LUK 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu ni Beluzibule</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Mateu12.22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Maleka3.20-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14"/>Cwale Jesu kame ana kutundisanga esidimona no umumu, cwale esindimona aba sina kutunda, omulume no simumu sebeli otateka okwamba mi aanu sebeli akomoka, <verse eid="LUK 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15"/>kono aanu anjili sebeli aamba nji, “Kame atundisa amadimona mulibaka lya Beluzibule, omukulu no madimona.”<verse eid="LUK 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16"/>Cwale anjili sebeli amweteka muku kumbela esisupo okutunda kuwilu. <verse eid="LUK 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17"/>Kono Jesu sebeli olimuka eyo ana nahananga, sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Omubuso wonje owo okutabile wonyene, kame osinyeha, mi nji endoo kame ikutaba bakaci kame ikwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18"/>Mi cwale nji Satani kame akutabile yonyene, ngasibine sawongolele omubuso waye? Anyi kame mwamba nji kame nitundisa amadimona mulibaka lya Beluzibule. <verse eid="LUK 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19"/>Mi nji kame nitundisa amadimona mulibaka lya Beuzibule, cwale anenu kame tundisanga amadimona mulibaka lyaanyine? Abo cwale mbatende aatuli enu. <verse eid="LUK 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20"/>Kono nji ni mulibaka no munwe wa Nyambe aba nitundisa amadimona, cwale omubuso wa Nyambe nawiyi kwaanyi. <verse eid="LUK 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21"/>Cwale omulume no koongola okutukisete okumamela endoo yaye, eibyana yaye mbaikala mu kozo. <verse eid="LUK 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22"/>Kono cwale nji omulume no koongola okumubita aba aiya niku mukoma, kame atundisa eilwiso yaye eyo asepile ni kutaba oufumu waye.<verse eid="LUK 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23"/>“Woyo kasa kwa mene kame anilwisa, mi nji omunu kakuwana ni mene kame ashandola.<verse eid="LUK 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okuuka kwa Mebo no Kwiiba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Mateu12.43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24"/>“Cwale emebo no kwakena aba ina tundu ku munu, kame ibita mu ibaka nambulwa meyi okusaela esibaka no kwikala. Nji kaiwana cwale kame yamba nji, ‘Mbiuku mu ndoo yange omo nina tundu ni kayoyemo.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25"/>Cwale aba iiya sebeli iwana nji nai fiyeliwa ni kubeeka einu wino. <verse eid="LUK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26"/>Cwale kame ita okashimba kame injili no kwiiba okubita ni yonyene no kukwana itanu ni yiili, mi kame iiya ni kuyoya mo. Cwale aba iyoya mo yonje omwikalelo wa woyo munu kame sawiibe onene okubita ba weli.”<verse eid="LUK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okuwabelelwa no niti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27"/>Jesu aba ana kwambanga ngeeso, omukati sebeli otumuka mukaci no aanu yokuweleza ni liywi no kuneneba ni kwamba nji, “Embuyoti niya lipumo elyo linaku kuleya mane ni maele owo ona kuyamwa!” <verse eid="LUK 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28"/>Kono Jesu sebeli wamba nji, “Embuyoti cwale niyawo ayupa eliywi lya Nyambe ni kuliteula!”<verse eid="LUK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Oku Kumbela Emakazo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mateu12.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29"/>Cwale oundi no aanu aba ona kwekezeha, sebeli otateka okwamba nji, “Olusika olu nilwa kwiiba, kame akumbele emakazo kono kakwisa emakazo saibiwe kwa onyene konji feela emakazo ya Jonasi. <verse eid="LUK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30"/>Kanyi Jona omo ana kutendela emakazo kwaanu a Nenibe, cwale ni Mwana no munu mba tende emakazo ku lusika olu. <verse eid="LUK 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31"/>Ombumu no mukati naku mutulo mba imana ba katulo na lume no lusika olu nik wanyaza, kakuli kame ana kutunda ku mamaneneno no litunga mukuteeteta okushangama kwa Solomoni, mi komumone esinjili no kubitelela Solomoni sino sokame. <verse eid="LUK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32"/>Alume no Nenibe mba inguka ba katulo ni lusika olu ni kulunyaza, kakuli nakubaka ba kutazo ya Jonasi, mi cwale komumone esinu no kuneneba okubitelela Jona sino sokame.<verse eid="LUK 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Elisebeli no lutu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mateu5.15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6.22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33"/>“Kakwisa omunu woyo otumbula elambi ni kwibeeka munji no tafule simba okwishweeka, kono kame aibeeka beulu nji cwale awo aingena amone eliseli. <verse eid="LUK 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34"/>Amiyo enu eliseli no lutu lwenu, cwale amiyo enu nji kame amona wino, olutu lwenu lonje kame lwiyalile eliseli kono cwale nji amiyo enu kamono wino, olutu lwenu kame lwiyalile ouwi. <verse eid="LUK 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35"/>Cwalehe mumamele nji eliseli lyenu lilese okufutuka ouwi. <verse eid="LUK 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36"/>Nji cwale olutu lwenu lonje kame lwiyalile eliseli mi kalukwite esilama no uwi, kame salubenye kanyi abo elambi aba iba eliseli.”<verse eid="LUK 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Kandimeka Afalisi na Iyeti no Mulawo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mateu23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Maleka12.38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37"/>Ababo yo sambola, Omulume no Mufalisi sebeli omukumbela nji alye naye, abo sebeli oingena nukekala ku tafule. <verse eid="LUK 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38"/>Omufalisi sebeli okomoka onene okumona nji Jesu kasiku kuyowa ku makaa aye yokasilya kale. <verse eid="LUK 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39"/>Abo Ombumu sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Cwale bano, anyi Afalisi kame muyowisa bandee no komoki yenu ni siwana, kono mukaci kenu kame kwiyalile ouyi ni ufokoli. <verse eid="LUK 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40"/>Anyi aelo! Kasa nji Nyambe woyo ona kuumba bandee yona kutenda ni mukaci kame? <verse eid="LUK 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41"/>Kono mube awo ashebile eyo inu ili mukaci, cwale komumone, einu yonje yakukena kwaanyi.<verse eid="LUK 11:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42"/>“Kono oumai niwenu Afalisi! Kakuli kame muba Nyambe esino likumi eso no Minta ni Lue ni miloho yonye ni kusheununa eniti ni lilato lya Nyambe eyi yamuna kufanena okutenda okuulwile okusheununa akwenu.<verse eid="LUK 11:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43"/>Oumai ni wenu Afalisi! Kakuli kame musinga eipula no utokwa mu tindoo no milapelo mane ni kuba elikute mu ibaka no misika. <verse eid="LUK 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44"/>Oumai ni wenu! Kakuli kame mukufekile kanyi amayumbelo no kwamoniwa mi aanu kame aenda beulu wawo nambulwa kulimukiwa.<verse eid="LUK 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45"/>Omunjili no mwimaneni no mulawo sebeli otambula nji, “Mwiyeti, mu kwamba ngeeso kame otwangula kame!”<verse eid="LUK 11:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba nji, “Oumayi ni wenu aimaneni no mulawo! Kakuli kame mushimbisa aanu ashimbo no kulema kono aanyi kame mukwangwa okushimba emishimbo yenu simba ni minwe. <verse eid="LUK 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47"/>Oumai ni wenu! Kakuli kame muyaka amayumbelo no anuhi a Nyambe awo ana kwibaiwa kwa njekulyenu. <verse eid="LUK 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48"/>Abo kame muli apaki naikaleli ku tikezo ta njekulyenu, kakuli naakwaibaa mi anyi kame muyaka amayumbelo oo. <verse eid="LUK 11:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49"/>Abo cwale kame okushangama kwa Nyambe kame kwamba nji, ‘Mbi atumene anuhi ni atumiwa, anjili kwa onyene mbaa ibaa mane ni kwayandisa.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50"/>Abo cwale olusika olu mba lubalelwe emibonda no ashemi oo no kwibaa anuhi okutunda ku matatekelo no litunga, <verse eid="LUK 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51"/>okutunda ku unyinga wa Abele okutwala ku unyinga wa Zakaliya, woyo ona kwibaelwa mukaci no aletale ni sibaka no kukena. Eee kame nimyambela nji olusika olu mba lubalelwe emibonda eyi yonje.<verse eid="LUK 11:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52"/>“Oumai ni wenu aimaneni no mulawo kakuli namushimbi etinotolo no tingana. Kamusi kwingenamo kono kame muna kukwangwesa awo ana kusinga okwingenamo!”<verse eid="LUK 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53"/>Abo Jesu yositunda abo, aiyeti no mulawo na Falisi sebeli amukandimeka ni kumutinisa nji aambe einu no kupula, <verse eid="LUK 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54"/>okumu tatelela nji aleme einu saambe.<verse eid="LUK 11:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12"/>
  <para style="s">Etemuso mulibaka no awo Asikukuba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Mateu10.26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1"/>Mu nako icana abo aanu no kukwana eikiti no lule aba anoukuwana bamweya akulyatangela omunjili ku munjili, Jesu sebeli otateka okwamba kwa iyetwa aye oweli nji, “Mumamele omumena no Afalisi, owo oli asikukuba. <verse eid="LUK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2"/>Kakwisa eso sifukilwe eso sasiulwe okumonahala, simba eso sishweekilwe sasiulwe okulimukiwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3"/>Cwalehe eso sonje munaamba mu uwi mba siyupiwa mu liseli, mane neso muna obo ku kuuwi mu musiyo mba sambiwa beulu no ndoo.<verse eid="LUK 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Anyine otwesiwa Okuciliwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Mateu10.28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4"/>“Abaange kame nimyambela nji, mulese okucila woyo oibaa olutu, kono munyima katwese okutenda esinjili kame. <verse eid="LUK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5"/>Kono mbi milemusa woyo mufanena okucila. Mucile woyo munyima no kwibaa kakuli kame akwite amaata no kumi kondela mu lyangalilo. Eee kame ni myambela nji mumucile!<verse eid="LUK 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6"/>Kana kasa nji otutaha atanu kame tuuliwa etipene timbili? Mi kakwisa simba kamweya ako katwesiwa okupulamiwa kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="LUK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7"/>Ngasibine cwale nji simba etin̄uki tenu naku mutwi wenu tonje titwesiwa okubaiwa. Cwale mulese kucila, anyi kame muli ano utokwa onene okubita otutaha no kupula.<verse eid="LUK 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okupumena ni Kukana Kilesite</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Mateu10.32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12.32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10.19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8"/>Cwale kame nimyambela nji, omunu yonje woyo sotambula mene balubala no aanu, Omwana no munu niyonyene mbaka mutambula balubala no mangeloi a Nyambe. <verse eid="LUK 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9"/>Kono omunu yonje oni kana balubala no aanu, mbaka kaniwa niyonyene balubala no mangeloi a Nyambe.<verse eid="LUK 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10"/>Mi omunu yonje woyo wamba eliywi okulwisa Omwana no munu mba lemenwe, kono woyo so nyefula ba Mebo No Kukena katamba kulemenwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11"/>“Cwale aba amilita balubala no tindoo no milapelo, simba kwabusisi ni kwasi milawo, mulese kubilaela kweso sa mutambule simba eso samwambe. <verse eid="LUK 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12"/>Kakuli Emebo No Kukena mbai miiyete eyo mufanena okwamba ba nako eyeyo.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Enguli no Mufumi no Mwelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13"/>Omunjili kwawo no kupula sebeli wamba kwa Jesu nji, “Mwiyeti, wambele mukulwange nji tukutabele oufumu ana kusiya ashemi etu.”<verse eid="LUK 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14"/>Kono Jesu sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Mulume, anyine ona nitende omwatuli simba omutabi mwaanyi?” <verse eid="LUK 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene onje nji, “Mutokomele mi mukubabalele mu titakazo no ufumu kakuli omooyo no munu aukutingile feela ba sifumu saye.”<verse eid="LUK 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16"/>Cwale sebeli waambela enguli nji, “Omumbu no mulume no kufuma kame ona kumulitela esifumu no kupula. <verse eid="LUK 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17"/>Mi sebeli onahana yonyene nji, ‘Cwale iikene sani tende, kakuli sikwite omo no kutewela etimbuto tange? <verse eid="LUK 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18"/>Cwale sebeli wamba nji, ‘Kame sani shandole eishete yange ni kuyaka eyino kuneneba mane nibeekemo embuto ni ibyana yange. <verse eid="LUK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19"/>Mi mbi aamba ku Mooyo wange nji, mooyo, kame ukwite oufumu no kupula ubeekelwe ba myaka no kupula, okukete mu mooyo, olye, onwe mi owabelelwe!’ <verse eid="LUK 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20"/>Kono Nyambe sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, ‘Wene omwelo! Ouno ousiku omooyo wowe mba utundisiwamo mwa wene. Cwale eyo ona kutukisete yaanyine?’ ”<verse eid="LUK 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21"/>Cwale kame kukufekile kanyi omunu woyo oli ni ufumu waye , kono cwale kasifuma ba miyo a Nyambe.<verse eid="LUK 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okusepa mwa Nyambe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mateu6.25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22"/>Jesu sebeli wamba kwa iyetwa aye nji, “Cwalehe kame nimyambela nji mulese kubilaela kweyi no mooyo wenu, eso sa mulye simba olutu lwenu eso samukumange. <verse eid="LUK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23"/>Kakuli omooyo niwa utokwa okubita esilya, mane ni lutu nilwa utokwa okubita eikumango. <verse eid="LUK 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24"/>Kamumone aman̄walala, kakunu mane ni kuyangula, kakwite endoo noku tewela simba esishete, kono cwale Nyambe kame aababalela. Cwale anyi kame muli ano utokwa okubita otuyunyi! <verse eid="LUK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25"/>Cwale anyine mwaanyi mukubilaela woyo otwesa okwekeza ku nako yaye no kuyoya? <verse eid="LUK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26"/>Nji cwale kutwese okutenda ngeeso kusinu simba sinyonyo, iikene aba obilaela kwiinu yonje? <verse eid="LUK 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27"/>Komumone amapalisa omo akulela, katingi owanda simba okutenda eikumango. Kono cwale kame nimyambela, simba Solomoni mu kanya yaye yonje kasiku kufuka kanyi imweya no tipalisa eti. <verse eid="LUK 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28"/>Kono nji cwale Nyambe kame afuka omoopu owo uyoya mu litema balelo mi byuunda kame uyumbeliwa mu mulilo okuucin̄a, cwale anyi tunjinga samifuke. Anyi alume no tumelo icana!<verse eid="LUK 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29"/>“Cwale mulese kusaela eyi samulye neyi samunwe simba okubilaela mu minahano. <verse eid="LUK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30"/>Kakuli aanu onje namu litunga kame asaelanga einu eyi, mi Sitenu kame alimukile nji kame mwisaela. <verse eid="LUK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31"/>Kono musaele oweli Omubuso waye mi cwale einu yonje eyi mba itende yenu.<verse eid="LUK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Oufumu na Kuwilu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Mateu6.19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32"/>“Anyi omutapi mucana, mulese kucila, kakuli Sitenu naku wilu kame awabelelwe okumiba Omubuso. <verse eid="LUK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33"/>Muulise oufumu wenu wonje mi mutabele nawo ashebile, mi mukuunganyekele oufumu owo nakwa kulubala, ni ufumu naku wilu owo nakwa kwangwa, oko kakwisa ombuyi so wiita mane kakwisa ni munu sou sinya. <verse eid="LUK 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34"/>Kakuli oko kuli oufumu wowe ni mucima wowe kooli.<verse eid="LUK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Abika no Kutatelela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35"/>“Mukutukisete mi etilambi tenu ti tumbuke. <verse eid="LUK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36"/>Cwale mufeke kanyi alume atatelele omolyoo okutunda ku mukiti no likwala. Nji cwale atwese oku muyatulwela aba saiiye mukungongota. <verse eid="LUK 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37"/>Embuyoti niyawo abika sawaniwe kwa molyoo atona aba saiiye. Niti luli kame nimyambela nji, mba kunungu ni kwaikata ba tafule mane mbaiyi kwa onyene mukwabelekela. <verse eid="LUK 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38"/>Nji aba aiya akano wiili simba aka no waatu nikwawana asitona ngeeso, embuyoti niyoo awo abika! <verse eid="LUK 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39"/>Kono mulimuke eyi, kambe omunya ndoo nakulimuka enako ana kwiiya ombuyi, kambe kasi kusiya endoo yaye nji aitemo. <verse eid="LUK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40"/>Naanyi mutatelele ngeeso kakuli Omwana no munu kame akeile mu nako no kwalimikiwa.”<verse eid="LUK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Omubika no Kusepahala simba no Kwasepahala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Mateu24.45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41"/>Cwale Pitolosi sebeli oibanguta nji, “Mbumu, enguli eyi kame oyambela aci nji kwanu onje?” <verse eid="LUK 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42"/>Cwale Ombumu sebeli wamba nji, “Anyine cwale omubika no kusepahala ni kushangama woyo ombumu waye mbamubeeke ba ndoo yaye ni kumuba esemba saye no ilya ba nako no kufanena. <verse eid="LUK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43"/>Embuyoti niya woyo omubika nji ombumu waye aba sauke mba muwana yotenda eyo ana ku musiyele nji atende. <verse eid="LUK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44"/>Niti luli kame nimyambela nji, ombumu mba mubeeke okumamela esifumu saye sonje. <verse eid="LUK 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45"/>Kono cwale nji omubika woyo amba yonyene nji omolyange naliyehe okwiiya, ni kutateka okufula abika no alume naakati ni kulya ni kunwa mane ni kukoliwa, <verse eid="LUK 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46"/>cwale molyaye aba saiye ba liywaa elyo no kwalimukiwa nji kame aiya ba nako nokwa limukiwa kame samube omubonda bamweya nawo no kwasepahala.<verse eid="LUK 12:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47"/>Cwale omubika woyo ona kulimuka eso asaela molyaye, kono kasiku tukiseta mane nikutenda okukumanena nomo asingela molyaye mba shapiwa onene. <verse eid="LUK 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48"/>Kono woyo omubika ona kuulwa okulimuka kono sebeli otenda mukucila okufuliwa kame safuliwe kanyonyo. Omunu yonje ona biwi onene kwa yonyene mbaku saeliwa onene kwa yonyene. Cwale woyo ona siyeliwa einu no kupula kame saku saeliwe onene kwa yonyene.<verse eid="LUK 12:48"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Yonaliti Etifapahano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Mateu10.34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49"/>“Kame nineyi muku beeka omulilo ba litunga, cwale iikene nisi saela kame omulilo owatumbuka kale! <verse eid="LUK 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50"/>Kame nili ni kolobezo eyo nifanena okukolobezwa nayo, cwale kame nishukelwe nji itendahale! <verse eid="LUK 12:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51"/>Kame muyambuta nji kame nineyi okulita ekozo bano ba litunga? Kokuulwa, kasa ekozo kono etifapahano. <verse eid="LUK 12:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52"/>Kakuli okutunda bano mu ndoo imweya kame sakutabe atanu, aatu kame salwise ayiili mane ayiili kame salwise aatu. <verse eid="LUK 12:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53"/>Kame sakwikale oukutaba omushemi no mulume mba kulwisa ni mwanaye no ndumbana mane omushemi no mukati mba kulwisi ni mwanaye no mukatana, onjemunwa no mukati mba kulwisi ni njemunwaye no mukati.”<verse eid="LUK 12:53"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okuyupisisa Enako</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Mateu16.2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54"/>Jesu sebeli wamba kame kwaanu no kupula nji, “Aba mumona elikumbi eliyaluka okutunda mu wiko, mwambe bamweya nji ombula mbaloko, mi kame kutendahala ngeeso. <verse eid="LUK 12:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55"/>Cwale aba mumona emebo namu mbowela aba ifuka, kame mwambanga nji mbakwikala okwenya onene, mi kame kutendahala ngeeso. <verse eid="LUK 12:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56"/>Anyi asikukuba! kame mutwesa okutoloka omo limonahalela elitunga ni liwilu, kono cwale iikene aba kamwatwese okutoloka eyi itendahala ba nako ino?<verse eid="LUK 12:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mukuuse nawo Amilwisa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Mateu5.25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57"/>“Cwale iikene aba mukwangwa oukuketa mwenyene okutenda eino kuluka? <verse eid="LUK 12:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58"/>Nji kame mukutwala ku kuta ni woyo ona foseze balubala no mwatuli, mweteke oukweleza mwenyene mu ndila yokasiku kutwala kale baubala no mwatuli mi omwatuli mba kubeeke mu maata no mubeleki no muuso mi omubeleki no muuso kame sakutwale ku tolongo. <verse eid="LUK 12:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59"/>Kame nikwambela nji kutamba kutunda mo konji aba sotenekelele omubonda no mamaneneno.”<verse eid="LUK 12:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13"/>
  <para style="s">Mufutuke Okutunda Kwiibi simba Mufa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1"/>Ba nako eyo kame kuna kwikalanga aanu awo ana kwambela Jesu eyi no Magalileya awo ounyinga woo Piloto kame ana kuwaneka ni matabelo. <verse eid="LUK 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli watambula nji, “Anyi kame munahana nji Amangalileya aa ana kutenda esibi esinene okubita Amangalileya onje, mulibaka lya eyo ina kutendahala kwa onyene? <verse eid="LUK 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3"/>Kame ni myambela nji, kokuulwa, kono konji aba samubake, monje mba mufi kanyi onyene omo ana kufela. <verse eid="LUK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4"/>Simba aanu awo no kukwana likumi ni atanu ni twaatu (18) na mu Siloamu ana kukweliwa ku tawala ni kwaaibaa, kame munahana nji onyene ni asikutenda ouyi no kuneneba okubita awo ana kuyoya mu Jelusalema? <verse eid="LUK 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5"/>Kame nimyambela nji kokuulwa, kono konji aba sa mubake nji kasa ngeseo mba mufi moonje kanyi onyene.”<verse eid="LUK 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Enguli no Sitondo no Feiga esi no Kwabeeka Embuya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli waambela enguli eyi nji, “Omulume kame ana kwikalanga ni sitondo no feiga eso ana kukuna mu litema lyaye, cwale sebeli ota nji aka shimbeko eilya kono kasi ukawanako simba simweya. <verse eid="LUK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7"/>Cwale sebeli wamba kwa asikubabalela elitema nji, ‘Esitondo esi sebeli myaka yaatu me niiya muku saelako eilya, kono Siwanako cwale bano musiteme feela! Iikene aba sikutusisa feela omumbu?’ <verse eid="LUK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8"/>Cwale osikubabalela elitema sebeli omutambula nji, ‘Musisiye feela mu mwaka uno mumweya nji nitomboleko nji mane ni beekeko omununo, <verse eid="LUK 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9"/>Mi cwale nji mbasibeeke embuya omwaka wiiya kwakuwaba, kono cwale nji kasitamba kubeeka okubinda satu sipatule.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Yobalisa Omukati no Siyanga ba Liywaa no Pumulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10"/>Cwale Jesu kame ana kwiyetanga mu ndoo injili no milapelo ba liywaa no Pumulo. <verse eid="LUK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11"/>Mukaci kame kuna kwikalanga omukati no siyanga ba myaka no kukwana likumi ni atanu ni twaatu (18), kame anaku kupunganga mane kasi kutwesanga okooloka. <verse eid="LUK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12"/>Cwale Jesu aba ana kumumona sebeli omwisana ni kwamba kwa yonyene nji, “Mukati, nulukululwa ku weeti wowe!” <verse eid="LUK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli obeeka amaoko aye beulu no mukati, mi ababo sebeli ooloka mane sebeli oyeema Nyambe.<verse eid="LUK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14"/>Kono omubusisi no ndoo no milapelo sebeli otina onene kakuli Jesu nakubalisa omunu ba liywaa no Pumulo, mi sebeli wamba kwaanu nji, “Kame tuli ni maywaa atanu ni kamweya (6) awo ana pumenenwe okutenda emisebezi, cwale mwiiye mu maywaa awo nji mubalisiwe, cwale kasa ba liywaa no Pumulo!”<verse eid="LUK 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15"/>Cwale Ombumu sebeli omutambula nji, “Anyi asikukuba! Kana omunjili kwaanyi nji kame afumine amapulu simba ombongolo katwese oku munungutula ni kumutwala mukunwa ameyi ba liywaa no Pumulo? <verse eid="LUK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16"/>Cwale uno yo mwanaye Abulahama no mukati woyo ona kunungiwa kwa satani ba myaka no kukwana likumi ni itanu ni yaatu (18) cwale katwese okulukululwa mukunungiwa oku ba liywaa no Pumulo?” <verse eid="LUK 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17"/>Mukwamba ngeeso, eila yaye yonje sebeli yeena, mi aanu onje sebeli awabelelwa kwiinu eyo ana tende Jesu.<verse eid="LUK 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Enguli no Mbuto no Masitete</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mateu13.31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Maleka4.30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18"/>Cwalehe sebeli wamba nji, “Kana omubuso wa Nyambe kame okufekile niikene? Mi siikene saniubapise ni onyene? <verse eid="LUK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19"/>Cwale kame ukufekile kanyi embuto no Masitete eyo ana shimbi omulume ni kuka kuna mu litema lyaye, mi sebeli ikula ni kutenda esitondo sinene, mi otuyunyi na mu mebo kame tutenda eiyaleto ku mitayi yaso.”<verse eid="LUK 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Enguli no Mumena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:33">Mateu13.33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20"/>Jesu kame sebeli wamba nji, siikene sani bapise ni Mubuso wa Nyambe? <verse eid="LUK 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21"/>Kame ukufekile kanyi omumena owo ana kushimba omukati nukaushweka mu ipimo yaatu eyi no unga no fulawa konji aba una kumenena wonje.”<verse eid="LUK 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Omwelo no Kukumbana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13">Mateu7.13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 14">Mateu14</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">Mateu7.21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22"/>Jesu sebeli okutela mu milenen̄i ni mu mindi yo iyeta mane ni kwenda emyendo mu Jelusalema. <verse eid="LUK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23"/>Cwale omunu munjili sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Mbumu, kana mba kuyoyisiwa felea aanu anyonyo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">Mi sebeli waatambula nji, <verse eid="LUK 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24"/>“Mweteke omo mutweseta monje okwingena ni mwelo no kukumbana, kame nimyambela kakuli aanu no kupula mba eteke nji aingene kono katamba kutwesa. <verse eid="LUK 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25"/>Cwale abo omunya ndoo aba sainguke ni kuyatila emyelo, mba mutateke okwimana ni kungongota ba sandi ni kwamba nji, ‘Mbumu otu yatulwele!’ Cwale yonyene mba tambula nji, ‘Simiyii, kubine mukatundelele!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26"/>Cwale mba mutateke okwamba nji, ‘Natu kunwa ni kulya ba lubala lowe, mi nau kwiyetanga mu titolopo tetu!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27"/>Kono mbaamba kame nji, ‘Kame ni myambela nji siyii oko mutunda kamutunde kwa meene anyi asikutenda ouyi!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28"/>Oko mbamu lili ni ku kweca amaeo aba sa mumone Abulahama ni Isaka ni Jakobo mane na nuhi onje mu Mubuso wa Nyambe mi anyi mba muyumbelwe kundee. <verse eid="LUK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29"/>Aanu mbaiyi okutunda ku upa ni ku wiko, simba ku mutulo ni ku mbowela okwikala ba tafule mu mubuso wa Nyambe. <verse eid="LUK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30"/>Kamumone, anjili ali balubala mbatende ana munyima, mi aali munyima mbatende ana balubala.”<verse eid="LUK 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Elilato lya Jesu ku Jelusalema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mateu23.37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31"/>Ba nako eyeyo, Afalisi anjili sebeli aiya ni kwamba kwa yonyene nji, “Otunde bano kakuli Heloda kame asinga nji aibae wene.” <verse eid="LUK 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32"/>Cwale sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Mute mukambele oluwawa olo nji, ‘Kamumone, kame nitundisa amadimona mane ni kutenda etimakazo no kubalisa balelo ni byuunda mane mu liywaa no waatu mbi mana omusebezi wange.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33"/>Simba ngeeso kame nifanena okuta mu mweendo wange kakuli kakufanene nji omunuhi wa Nyambe aibaelwe ku ndina okubita mu Jelusalema.<verse eid="LUK 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34"/>Jelusalema, Jelusalema, okwibaa anuhi a Nyambe ni kupwacaula ni mawee awo ana tumiwa kwa wene! Tunjinga ni na kuwaneka anowe kanyi onasikuku woyo owaneka anaye munji no maando aye, kono kawasi nipumenena! <verse eid="LUK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35"/>Komone, endoo yowe kame ikaninwe! Mi kame nikwambela nji, kutamba kunimona konji aba sowambe nji, ‘Embuyoti niya woyo oiya mu litina lya Mbumu!’”<verse eid="LUK 13:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14"/>
  <para style="s">Jesu Yobalisa Omulume Osikutoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1"/>Eliywaa linjili no Pumulo abo Jesu aba ana kuta mu ndoo no mubusisi no Afalisi okalya esinkwa, onje amwalikete. <verse eid="LUK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2"/>Kamumone, sebeli kwiiya kwa yonyene omulume woyo ona kutimbanga amakondo ni makaa. <verse eid="LUK 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba kwa simulawo na Falisi nji, “Kana kame kufanena okubalisa eli no Pumulo?<verse eid="LUK 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4"/>Kono onyene sebeli aondoka feela. Cwale Jesu sebeli oshimba omulume woyo ni kumu balisa mane ni kumu lukulula nji akutele. <verse eid="LUK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5"/>Cwale sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Cwale anyine kwaanyi woyo okwite mwanaye simba opulu waye ona kwele mu wina woyo sokwangwa okumu tundisamo eli no Pumulo?” <verse eid="LUK 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6"/>Kono kasi kutwesa oku mutambula epuzo yaye eyo.<verse eid="LUK 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okukokobeza ni Kamuhelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7"/>Cwale sebeli wambela awo ana kwisaniwa ku mukiti enguli nji, aba ana kumona omo ana kukuketela eibaka no kukutekeha, sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, <verse eid="LUK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8"/>“Nji kame ona memiwa ku mukiti no likwala, olese okwikala esipula no kukutekeha. Kakuli kame kutwesahala nji mwendi omunu no utokwa okubita wena ni yonyene namemiwa, <verse eid="LUK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9"/>mi cwale woyo ona mimeme monje mbaiyi ni kwamba kwaanyi nji, ‘Mube wuyu mulume esipula esi cwale wene mbweene ba kwikala ba sipula no sibaka na kundi. <verse eid="LUK 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10"/>Kono cwale nji numemiwa, okaikale ba sipula na kunji nji cwale omunya mukiti aba saiye kame saambe kwa wene nji, ‘Mulikani ote okaikale ba sipula na balubala,’ mi cwale mbukutekehe mu miyo aawo aikalile onje ba tafule. <verse eid="LUK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11"/>Cwale omunu yonje woyo oku nuneka mba kokobeziwa, mi woyo oku kokobeza mba nunekiwa.<verse eid="LUK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba ngeeso ku mulume ona kumumema nji, “Cwale aba uba omukushuko simba omulalelo, olese okumema alikani owe, simba abowe, mane simba awo oyakile noo ano kufuma, kakuli nonyene mbaa kumeme eliywaa linjili muku kuuseta mi watenekiwa kale. <verse eid="LUK 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13"/>Kono cwale aba otenda omukiti, omeme awo ashebile, eiyanga, eihole mane ni ibofu, <verse eid="LUK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14"/>cwale mukutenda ngeeso mbu fuyauliwa, kakuli katwese oukuuseta. Mi mbu tenekiwa mu niti ba liywaa no kwinguka no aafu.”<verse eid="LUK 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Enguli no Mukiti no Kuneneba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Mateu22.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15"/>Omunjili kwawo ana kwikala naye ba tafule sebeli oyupa eyi, mi sebeli wamba kwa Jesu nji, “Embuyoti niya woyo sokalya esinkwa mu mubuso wa Nyambe!”<verse eid="LUK 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16"/>Kono Jesu sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Kame kuna kwikalanga omulume woyo ona kutenda omukiti no kuneneba, mi sebeli omema aanu no kupula. <verse eid="LUK 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17"/>Cwale enako no mukiti aba inaku keela sebeli otuma omubika waye okambela awo onje ana kwisaniwa nji, ‘Komwiye cwale einu yonje yaluka kale!’ <verse eid="LUK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18"/>Kono cwale onje sebeli atateka okuba amabaka. Woyo no weli sebeli wamba ku mubika nji, ‘Kame nina ulu elitema mi kame nisinga nji nite ni kalimone, kame ni lapela nji munilemene.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19"/>Omunjili ni yonyene sebeli wamba nji, ‘Kame nina ulu eipani no mapulu no kukwana itanu mi kame nisinga nji ni kayeteke, cwale muyupe okukumbela kwange.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20"/>Omunjili kame sebeli wamba nji, ‘Abano okubinda ni kwate, mulibaka elyo sitwese okwiiya.<verse eid="LUK 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21"/>Cwale omubika sebeli oukamo nukambele molyaye. Cwale omolyaye sebeli ofilikana ni kwambela omubika waye nji, ‘Kandi cwale olelube ote mu makululu mane ni misika mi okashimbe ano kusheeba, eiyanga, eihole mane nawo no kwa mona aiye ku mukiti.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22"/>Cwale omubika sebeli wamba nji, ‘Molyange eyi ona nambele naitendahala kono kame kusisiyalile esibaka.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23"/>Cwale omolyaye sebeli wamba ku mubika waye nji, ‘Ote mu mikwakwa ni mu mikulo okandimeke aanu aiye mukwingena, nji endoo yange iiyale. <verse eid="LUK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24"/>Kakuli kame ni kwambela nji kakwisa kwaawo aanu nina kumema oweli awo saiye mukulya ku silya sange!’”<verse eid="LUK 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25"/>Cwale enyangela sebeli imukon̄a mi Jesu sebeli ofutukela kwaanu ni kwamba nji, <verse eid="LUK 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26"/>“Nji omunu kame aiya kwa mene mi katimbi sitaye, inawaye, mukataye, anaye mane nainaye nakulwaye, ee simba mane ni mooyo waye, katamba kutenda omwiyetwa wange. <verse eid="LUK 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27"/>Nji omunu yonje kashimbi esifapahano saye ni kuni kon̄a katamba kutenda omwiyetwa wange. <verse eid="LUK 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28"/>Cwale anyine mukaci kenu woyo otwesa okuyaka etawala yokasiikala banji nji amone etisinyehelo taye eto satitwese okumana omusebezi waye? <verse eid="LUK 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29"/>Kono cwale aba abeeka amatatekelo no muyako, mi katwese oku umanenena, awo onje aumona kame atateka oku musheka. <verse eid="LUK 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30"/>Mbaamba nji, ‘Wuyu mulume nakutateka okuyaka kono kame ana kwangwa okumanenena.<verse eid="LUK 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31"/>Simba anyine ombumu woyo ota okalwisa omukwaye woyo nokwatwesa okwikala banji ni kunahana nji kana kame atwesa okalwa ni sikwata saye no kukwana eikiti likumi nji aka kuwane ni woyo okwite esikwata no kukwana eikiti makumi ayiili. <verse eid="LUK 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32"/>Cwale nji otwesa abo omunjili yonyene kame amubita, mba tumu ondumeleti okakumbela ekozo asili kule. <verse eid="LUK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33"/>Cwalehe omunu yonje kwaanyi kakutoboha oufumu waye katamba okutenda omwiyetwa waye.<verse eid="LUK 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Omungwa no Kwamuba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mateu5.13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Maleka9.50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34"/>“Omungwa ni wakuwaba, kono nji waamuba kale, cwale ngasibine sausetwe nji mungwa kame? <verse eid="LUK 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35"/>Kaukwite etuso ku mumbu simba ku mununo, aanu kame auyumba. Cwale woyo okwite amatwi ayupe.”<verse eid="LUK 14:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15"/>
  <para style="s">Omukoko no Kutauka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Mateu18.12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1"/>Cwale atelisi nasi kutenda eibi onje sebeli asheeteta abeebi okuteeteta Jesu. <verse eid="LUK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2"/>Cwale Afalisi na iyeti no mulawo sebeli akushobotela aamba nji, “Wuyu mulume kame atambulanga asikutenda esibi mane ni kulya noo!” <verse eid="LUK 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli waambela enguli eyi nji <verse eid="LUK 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4"/>“Cwale ngasine sakwikale nji omunjili kwaanyi kame akwite emikoko no kukwana omwanda nji nakutauka mumweya, kana katwese okusiya emikoko no kukwana makumi atanu nanee ni mutanu ni tunee (99) mu lihalaupa ni kuta okasaela owo ona tauka okubitela abo sakauwanene? <verse eid="LUK 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5"/>Cwale aba auwana kame aubeeka ba mafuti yo wabelelwe, <verse eid="LUK 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6"/>mi aba akeela ku mundi kame aisana alikani aye bamweya nawo ayakile naye, ni kwamba kwa onyene nji, ‘Kamuwabelelwe ni mene kakuli inawana omukoko wange owo ona kutauka!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7"/>Mukutenda ngeeso kame nimyambela nji mba kwikala okuwabelelwa kunene mu wilu abo osikutenda ouyi mumweya aba afutuka okubaka okubita awo no kukwana makumi atanu nanee ni mutanu ni tunee (99) awo nokwabaka.<verse eid="LUK 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Omuwayawaya no Kutauka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8"/>“Simba abo omukati woyo okwite emiwayawaya no kukwana likumi mi sebeli bataukabo kamweya, kana katwese okutumbula elambi ni kufiyela mu ndoo okusaela akamuwayawaya kamweya okutwala abo sakakawanene? <verse eid="LUK 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9"/>Cwale aba amana oukawana, sebeli oisana alikani aye nawo ayakile naye ni kwamba nji, ‘Muwabelelwe ni mene kakuli inawana akamuwayawaya kange kana kutauka.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10"/>Mukutenda ngeeso kame nimyambela nji kame kuli okuwabelelwa balubala no mangeloiloi a Nyambe abo osikutenda ouyi mumweya ona baka.”<verse eid="LUK 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Omwana no Ndumbana no Kutauka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli otwalelela okwamba nji, “Kame kuna kwikalanga omulume woyo ona kwikalanga naana no andumbana ayili. <verse eid="LUK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12"/>Cwale omwanukana bo sebeli wambela sitaye nji, ‘Sitange, mene munibeko ekabelo yange kweyo muluwile.’ Cwale omulume sebeli waatabela oufumu waye. <verse eid="LUK 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13"/>Cwale munyima no maywaa feela acana, woyo mwanaye no mwanukana sebeli oungeka bamweya eyo ana kubiwa ni kwingena enaha muule mane oko sebeli oka kandakanda oufumu waye mukuyoya no kwiiba. <verse eid="LUK 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14"/>Cwale munyima no kumana oufumu waye onje, elishebo no kuneneba sebeli liingena omo mu naha, mi sebeli otateka okusaela omo sayoyele. <verse eid="LUK 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15"/>Ababo sebeli ota okaingena omusebezi ku mulume woyo ona kwikalanga omomo mu naha mi sebeli oka mutwala mu litema lyaye nuka muba omusebezi no kulisa angulube. <verse eid="LUK 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16"/>Mu mukwa no lishebo cwale sebeli olakaza fela okulya ku ilya no angulube, kono kakwisa simba mumweya woyo ona kumuba esi no kulya. <verse eid="LUK 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17"/>Kono cwale aba nausa etingana taye sebeli wamba nji, ‘Kandi anjinga abika a sitange awo akwite esinkwa simba esi no kulya mane kame ateulanga, kono kame nifa elishebo kuno! <verse eid="LUK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18"/>Mbani inguka eliywaa linjili ni kuta kwa sitange nukamba nji, “Sitange, kame ina tende ouyi balubala lwa Nyambe mane ni balubala lowe. <verse eid="LUK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19"/>Cwale sifanene okuniisana mwanowe bano, kono oniisane kanyi omunjili no abika owe.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20"/>Eliywaa linjili sebeli oinguka ni kuuka kwa sitaye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">“Cwale yo sili kule sitaye sebeli omumona ni kumulimuka mane ni kumufela amakeke, sebeli omwitukela oka mukwela musaali ni kumu tubeta. <verse eid="LUK 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21"/>Cwale omwana sebeli wamba kwa sitaye nji, ‘Sitange, kame ina foso balubala lwa Nyambe mane ni balubala lowe, cwale sifanene okwiisanwa mwanowe.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22"/>Kono sitaye sebeli wambela abika aye nji, ‘Mulite muwangu wangu olwambi no kuwaba mu mumangeke mane mumubeeke elisala naku munwe naku lyooko mane ni tinjatangwa ku makondo. <verse eid="LUK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23"/>Cwale mulite olilole no kusuwa mwiibae nji tutende omukiti tuwabelelwe! <verse eid="LUK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24"/>Kakuli wuyu mwanange kame ana kufa mi nayoyo kame, na kutauka cwale na waniwa, mi ababo sebeli atateka omukiti.<verse eid="LUK 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25"/>Cwale omwanaye no mukulu kame ana kwikalanga ku matema. Cwale aba ana kusheeteta abeebi ni ndoo sebeli oyupa etindimo ni kunenga. <verse eid="LUK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26"/>Cwale sebeli oisana omunjili no abika ni kumwibanguta nji, ‘Siikene sitendahala?’ <verse eid="LUK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27"/>Cwale sebeli omutambula nji, ‘Minowe naiyi,’ mi sitowe naibaa olilole no kusuwa kakuli namu tambula wino mi yokwanine.’<verse eid="LUK 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28"/>Kono cwale yonyene sebeli otina ni kukana okwingena, ababo sitaye sebeli oiya ni kumususuweza nji aingene. <verse eid="LUK 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29"/>Kono mwana sebeli otambula sitaye nji, ‘Mumone, nani mibelekele ba myaka no kupula nambulwa okwakuteka emilawo yenu, kono kamwa siniba elilole nji nitende omukiti na likani ange! <verse eid="LUK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30"/>Kono cwale wuyu mwanenu woyo ona kuta mukulya ekalulo no ufumu wenu ni mahule aba aneeyi, namu mwibaele olilole no kusuwa!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31"/>Cwale sitaye sebeli wamba kwa mwanaye nji, ‘Mwanange enako yonje kame uli ni mene, mi eyo niluwile yonje yowe. <verse eid="LUK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32"/>Cwale kame kulukela nji nitendele wuyu minowe omukiti mi owabelelwe, kakuli wuyu minowe nakufa mi nayoyo, mane naku tauka, kono cwale bano na waniwa.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 15:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16"/>
  <para style="s">Omwendisi No Kwasepahala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1"/>Jesu sebeli wamba kame kwa iyetwa nji, “Kame kuna kwikala omulume no kufuma ona kwikala ni mubika waye. Cwale epiho sebeli iiya kwa yonyene nji omunu woyo kame ana kusinya esifumu saye, <verse eid="LUK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2"/>mi sebeli omwisana ni kwamba kwa yonyene nji, ‘Iikene eyi niyupa mulibaka lyowe? Otunde ba sipula sowe no ubika kakuli kufanene okutenda omubika wange.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3"/>Cwale omubika sebeli okwambisa yomboci nji, ‘Iikene sani tende kakuli molyange nani tundisa ba ubika? Songolile onene okutombola mi kame neena okukumbela. <verse eid="LUK 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4"/>Kame niyii esi sanitende! Nji cwale aanu ani tambule mu tindoo too aba ina tundu ba musebezi wange.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5"/>Cwale sebeli oisana awo ana kukolotela molyaye omunjili ni munjili. Sebeli oibanguta woyo no weli nji, ‘Bukai ona kolotele molyange?’ <verse eid="LUK 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6"/>Sebeli otambula nji, ‘Omwanda no sipimo no oli,’ cwale sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, ‘Oshimbe esikoloti sowe mi oikale banji muwangu on̄ole nji makumi atanu 50.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7"/>Cwale sebeli wamba ku munjili nji, ‘Bukai ona koloto?’ Sebeli wamba nji, ‘Masaka akwana omwanda no uloto,’ Sebeli omwambela nji, ‘Oitundise mi on̄ole makumi atanu naatu (80).’ <verse eid="LUK 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8"/>Molyaye sebeli onyaza omubika mulibaka no kwasepahala kwaye kakuli aanu no litunga lino kame amonahala okutenda wino eyi no lusika loo feela okubita aanu no liseli.<verse eid="LUK 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9"/>Cwale kame nimyambela nji, “Mukutende oulikani mwenyene mulibaka no kwaluka, nji cwale aba sai kwangwe kame samitambule mu mundi no kuta oku no kwaabwa. <verse eid="LUK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10"/>Woyo no kusepahala kweyi no kucaniba mba sepahala kweyi no kupula, mi woyo no kwasepahala kweyi no kucaniba katamba kusepahala ngeeso kweyi no kupula. <verse eid="LUK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11"/>Nji cwale kamusi sepahala mu inu no kwaluka, anyine so misepa mu ufumu no niti? <verse eid="LUK 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12"/>Cwale nji kamusi sepahala mu sinu no mukowe, anyine sokuba eso sili senu? <verse eid="LUK 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13"/>Kakwisa omubika otwesa okusebeleza ambumu ayiili, kakuli mbu timbibo mumweya ni kusingabo munjili simba oukubeeka onene kumumweya ni kukana omunjili. Kutwese okusebeleza Nyambe ni mali.”<verse eid="LUK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Emyambelo Injili ya Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12">Mateu11.12</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 11:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31">5.31</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 5:32">32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11">Maleka10.11</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 10:12">12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14"/>Afalisi awo ana kusinganga amali aba ana kuyupa eyi, cwale sebeli atimba Jesu. <verse eid="LUK 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15"/>Kono Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Anyi mukuyeema mwenyene balubala no aanu, kono Nyambe kame ayii emicima yenu kakuli eyo itendile eyi no utokwa mukaci no aanu akwiiba mu miyo ya Nyambe. <verse eid="LUK 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16"/>“Omulawo na nuhi konji ba nako ya Jowani okutunda abo cwale eliywi no kuwaba no mubuso wa Nyambe aba lina kukutaziwa, mi omunu yonje sebeli weteka onene okwingenamo. <verse eid="LUK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17"/>Kono kwakotoba eliwilu ni litunga nji ibwe okubita enombolo imweya no mulawo nji ibwe.<verse eid="LUK 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18"/>“Munu yonje woyo olukulula mukataye ni kukwata omunjili kame abuka mane ni woyo okwata omukati ona lukululwa kwa mbumwaye kame abuka.<verse eid="LUK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Omulume no Kufuma ni Lazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19"/>“Kame kuna kwikalanga omulume no kufuma ona kukumanganga eikumango no undilu ona kulyanga eilya no kuwaba ba liywaa ni liywaa. <verse eid="LUK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20"/>Cwale ba mweelo waye kame kuna kulangananga omulume no kusheba no litina lya Lazalo ona kwikalanga ni itombo olutu lonje, <verse eid="LUK 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21"/>woyo ona kulakazanga okulya eyo ina kukwanga ku tafule no mulume no kufuma, cwale ambwa sebeli aiya ni kulasa ba itombo yaye. <verse eid="LUK 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22"/>Omulume no kusheba sebeli ofa mi amangeloi sebeli amushimbela kwa Abulahama mu saali saye. Omulume no mufumi ni yonyene sebeli ofa mane sebeli oteuliwa, <verse eid="LUK 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23"/>mi mu lyangalilo, yoli mu mayando sebeli waliketa ni kumona Abulahama aba no kuleba mane Lazalo yoli mu saali saye. <verse eid="LUK 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24"/>Cwale sebeli okuwa nji, ‘Sitange Abulahama! Onifele amakeke, mi otume Lazalo acupwe amamaneneno no munwe waye mu meyi nji aombote olulimi lwange, kakuli kame nili mu utata onene muno mu mulilo!’ <verse eid="LUK 16:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25"/>Kono Abulahama sebeli omutambula nji, ‘Mwanange opuluke nji mu nako no kuyoya kowe nukutambulanga einu no kuwaba, mi Lazalo kasi kwikalanga ni inu no kuwaba. Kono bano kame ali wino kuno, mi wene kame oli mu utata. <verse eid="LUK 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26"/>Cwale okwekeza kweeyi, mukaci ketu ni wene kame kuli owina no kuneneba onene, nji cwale awo ali muno katwese okwiiya kwa wene mane kakwisa woyo sotwesa okuta okutunda omo okwiiya kwaaci.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27"/>Cwale omufumi sebeli wamba kwa Abulahama nji, ‘Kame ni kukumbela, sitange, otume Lazalo ku ndoo ya sitange, <verse eid="LUK 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28"/>kakuli kame nikwite ainange atanu nji cwale akaalemuse nji alese okwiiya mu sibaka sino no mayando.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29"/>Kono Abulahama sebeli wamba nji, ‘Kame akwite Mushe na nuhi a Nyambe cwale walesele aayupe.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30"/>Cwale omufumi sebeli wamba nji, ‘Kokuulwa, sitange Abulahama! Kono nji kute omunjili kwa onyene ona tundu kwaafu, mba baka.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31"/>Cwale Abulahama sebeli wambela omufumi nji, ‘Nji katamba okuyupa Mushe na nuhi a Nyambe, katamba okuyupa simba woyo soingulwa okutunda kwaafu.’”<verse eid="LUK 16:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17"/>
  <para style="s">Esibi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6">Mateu18.6</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:21">7.21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 22">22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Maleka9.42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1"/>Jesu sebeli wamba kwa iyetwa aye nji emiliko ku kutenda esibi mu niti ikeeyile, kono oumai ni kwa woyo ikeyele! <verse eid="LUK 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2"/>Nikwa kuwaba kambe kame sa nungelelwe eliwee linene mu ndingo yaye niku muyumbela mu liwate, okubita nji asaitete anyonyo okutenda esibi. <verse eid="LUK 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3"/>Cwale mu kumamele mukaci kenu, nji omwabowe kame atenda esibi omukalimele, mi nji na baka omulemene. <verse eid="LUK 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4"/>Cwale nji kame ana kufoseze katanu ni twiili mu liywaa limweya, mi ni kwaliketa kwa wene katanu ni twiili ni kwamba nji, ‘Nabaka kale,’ kame ofanena oku mulemena.”<verse eid="LUK 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Etumelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5"/>Atumiwa sebeli aamba kwa Mbumu nji, “Otwekeleze ku tumelo yetu.”<verse eid="LUK 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6"/>Cwale Ombumu sebeli wamba nji, “Kambe kame mukwite etumelo no okufeka kanyi oubeke no mbuto no masitete, kambe kame mutwesa okwambela esitondo no molobeni nji okutule mi okakunwe mu liwate, mi mbasi mikuteke.<verse eid="LUK 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Omusebezi no Mubika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7"/>Anyine mukaci kenu woyo okwite omubika olima simba okubabalela omukoko, so amba kwa yonyene aba atunda mu litema nji, ‘Oiye muwangu kuno tulye ba tafule?’ <verse eid="LUK 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8"/>Katamba kwamba kwa yonyene nji, ‘Oni lukisete omulalelo, okuyumene mi oni sebeleze, konji aba sa nilyele ni kunwa mi munyima bosolye ni kunwa.’ <verse eid="LUK 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9"/>Kana mba kutumele ku mubika ba kutenda eso anambeliwa? <verse eid="LUK 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10"/>Naanyi yongeso nji aba mutenda yonje mu nalaelwa, mwambe nji, ‘Tuli abika awo no kwafanena, kame tuna tende eyo tufanena okuteda.’”<verse eid="LUK 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Balisa Alume no kukwana Likumi (10)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11"/>Jesu abana kuta ku Jelusalema, sebeli weenda mu museto mukaci no Samaliya ni Galileya. <verse eid="LUK 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12"/>Cwale abana kwingena mu mundi, sebeli okwangana ni aanu no kukwana likumi asikutoma embingwa, aimanine kule, <verse eid="LUK 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13"/>cwale sebeli akuweleza ni kwamba nji, “Jesu, Molyetu! Otufele amakeke!” <verse eid="LUK 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14"/>Cwale aba ana kwamona sebeli waambela nji, “Mute muka kumonahaze kwa pulisita aka mitatube.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:14">Ba ndila alemine okuta, sebeli abala. <verse eid="LUK 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15"/>Cwale mumweya kwa onyene aba ana kumona nji nabala, sebeli ouka ni kulumbeka Nyambe ni liywi linene. <verse eid="LUK 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16"/>Cwale sebeli okwela banji ni lubala ku makondo a Jesu nuukutumela. Omulume woyo neli Musamaliya. <verse eid="LUK 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba nji, “Kasa likumi awo ana balisiwa? Kanti kubine ali awo akwana atanu nanee? <verse eid="LUK 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18"/>Ngasibine kasiuka nji alumbeke Nyambe konji wuyu osi mushobo mundina? <verse eid="LUK 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19"/>Cwale sebeli omwambela nji, “Oimane okutele etumelo yowe nai kuyoyisa.”<verse eid="LUK 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20"/>Afalisi aba ana ku mwibanguta nji omubuso na kuwilu kamwaka sawiye. Sebeli waatambula nji, “Omubuso wa Nyambe kautamba kwiiya ni imoniso. <verse eid="LUK 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21"/>Kautamba kwambiwa nji, ‘Komumone, kuno kwauli, simba nji, Uya baya, kakuli omubuso wa Nyambe kame uli mukaci kenu.”<verse eid="LUK 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22"/>Jesu sebeli wamba kwa iyetwa aye nji, “Amaywaa akeyile abo samushukele okumona limweya eliywaa no Mwana no Munu, kono kamutamba kulimona. <verse eid="LUK 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23"/>Mi kame saambe kwanyi nji, ‘Komumone uno kuno, simba nji, ‘Komumone, uya kuya! Mulese kuta simba okwakon̄a. <verse eid="LUK 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24"/>Kanyi olumonyi aba lumonyeka ni kutumbuka mu liwilu ku maneku ayiili, mwasa kukaikalele mu liywaa no Mwana no Munu. <verse eid="LUK 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25"/>Kono ayande oweli kwiinu no kupula mane ni kukaniwa ni lusika olu. <verse eid="LUK 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26"/>Kanyi mu maywaa a Nuwe mwasa kuka ikalele ni mu liywaa no Mwana no munu. <verse eid="LUK 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27"/>Kame ana kulya, ni kunwa, ni kukwata, ni kukwalisa konji mane ba liywaa elyo Nuwe aba ana kwingena mu wato no aleka, mi ameyi no kupula sebeli aiya ni kwayundisa onje. <verse eid="LUK 17:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28"/>Kanyi kame omo kuna kwikalela mu maywaa a Lota, kame ana kulya, ni kunwa, kame ana kuulanga ni kuulisa, kame ana kukunanga ni kuyaka. <verse eid="LUK 17:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29"/>kono ba liywaa ana kutunda Lota mu sondoma omulilo ni silufula sebeli iloka ku wilu ni kwaibaa onje. <verse eid="LUK 17:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30"/>Cwale mwasa kukaikalele ni mu liywaa no Mwana no munu aba sa monahale. <verse eid="LUK 17:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31"/>Ba liywaa elyo woyo oli ba situwa no ndoo, ni ibyana yaye mu ndoo alese kutuluka nji aishimbe, mi kame ni woyo oli mu litema alese okuuka ku mundi. <verse eid="LUK 17:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32"/>Mupuluke mukataye Lota. <verse eid="LUK 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33"/>Woyo yonje okununeka omooyo waye mba utaukelwe, kono woyo otaukelwa omooyo waye mba yoyisiwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34"/>Kame ni myambela nji mu usiku owo kame sakwikale ayiili ba mumbeta, mumweya mba shimbiwa omunjili mba siiwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35"/>Akati ayiili satwe mu sinu simweya, mumweya mba shimbiwa omunjili mba siiwa <verse eid="LUK 17:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36"/>Alume ayiili awo sa ikale mu litema, omunjili mba shimbiwa munjili mba siiwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37"/>Cwale sebeli aamba kwa yonyene nji, “Mbumu, kubine oko?” Jesu sebeli waambela nji, “Oko kuli olutu ni manon̄u kwa sa kaungane bamweya.”<verse eid="LUK 17:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18"/>
  <para style="s">Enguli no Mbakati ni Mwatuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli waambela enguli nji atundamene mu kulapela mi alese kuzwafa. <verse eid="LUK 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2"/>Sebeli waambela nji, “Mu mulenen̄i munjili kame kuna kwikalanga omwatuli woyo kasi kucilanga Nyambe simba aanu. <verse eid="LUK 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3"/>Cwale kame kuna kwikalanga ni mbakati woyo ona kwiyanga kwa yonyene ni ku mwambelanga nji, ‘Onituse kwa wuyu oni zekisa!’ <verse eid="LUK 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4"/>Omwatuli sebeli okana ba nako no kuleba, kono munyima sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, ‘Simba nji sicili Nyambe simba okukuteka omunu, <verse eid="LUK 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5"/>ee kakuli wuyu mbakati kame ani bilaeza, kame sani mutuse nji alese okuni kataza okuni iyelanga!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6"/>Cwale Ombumu sebeli wamba nji, “Muyupe eyo amba omwatuli nambulwa niti. <verse eid="LUK 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7"/>Cwale Nyambe katamba okutusa aketwa aye, awo alila kwa yonyene ousiku ni munji? Kana mba liyehe mukaci koo? <verse eid="LUK 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8"/>Kame ni myambela nji, kame saatuse muwangu, simbangeeso, Omwana no munu aba saiye mbawana etumelo ba litunga?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9"/>Jesu sebeli wamba enguli eyi kwa njili awo ana kukusepa onyene nji akukena mane ni kushendaula akoo. <verse eid="LUK 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10"/>“Alume ayiili sebeli ata mu ndoo ya Nyambe okalapela, mumweya neli Mufalisi omunjili neli mutelisi. <verse eid="LUK 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11"/>Omufalisi sebeli oimana niku lapela nji, ‘Nyambe kame ni kutumela kwa wene kakuli mene sikufekile kanyi aanu anjili asikuyumena, nawo no kwa sepahala, asikubuka, simba mane kanyi wuyu mutelisi. <verse eid="LUK 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12"/>Kame niku yumenanga eyi no kulya twiili mu sunda, kame nibanga esi no likumi kweyo ni wananga.’<verse eid="LUK 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13"/>“Kono omutelisi yoimanine oku no kuleba mane kasikutwesa okwinula amiyo aye okwaliketa ku wilu, kono sebeli ofula ba saali saye nikwamba nji, ‘Nyambe, onifele amakeke mene osikutenda eibi!’ <verse eid="LUK 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14"/>Kame nimyambela nji,” “Wuyu mulume kame ana uku ku ndoo yaye yo lukile okubita omukwaye. Kakuli omunu yonje woyo okununeka yonyene mba kokobeziwa, kono woyo oku kokobeza mba nunekiwa.”<verse eid="LUK 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Fuyola Anukana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15"/>Cwale sebeli amulitela anuke nji aaleme amaka aye beulu. Cwale aiyetwa aye aba ana kumona ngeeso sebeli aayuta. <verse eid="LUK 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16"/>Kono Jesu sebeli waisanena kwa yonyene ni kwambela nji, “Mulesele anuke aiye kwa mene, mi mulese okwakanisa kakuli omubuso wa Nyambe niwoo. <verse eid="LUK 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17"/>Niti luli kame nimyambela! Omunu yonje nji katambula omubuso wa Nyambe kanyi mwanuke katamba kwingena mo.”<verse eid="LUK 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Omulume no Kufuma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mateu19.16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Maleka10.17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18"/>Cwale omubusisi sebeli oibanguta Jesu nji, “Omwiyeti no kuwaba, siikene sa nitende nji nika yole omooyo na kwaabwa?”<verse eid="LUK 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19"/>“Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Iikene abonisana nji nili muwa?” Kakwisa muwa konji Nyambe yomboci. <verse eid="LUK 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20"/>Oyii etitaelo, ‘Mulese okubuka, Mulese kwibaa, Mulese kwiita, Mulese kuba oupaki no mapwa, Mukuteke asitenu na inawenu.’” <verse eid="LUK 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21"/>Mi sebeli wamba nji, “Yonje eyi ina imamela okutunda ku wanuke wange.” <verse eid="LUK 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22"/>Cwale Jesu abana kuyupa ngeeso sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Kwasili esinu simweya eso ulwile. Oulise einu yowe yonje okwite mi otabele awo ashebile, mi mbu wana esifumu na kuwilu, cwale oiye oni kon̄e.” <verse eid="LUK 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23"/>Kono abana kuyupa eyi, sebeli weena, kakuli neli wakufuma onene. <verse eid="LUK 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24"/>Jesu sebeli omwaliketa ni kwamba nji, “Ngasibine kubambabile nji awo akwite esifumu akaingene mu mubuso wa Nyambe! <verse eid="LUK 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25"/>Kono ni kwa kotoba ekamele okwingena mu litiyo no ndonga kasanji omufumi okwingena mu mubuso wa Nyambe.”<verse eid="LUK 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26"/>Awo ana kwiyupa sebeli amba nji, “Cwale anyine so kayoyisiwa?”<verse eid="LUK 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27"/>Kono Jesu sebeli wamba nji, “Eso sibambabile kwaanu ni sakotoba kwa Nyambe.”<verse eid="LUK 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28"/>Cwale Pitolosi sebeli wamba nji, “Komone! natusiyi etindoo tetu nuukukon̄a.”<verse eid="LUK 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Niti luli kame nimyambela nji, “Kakwisa omulume ona siyi endoo simba omukati simba mukulwaye simba ashemyaye simba anaye mulibaka no mubuso wa Nyambe, <verse eid="LUK 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30"/>awo aulwile okuwana onene ba nako ino, mi ba nako no mamaneneno mbawana omooyo no kwabwa.<verse eid="LUK 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Amba aka no Waatu eyi no Lifu Lyaye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mateu20.17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Maleka10.32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli oshimba aiyetwa aye no kukwana elikumi ni twiili (12), ni kwamba kwa onyene nji, “Muteetete, kame tukatile ku Jelusalema, mi eyo yonje ina kun̄oliwa eyi no Mwana no munu kwa nuhi a Nyambe mba iyatetetwe. <verse eid="LUK 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32"/>Kakuli kame sa biwe kwa simacaba, mi kame sa shendaulwe mane ni ku yandisiwa no kwenisa mane ni kumu sibwela amate. <verse eid="LUK 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33"/>Kame sa mufule ni kumwibaa, mi ba liywaa no waatu mba inguka.”<verse eid="LUK 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34"/>Kono aiyetwa kasi kuyupa simba simweya kweyo ana kwamba, omwambelo ou kame una ku shweekiwa kwa onyene mi kasi kulimuka eyo Jesu ana kwamba.<verse eid="LUK 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Balisa Esibofu sina ku Kumbelanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mateu20.29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Maleka10.46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35"/>Abo Jesu yoli beebi ni Jeliko, kame kuna kwikalanga esibofu no mulume sina kwikalanga ku nyonga no ndila, esikumbelanga <verse eid="LUK 18:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36"/>Cwale aba ana kuyupa aanu no kupula abita, sebeli oibanguta nji, “Siikene esi?”<verse eid="LUK 18:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37"/>Sebeli amwambela nji, “Jesu no Nazaleta yokame woyo obita”<verse eid="LUK 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38"/>Cwale sebeli okuwa nji, “Jesu! Omwana Dabida! Onifele amakeke!”<verse eid="LUK 18:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39"/>Cwale awo ana kwikala balubala sebeli amukalimela nji aondoke. Kono sebeli okuwa onene nji, “Omwana Dabida oni yupele amakeke!”<verse eid="LUK 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli oimana niku laela nji amulite kwa yonyene mi aba ana kukeela abeebi, sebeli omwibanguta nji, <verse eid="LUK 18:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41"/>“Iikene osaela nji niku tendele?” Sebeli otambula nji, “Mbumu, kame ni singa okumona.”<verse eid="LUK 18:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Omone! Etumelo yowe naiku yoyisa.”<verse eid="LUK 18:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43"/>Cwale ababo sebeli omona niku mukon̄a yo kanyisa Nyambe, mi aanu onje aba ana kumona eyi, sebeli alumbeka Nyambe.<verse eid="LUK 18:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19"/>
  <para style="s">Jesu ni Zakiyasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1"/>Jesu sebeli oingena mu Jeliko mi kame ana kubita feela. <verse eid="LUK 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2"/>Cwale kame kuna kwikalanga omulume no litina lya Zakiyasi, neli omukulu no mutelisi ni kufuma. <verse eid="LUK 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3"/>Cwale sebeli osaela nji amone Jesu nji anyine, kono sebeli okwanggwa mulibaka no aanu no kupula ni kwibiba ku siyema saye. <verse eid="LUK 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4"/>Cwale sebeli oitukela balubala nuukatina ku sitondo no sikamole nji amumone, kakuli Jesu nakubita endila eyo. <verse eid="LUK 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5"/>Cwale Jesu aba ana kukeela ba sibaka eso, sebeli waliketa ku wilu ni kwamba kwa yonyene nji, “Zakiyasi otuluke muwanguwangu kakuli kame nifanena okwikala mu ndoo yowe balelo.”<verse eid="LUK 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6"/>Cwale Zakiyasi sebeli oleluba ni kutulukela banji ni ku mutambula mu kuwabelelwa onene. <verse eid="LUK 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7"/>Cwale aanu aba ana kumona ngeeso sebeli an̄un̄uta nji, “Kame anati okatenda ongenda no mulume osikutenda eibi!”<verse eid="LUK 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8"/>Cwale Zakiyasi sebeli oimana ni kwamba kwa Mbumu nji, “Komone, Mbumu, elicika no ufumu wange kame niba kwa sikusheba, nji kame nina byangula omunu esinu saye, kame nimuuseta etitikanyo no kukwana tinee.”<verse eid="LUK 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Balelo okuyoyisiwa na kwiiyi muno mu ndoo, kakuli ni yonyene mwana a Abulahama. <verse eid="LUK 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10"/>Kakuli Omwana no munu neeyi muku saela ni kuyoyisa eso sinatauka.” <verse eid="LUK 19:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11"/>Aba ana kuyupa einu eyi, Jesu sebeli otwalelela okwaambela enguli. Kakuli kame ana kwikala beebi ni Jelusalema, mi kakuli kame ana ku yambuta nji omubuso wa Nyambe kame uli beebi oku monahala ababo. <verse eid="LUK 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12"/>Cwale Jesu ababo sebeli wamba nji, “Omulume no ku kutekeha sebeli ota ku naha oko no kuleba akatambula omubuso mi cwale sebeli ouka. <verse eid="LUK 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13"/>Sebeli oisana abika aye no kukwana likumi ni kwaaba etipondo likumi ni kwamba kwa onyene nji, ‘Mu fundote amali aa okutwala abo sanika ukele.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14"/>Kono aanu aye naku mutimba mane sebeli atuma onumwana munyima yaye okaamba nji, ‘Ka tusingi wuyu mulume nji atubuse.’<verse eid="LUK 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15"/>Aba ana kuuka munyima no katambula omubuso sebeli olaela abika aye awo ana kuba amali nji aiye kwa yonyene nji alimuke eso anawana mukuulisa koo. <verse eid="LUK 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16"/>Ono weli sebeli oiya ba lubala lwaye ni kwamba nji, Molyange, epondo yowe naini wanene etipondo likumi beulu.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17"/>Cwale sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, ‘Nutende wino, wene omubika no kuwaba! Kakuli nusepahala kwicana onene, mbu busu emilenen̄i no kukwana likumi.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18"/>Omubika no wiili sebeli oiya ni kwamba nji, ‘Molyange, epondo yowe ina wanenebo etipondo titanu kame.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19"/>Cwale sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, ‘Cwale mbu busu milenen̄i itanu.’<verse eid="LUK 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20"/>Cwale omubika munjili sebeli oiya ni kwamba nji, ‘Molyange, ino yokame epondo yowe eyo nina kupungelanga mu lwambi. <verse eid="LUK 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21"/>Kakuli kame nina kucilanga wene kakuli uli munu no kubambaba. Kame oshimba omo kausi beeka mane kame okutula omo kausi kuna.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22"/>Cwale sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, ‘Kame sani kwatule kweyo itunda mu kanw kowe! Wene omubika no kububa! Kame ona kulimuka nji mene nili omunu no kubambaba mene nishimba omo kanisibeeka mane niku kutula omo kani sikukuna. <verse eid="LUK 19:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23"/>Cwale iikene aba wasikubeeka amali ange mu panga? Cwale bakwiya kwange kambe kame nina ishimbi ni n̄ambeko yayo.’<verse eid="LUK 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24"/>Cwale sebeli wamba kwawo ana kwimana naye kunyonga nji, ‘Mushimbe epondo kwa yonyene mi mwiibe woyo okwite etipondo likumi.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25"/>Cwale sebeli aamba kwa yonyene nji, ‘Mbumu kame akwite etipondo likumi!’<verse eid="LUK 19:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26"/>‘Kame ni myambela nji, ‘Omunu yonje woyo okwite mbabiwi onene, kono kwa woyo oulwile simba neso akwite mba byanguliwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27"/>Kono kanyi kwiila yange awo ka sikusinga nji nabuse, mwalite kuno nikwaibaele balubala wange!”’<verse eid="LUK 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aba ana Kwingena mu Jelusalema mu Umbumu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mateu21.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maleka11.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Jowani12.12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28"/>Cwale Jesu aba ana kumana okwamba eyi, sebeli wekeza okuta ku Jelusalema. <verse eid="LUK 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29"/>Cwale aba ana kukeela ku nyonga no Betefage ni Betani ku lilundu elyo liisaniwa nji Olibeti, sebeli otuma aiyetwa aye ayiili balubala, <verse eid="LUK 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30"/>ni kwambela nji, “Mute mu mundi oli balubala lwenu, abasa mwingenemo mba muwana akana no mbongolo kanungilwe ako kaka sitiniwa kale ku munu. Mu kanungutule mi mukalite kuno. <verse eid="LUK 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31"/>Nji omunu kame sami ibangute nji, ‘Iikene aba muka fungutula,’ mu mwambele nji, ‘Ombumu kame aka saela.’” <verse eid="LUK 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32"/>Cwale awo ana kutumiwa sebeli ata nukawana akambongolo kanyi omo ana kwaambela Jesu. <verse eid="LUK 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33"/>Cwale alemine oku fungutula akambongolo, omunyako sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji. “Iikene aba mu fungutula akambongolo?”<verse eid="LUK 19:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34"/>Cwale sebeli aamba nji, “Ombumu kame aka saela,” <verse eid="LUK 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35"/>Cwale sebeli alita akambongolo kwa Jesu, ni kuyala eikumango yoo beulu no kambongolo ni kwikatabo Jesu. <verse eid="LUK 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36"/>Cwale yoenda, sebeli ayala eikumango yoo mu ndila.<verse eid="LUK 19:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37"/>Cwale aba ana kukeela abeebi ni Jelusalema, ba ndila ishetumuka ba liundu no Olibe, okupula no aiyetwa sebeli atateka okuwabelelwa ni kuyeema Nyambe ni liywi no kuneneba mullibaka no musebezi no kuneneba ana mono. <verse eid="LUK 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38"/>aamba nji, “Embuyoti ni yawoyo oiya mu litina lya Mbumu! Ekozo iikaleko mu wilu ni kanya mu liwilu.<verse eid="LUK 19:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39"/>Cwale Afalisi anjili mu kupula sebeli aamba nji, “Mwiyeti,” okalimele aiyetwa owe!”<verse eid="LUK 19:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40"/>Jesu sebeli otambula nji, “Kame ni myambela nji, aa nji aondoke, amawee mba kuwu.”<verse eid="LUK 19:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu abana Lilela Jelusalema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41"/>Cwale aba ana kusheeteta abeebi ni mulenen̄i no Jelusalema sebeli oulilela, <verse eid="LUK 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42"/>ni kwamba nji, “Kambe na mukulimuka mu liywaa na balelo einu itenda ekozo! Kono cwale kame ishweekilwe ku miyo enu! <verse eid="LUK 19:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43"/>Kakuli amaywaa mbaiyi kwa wene abo eila yowe mbai kutinguluka ni lukwakwa no kwambeka ikuyatilele ku maneku onje. <verse eid="LUK 19:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44"/>Cwale kame sa kukwisete banji wene bamweya naanowe, mi katamba kusiya eliwee limweya beulu no likwayo mwa wene, kakuli kusilimuka enako ona poteliwa!”<verse eid="LUK 19:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Yota ku Ndoo ya Nyambe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mateu21.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Maleka11.15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Jowani2.13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli oingena mu Ndoo ya Nyambe ni kutateka okucita awo ana kuulisangamo, <verse eid="LUK 19:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46"/>ni wamba kwa onyene nji, “Kame kun̄olilwe nji, ‘Endoo yange kame saitende eyi no tapelo.’ Kono aanyi namwifutula omo akushweeka ambuyi!”<verse eid="LUK 19:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47"/>Cwale Jesu nakwiyetanga mu Ndoo ya Nyambe amaaywaa onje. Apulisita akulu na n̄oli, ni manduna no sicaba sebeli alela okumwibaa, <verse eid="LUK 19:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48"/>kono kasi kuwana esinjili eso ana kufanena okutenda, kakuli aanu onje kame ana ku teetetanga ku maywi aye.<verse eid="LUK 19:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20"/>
  <para style="s">Epuzo Okukumanena ni Maata a Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mateu21.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Maleka11.27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1"/>Eliywaa linjili Jesu yoiyeta ni kukutaza eliywi kwaanu mu Ndoo ya Nyambe, apulisita akulu na n̄oli bamweya na kulu sebeli aiya, <verse eid="LUK 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2"/>ni kwamba kwa yonyene nji, “Otwambele, ka maata awo otendisa einu eyi, simba anyini ona kubi woo.” <verse eid="LUK 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3"/>Jesu sebeli waatambula nji, “Ni mene kame sani mibangute epuzo nji munambele, <verse eid="LUK 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4"/>kana ekolobezo ya Jowani kame ina kutunda ku wilu nji neli kwaanu?”<verse eid="LUK 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5"/>Cwale sebeli akwambota mukaci koo, ni kwamba nji, “Aba satwambe nji, ‘Kame itunda kuwilu,’ kame saambe nji, ‘Cwale iikene kamwa sikumupumena?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6"/>Kono aba satwambe nji, ‘Niya aanu feela, aanu onje kame satu pwacaule ni mawee, kakuli kame apumena nji Jowani neli munuhi.”<verse eid="LUK 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7"/>Cwale sebeli atambula nji, “Katuyii oko ina kutunda.”<verse eid="LUK 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Ni mene simyambele amaata ni kutusisa okutenda einu eyi.”<verse eid="LUK 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Enguli no Abeleki na mu Litema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mateu21.33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Maleka12.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli otateka okwambela aanu enguli eyi nji, “Omulume kame ana kukuna elitema no beine ni kulisiya mu maoko no abeleki, mi sebeli ota mu naha indina ba nako no kuleba. <verse eid="LUK 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10"/>Cwale enako aba ina kukwana, sebeli otuma omubika kwa beleki nji amube ku mbuya na mu litema no beine. Kono abeleki sebeli amufula ni kumuusa nambulwa esi ana kushimba. <verse eid="LUK 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11"/>Mi kame sebeli otuma omubika munjili, kono abeleki sebeli amufula ni yonyene ni ku muyandisa mu mukwa no kwenisa mane ni kumuusa nambulwa esi ana kushimba. <verse eid="LUK 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12"/>Cwale sebeli otuma woyo no waatu, woyo sebeli amulemeka ni kumuyumbela kundee. <verse eid="LUK 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13"/>Cwale omunya litema sebeli wamba nji, ‘Cwale iikene sanitende? Mbi tumu mwanange woyo nisinga onene, mwendi mba ka mukuteke!’ <verse eid="LUK 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14"/>Kono cwale abeleki abana ku mumona, sebeli akwambota mukaci koo nji, ‘Woyo yokame shwana twendenyi tu mwibae, nji cwale aci tu kayole esifumu!’ <verse eid="LUK 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15"/>Cwale sebeli amuyumbela kundee no litema no beine niku mwibaa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">“Cwale siikene satende omunya litema kwa onyene? <verse eid="LUK 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16"/>“Kame saiye mukusinya abeleki ni kuba anjili.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Cwale aanu aba ana kuyupa ngeeso sebeli aamba nji, “Nyambe otulemene!”<verse eid="LUK 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17"/>Kono Jesu sebeli waaliketa ni kwamba nji, “Iikene cwale eyo in̄olilwe?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">‘Eliwee elyo lina kukaniwa kwayaki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:17">kame lina futuka omusumo no utokwa namu lilulu.’<verse eid="LUK 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18"/>Omunu yonje woyo so kwelabo mba patuka otubindi-bindi, kono cwale nji eliwee elyo likwele omunu mba limulemeke.”<verse eid="LUK 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Epuzo mulibaka no Kuteneka Imitelo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mateu22.15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Maleka12.13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19"/>Aiyeti no mulawo na pulisita akulu sebeli aeteka oku beeka amaoko oo beulu ya Jesu ba nako eyeyo, kono sebeli acila aanu kakuli kame ana lemuha nji naambele enguli eyo yalwisa. <verse eid="LUK 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20"/>Cwale sebeli amwaliketa, ni kutumena amatwela awo ana kukumonahalisa nji akuluka, nji ayupe eyo saambe, nji amube mu maata ni mupuso no mubusisi. <verse eid="LUK 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21"/>Cwale amatwela sebeli aibanguta Jesu nji, “Mwiyeti, kame tuyii nji kame wamba ni kwiyeta wino mane kukwite esishweka, kono kame wiyeta endila ya Nyambe mu niti. <verse eid="LUK 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22"/>Kame tulukeele aci okuba omutelo kwa Sesale nji katulukeele?” <verse eid="LUK 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23"/>Kono Jesu sebeli omona etingana too ni kwamba kwa onyene nji, <verse eid="LUK 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24"/>“Komunimonise omuwayawaya. Sanyine esifateho neyi ina n̄oliwabo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:24">Sebeli aamba nji, “Ya Sesale.”<verse eid="LUK 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Cwale mube Sesale eso sili sa Sesale, mi mube Nyambe eso sili sa Nyambe. <verse eid="LUK 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26"/>Cwale sebeli akwangwa mukaci no aanu okulema eso ana kwamba, kono sebeli akomoka ekalabo yaye, mi sebeli aondoka feela.<verse eid="LUK 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Epuzo Okukumanena eyi no Kwinguka Kwaafu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mateu22.23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Maleka12.18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27"/>Cwale sebeli kwiiya Aduki anjili kwa Jesu awo ana kwamba nji kakwisa okwinguka kwaafu, <verse eid="LUK 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28"/>mi sebeli amwibanguta nji, “Mwiyeti, Mushe kame ana kutun̄olela omulawo owo wamba nji mukulwaye munu nafi yo kwite omukati kono kakwite omwana, minaye kame afanena okukwata woyo mukati nji alitele mukulwaye aana.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29"/>Cwale kame kuna kwikalanga alume atanu na yiili, wuyu no weli sebeli okwata omukati kono sebeli ofa nambulwa kuleyelako omwana. <verse eid="LUK 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30"/>Wuyu no wiili <verse eid="LUK 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31"/>mane wuyu no waatu sebeli omushimba. Mi onje atanu na yiili sebeli aafa nambulwa kusiya aana. <verse eid="LUK 20:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32"/>Cwale munyima yoo ni mukati sebeli ofa. <verse eid="LUK 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33"/>Cwalehe mukwinguka kwaafu anyine sotenda omunya mukati? Kakuli onje kame naku mukwatanga.”<verse eid="LUK 20:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Aana namu nako ino kame akwata ni kukwaliwa, <verse eid="LUK 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35"/>kono awo sa biwe etukelo no kumona elitunga na kulubala ni kwinguka no aafu awo katamba kukwata ni kukwaliwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36"/>Cwale katamba kufa kame, kakuli kame afekile kanyi mangeloi mi aana a Nyambe, atendile aana no kwinguka. <verse eid="LUK 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37"/>Kono nji aafu mba inguka, simba Mushe ni yonyene na kwamba ngeeso ku liputa lina kutumbuka aba ana kwisana Mbumu nji Nyambe wa Abulahama, ni Nyambe wa Isaka mane ni Nyambe wa Jakobo. <verse eid="LUK 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38"/>Cwale ka Nyambe waa no kufa, kono wawo no kuyoya, kakuli kwa yonyene onje kame ayoya.”<verse eid="LUK 20:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39"/>Cwale an̄oli anjili sebeli aamba nji, “Mwiyeti nwamba wino!” <verse eid="LUK 20:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40"/>Kakuli kame ana kucila oku mwibanguta epuzo injili kame.<verse eid="LUK 20:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Epuzo mulibaka lya Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mateu22.41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Maleka12.35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41"/>Kono Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Ngasibine aba aamba nji Kilesite ni Mwana Dabida? <verse eid="LUK 20:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42"/>Kakuli Dabida yonyene kame ana kwamba mu buka no Lisamu nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">‘Ombumu naamba kwa Mbumu wange nji,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42">Oikale ku lyooko lyange no silyo<verse eid="LUK 20:42"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43"/>okutwala abo sani tendele eila yowe eipula no kulyatabo makondo owe.<verse eid="LUK 20:43"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44"/>Dabida kame amwisana nji Mbumu, cwale ngasibine omo satendele nji mwanaye?<verse eid="LUK 20:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yoba Emamela kwa Iyeti no Mulawo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mateu23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Maleka12.38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45"/>Jesu sebeli wambela aiyetwa aye aanu onje ateetete. <verse eid="LUK 20:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46"/>Mucile an̄oli awo asinga oukumanga mu ikumango no kuleba mane ni kusinga okupota mu ibaka no misika ni kwikala mu ipula no utokwa mu tindoo no milapelo ni mu ibaka no kukutekeha ku mikiti. <verse eid="LUK 20:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47"/>Kame amana eiluwo no akati no ambakati aatendela etitapelo no kuleba! Awo kame sabiwe ekoto no kubambaba onene ni kubitelela!”<verse eid="LUK 20:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21"/>
  <para style="s">Enubu no Mbakati</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Maleka12.41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1"/>Jesu sebeli waliketa ni kumona awo no kufuma abeeka etimpo too mu sitewelo, <verse eid="LUK 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2"/>cwale sebeli omona ombakati no kusheba yo beeka otumiwayawaya twiili. <verse eid="LUK 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3"/>Cwale sebeli wamba nji, “Niti luli kame nimyambela nji wuyu mbakati na beeke amali no kupula okubita aanu onje. <verse eid="LUK 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4"/>Kakulii onje kame ana tundisa aba no kupula, kono yonyene mukusheba kwaye nabeeke eso ana kwikalanga naso sonje eso ana kufanena nji ayoyelebo.”<verse eid="LUK 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Amba eyi no Kusinya Endoo ya Nyambe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mateu24.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Maleka13.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5"/>Cwale anjili alemine okwamba eyi no Ndoo ya Nyambe omo ina kuyakelwa wino ni mawee no kuwaba mane ni tinubu, sebeli wamba nji, <verse eid="LUK 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6"/>“Kanyi einu yonje eyi mumona, enako mba ikwana abo kakwisa eliwee elyo lishangamine ba linjili elyo salikwangwe oku kwisetwa banji.”<verse eid="LUK 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Amatata ni Mayando</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mateu24.3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Maleka13.3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7"/>Cwale sebeli amwibanguta nji, “Mwiyeti, kaliywaa sa itendahale eyi? Mi kasisupo eso sasi monise nji abano okutwa itendahala? <verse eid="LUK 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba nji, “Mumamele nji mulese okoongiwa kakuli ano kupula mbaiyi mu litina lyange ni kwamba nji, ‘Yamene Jesu!’ mi ‘Enako naikwana!’ Kono mulese kwa kon̄a <verse eid="LUK 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9"/>Mulese kucila aba sa muyupe etindwa ni tizikinyeho kakuli eyi kame ifanena okutendahala oweli, kono kasanji amamaneneno kame ali beebi.” <verse eid="LUK 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10"/>Cwale sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Amatunga kame saku futukele oukulwisa, mi emibuso kame sai kufutukele oukulwisa. <verse eid="LUK 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11"/>Kame sakwikale etizikinyeho tinene mane mu maneku no kupula kame sakwikale elishebo ni mafu mane kame sakutunde einu no kucilisa kuwilu <verse eid="LUK 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12"/>Kono eyi yonje eyakasitendahala kale, kame sa mileme ni makaa oo mane amiyandise ni ku mitwala mu tindoo no milapelo ni mu titolongo mane niku mitwala balubala no ambumu mane na busisi mulibaka no litina lyange. <verse eid="LUK 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13"/>Eyo kame saimiiyele nji mube oupaki wange. <verse eid="LUK 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14"/>Mukukete mu micima yenu nji mulese kubilaele eyo samwambe. <verse eid="LUK 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15"/>Kakuli kame sanimibe eyi no kwamba mane ni kushangama nji kakwisa kwawo amitimbile satwese oku kanana naanyi. <verse eid="LUK 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16"/>Kame samubetekiwe simba kwa shemyenu, kwabeenu, asi mukowa wenu mane na likani enu mi anjili kwaanyi kame saibaiwe. <verse eid="LUK 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17"/>Aanu onje kame samitimbe mulibaka no litina lyange. <verse eid="LUK 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18"/>Kono kakwisa simba oluuki naku mutwi wenu salu sinyehe. <verse eid="LUK 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19"/>Mukukoongota kwenu mbamu kawana okuyoyisiwa.<verse eid="LUK 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Yoamba oku Sinyiha kwa Jelusalema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Mateu24.15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Maleka13.14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20"/>“Kono abasa mumone nji Jelusalema kame atingulukilwe ku masole mulimuke nji oku sinyeha kwaye kame kuli beebi. <verse eid="LUK 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21"/>Cwale awo ali mu Judeya ashotokele ku malundu, mi awo ali mukaci no mulenen̄i atundemo, mi awo ali kundee no naha alese kwingena kame. <verse eid="LUK 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22"/>Kakuli aa amaywaa no mayando, okwiyateteta eyo yonje ina kun̄oliwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23"/>Oumai kwawo saikale naana mane nawo sayamwisa mu maywaa awo! Kakuli outata unene kame sawikaleko mu litunga mi okutweba kame sakwikale kwanuu aa. <verse eid="LUK 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24"/>Anjili mbaibaiwa ni kutweba no mukwale mi kame sa komiwe ni kutwaliwa mukaci no asimacaba onje mi Jelusalema kame sa lyatangiwe okubitela abo enako no asimacaba aba saiyatetetwe.<verse eid="LUK 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okwiiya kwa Mwana no munu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mateu24.29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Maleka13.24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25"/>“Cwale kame sakwikale esisupo ba liywaa ni kweti ni titungweti, mi ba litunga etinaha kame sati cile ni milumo no mawate ni mandinda. <verse eid="LUK 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26"/>Alume kame sa welele mukucila mukumona eyo ikeyile ba litunga, kakuli amaata no liwilu kame sa nyanganyisiwe. <verse eid="LUK 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27"/>Cwale kame sa mone Omwana no munu yokeyile mu likumbi ni maata ni kanya inene. <verse eid="LUK 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28"/>Cwale einu eyi aba saitangise okutendahala, mwalikete kuwilu mi mwinule emitwi yenu kakuli okuliululwa kwenu sebeli kuli beebi.<verse eid="LUK 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Etuto no sitondo no Feiga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mateu24.32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Maleka13.28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli waambela enguli nji, “Komumone ku esitondo no Feiga ni itondo injili yonje. <verse eid="LUK 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30"/>Aba itangisa okumena amamuna, kame mu mona mwenyene mane ni kulimuka nji embumbi sebeli ili beebi. <verse eid="LUK 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31"/>Cwale naanyi ngeeso aba mumona einu eyi eitendahala, mulimuke nji omubuso wa Nyambe sebeli oli beebi.<verse eid="LUK 21:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32"/>Niti luli kame nimwyambela nji olu lusika kalutamba kubwa konji yonje yatendahala kale. <verse eid="LUK 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33"/>Eliwilu ni litunga mba ibwi kono eliywi lyange kalitamba kubwa.<verse eid="LUK 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Outokwa no Kutatelela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34"/>“Cwale mumamele nji emicima yenu ilese oku kandakandiwa ni mikiti ni kunwa ni tinongosi no litunga kakuli elyo eliywaa kame saaliye mukwa limukiwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35"/>Kakuli kame saaliyele aanu onje awo ayoya ba litunga lyonje. <verse eid="LUK 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36"/>Kono mutone enako yonje memu lapela nji muwane amaata no ka banduka einu eyi saitendahale mane ni kwimana balubala no Mwana no munu.”<verse eid="LUK 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37"/>Cwale Jesu amaywaa onje kame ana kwiyetanga mu Ndoo ya Nyambe, kono ousiku sebeli ota okalangana ba lilundu no itondo no olibe, <verse eid="LUK 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38"/>Amasikusiku onje aanu kame ana kutanga ku Ndoo ya Nyambe oka muteeteta<verse eid="LUK 21:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22"/>
  <para style="s">Omulelo no Kwibaa Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mateu26.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maleka14.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Jowani11.45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1"/>Cwale enako no mukiti no inkwa nambulwa omumena aba ina kusheeteta owo wisaniwa nji Paseka. <verse eid="LUK 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2"/>Cwale akulu no apulisita na n̄oli sebeli asaelanga omo saibaele Jesu kakuli kame ana kucila aanu.<verse eid="LUK 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Judasi abana Kupumena Okubeteka Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mateu26.14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10">Maleka14.10</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:11">11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3"/>Cwale Satani sebeli oingena mwa Judasi woyo oisaniwa nji Isikaliota, woyo ona kutenda omunjili kwawo no kukwana likumi na yiili. <verse eid="LUK 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4"/>Cwale Judasi sebeli ota nu kakwambota na pulisita akulu na endisi omo sa twesete okumubeteka kwa onyene. <verse eid="LUK 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5"/>Mi sebeli awabelelwa nji mane kame atwesa okumuba amali. <verse eid="LUK 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6"/>Cwale Judasi sebeli opumena nji awane ekolo no kumubeteka oku nambulwa aanu no kupula.<verse eid="LUK 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Kutukiseta Okalya Omulalelo no Paseka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mateu26.17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Maleka14.12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Jowani13.21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7"/>Cwale eliywaa no mukiti no lin̄ende nambulwa omumena abo cwale omukoko no sitabelo aba sina kufanena okutendahala. <verse eid="LUK 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli otuma Pitolosi ni Jowani ni kwamba nji, “Mute mi mukalukise esibaka oko satukalyele omulalelo no Paseka. <verse eid="LUK 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9"/>Sebeli aamba kwa yonyene nji, “Cwale kubine satu kakulukisete?” <verse eid="LUK 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10"/>Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Komumone, aba sa mwingene mu mulenen̄i mbamu kuwana ni mulume woyo oshimbile ekomoki no meyi mi mumukon̄e mu ndoo eyo sakaingene, <verse eid="LUK 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11"/>cwale mwambele omunya ndoo nji, ‘Omwiyeti kame aamba kwa wene nji, kubine oko kuli omusiyo no angenda oko sa nilyele epaseka na iyetwa ange?’ <verse eid="LUK 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12"/>Cwale mbami monise omusiyo munene na kuwilu ona wabisiwa wino oko cwale mukalukise einu yonje.”<verse eid="LUK 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13"/>Cwale sebeli aata nukawana kanyi omo ana ambelele Jesu, mi sebeli alukisa eilya no paseka.<verse eid="LUK 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Omulalelo wa Mbumu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mateu26.26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Maleka14.22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Makolinte11.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14"/>Cwale enako aba ina kukwana sebeli oikala ku tafuke na tumiwa aye. <verse eid="LUK 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15"/>Cwale sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Kame niwabelelwe onene okulya epaseka eyi naanyi abo me kani siyanda kale. <verse eid="LUK 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16"/>Kakuli kame nimyambela nji sitamba kuulya kame konji aba saiiyatetetwe mu muboso wa Nyambe.”<verse eid="LUK 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli oshimba ekomoki, mi aba ana kumana oukutumela sebeli wamba nji, “Mushimbe esi mi mu kutabele mukaci kenu, <verse eid="LUK 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18"/>kakuli kame nimyambela nji okutunda balelo sitamba kunwa embuya no waine konji omubuso wa Nyambe aba sa ukeyele.” <verse eid="LUK 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli oshimba esinkwa mi abana mana oukutumela sebeli osipatola ni kusiba kwa onyene mane ni kwamba nji, “Olu ni lutu lwange luna biwi kwaanyi. Mutende esi memu ni puluka.” <verse eid="LUK 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20"/>Mi kame mundila imweya sebeli waba ekomoki munyima no mulalelo ni kwamba nji, “Eyi ekomoki no unyinga wange ina itelelwe aanyi ni ulikani no ubya. <verse eid="LUK 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21"/>Kono komumone elyoko lya woyo oni beteka kame lili ni mene ba tafule. <verse eid="LUK 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22"/>Kakuli Omwana no munu kame ata kanyi omo kun̄olelwe, kono oumai niwa woyo omubeteka. <verse eid="LUK 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23"/>Cwale sebeli atangisa okwibanguta mukaci koo nji anyine mukaci ketu woyo ofanena okutenda eyi.<verse eid="LUK 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Etin̄ananyi nji Woyo no Kuneneba Anyine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24"/>Etin̄ananyi sebeli tiinguka mukaci koo nji omunene nanyine.<verse eid="LUK 22:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25"/>Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Ambumu no asimacaba kame akubabaza nji kame akwite amaata mukaci koo, mi abusisi kame aku babaza nji alikani no aanu.’ <verse eid="LUK 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26"/>Kono kasangeeso kwaanyi, cwale aanyi mulesele awo no kuneneba mukaci kenu atende kanyi anyonyo, mane omwendisi kanyi woyo wasebeleza. <verse eid="LUK 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27"/>Cwale omunene naanyine woyo oikalile ba tafule simba nji woyo wabelekela? Kana kasa nji woyo oikalile ba tafule, kono kame nili naanyi kanyi woyo omi belekela. <verse eid="LUK 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28"/>“Anyi kame muli awo ana kwikala nange mu miliko yange, <verse eid="LUK 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29"/>mi cwale kame ni mituma kanyi sitange omo ana ku nitumena mu litunga. <verse eid="LUK 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30"/>Kame sa mulye mane ni kunwa ba tafule mu mubuso wange, mane ni kwikala ba lubona lwange okwatula amasika likumi na yiili no Isilaele.<verse eid="LUK 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aba Namba Eyi no Kukana kwa Pitolosi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mateu26.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maleka14.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Jowani13.36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31"/>“Simoni, Simon! Komone! Satani nai saele nji amyuuluse kanyi uloto. <verse eid="LUK 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32"/>Kono kame nina milapelele nji etumelo yenu ilese kubwa. Mi cwale abasa mwiye kwa mene mongote abeenu.<verse eid="LUK 22:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33"/>Cwale Pitolosi sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Mbumu, kame nikutukisite okuta nowe mu tolongo mane ni ku lifu. <verse eid="LUK 22:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba nji, “Kame ni kwambela Pitolosi nji omukombwe kautamba kukuwa balelo lino mbu nikana twaatu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Esipusu, Esipaupau, ni Mukwale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, Cwale aba nina kumituma oku nambulwa esikwama simba esipaupau simba etinjatangwa siikene muna kuulwa?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">Seli amba nji “Kakwisa.”<verse eid="LUK 22:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Woyo okwite esipusu asishimbe mane ngeeso ni woyo okwite esipaupau ashimbe mi woyo wakwite omukwale aulise esikumango saye aule mumweya. <verse eid="LUK 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37"/>Kakuli kame nimyambela nji elin̄olo eli kame lifanena okwiiyatetetwa mwa mene elyo lyamba nji, ‘Kame ana balelwe kwiisinyi, Kakuli eyange eyo ina n̄oliwa sebeli ikwiyateteta.”<verse eid="LUK 22:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38"/>Cwale sebeli aamba nji, “Omone! Mbumu, ino emikwale yiili!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">Cwale sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Naku kwana!”<verse eid="LUK 22:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Lapela ba Lilundu no Itondo no Olibe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mateu26.36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Maleka14.32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli otunda, ni kuta kanyi omo kuna kutendela nji omukwa waye, ku lilundu no itondo no Olibe, aiyetwa aye sebeli amukon̄a <verse eid="LUK 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40"/>Cwale aba ana kukeela ba sibaka Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Mulapele nji cwale mulese okwingena mu miliko.”<verse eid="LUK 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41"/>Cwale sebeli osheeta okutunda kwa onyene esibaka sikwana ba myeendo no liwee aba likondiwa ni kukubama banji ni manwi sebeli olapela nji, <verse eid="LUK 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42"/>“Sitange,” nji kame osinga, otundise esinweno esi kwa mene, kulese okutendiwa eso sisingwa kwa mene, kono eso sisingwa kwa wene.” <verse eid="LUK 22:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43"/>Cwale elingeloi sebeli liiya okutunda ku wilu mukumoongota. <verse eid="LUK 22:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44"/>Cwale yoli mu n̄alelwa no kuneneba sebeli otwalelela okulapela onene, mane esitukutuku saye sebeli sitenda kanyi ounyinga wooyela banji.<verse eid="LUK 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45"/>Cwale aba ana kumana okulapela, sebeli oiya kwa iyetwa aye nu kawana alanganine mulibaka no kweena. <verse eid="LUK 22:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46"/>Cwale sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Iikene aba mulanganine? Mwinguke mulapele nji mulese okwingena mu miliko.”<verse eid="LUK 22:46"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okunungiwa kwa Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mateu26.47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maleka14.43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Jowani18.3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47"/>Abo yo silemine okwamba sebeli kwiiya enyangela no aanu ni mulume oisaniwa nji Judasi mumweya nwawo no kukwana likumi na yiili, yoatwaletete. Cwale sebeli osheeteta abeebi kwa Jesu ni kumutubeta. <verse eid="LUK 22:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48"/>Kono Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Judasi iikene aba obeteka Omwana no munu okumutubeta?”<verse eid="LUK 22:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49"/>Cwale awo ana kwikala naye aba ana kumona eyo ina kutendahala, sebeli amba nji, “Mbumu tulwe ni mikwale yetu?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50"/>Cwale omunjili mwa onyene sebeli oyaa omubika no mupulisita omukulu niku mupatula elitwi lyaye no silyo.<verse eid="LUK 22:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51"/>Kono Jesu sebeli wamba nji, “Kulese kame okutendahala ngeesi! Cwale sebeli olema elitwi lyaye ni ku mubalisa.<verse eid="LUK 22:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba kwa pulisita akulu na endisi no ndoo ya Nyambe na kulu awo ana kwiiya muku mulwisa nji, “Kame muneeyi kanyi kame mulwisa ombuyi ni mikwale mane ni milamu? <verse eid="LUK 22:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53"/>Kono aba nina kwikalanga naanyi amaywaa onje mu Ndoo ya Nyambe, kamu si kunilemanga. Kono ino enako yenu, ni maata no woyo no osiuwi.<verse eid="LUK 22:53"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pitolosi yo Kana Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Mateu26.57-58</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">26.69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Maleka14.53-54</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">14.66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Jowani18.12-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">18.25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54"/>Cwale sebeli anunga Jesu ni kumutwala mu ndoo no mupulisita omukulu. Pitolosi yo mukon̄a munyima abano kuleba. <verse eid="LUK 22:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55"/>Cwale abana mana okutumbula omulilo mu lilapa no kuta ni kwikala banji bamweya, Pititolosi sebeli oikala mukaci koo. <verse eid="LUK 22:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56"/>Cwale omubeleki no mukati aba ana kumona yo ikalile mu liseli, sebeli omwaliketa ni kwamba nji, “Wuyu mulume ni yonyene mumweya wa Jesu!” <verse eid="LUK 22:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57"/>Kono sebeli okana ni kwamba nji, “Wene wo mukati, mene si muyii!”<verse eid="LUK 22:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58"/>Aba kuna kubita enako icana omunu munjili sebeli omumona ni kwamba nji, “Ni wene kame oli mumweya wa onyene!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:58">Kono Pitolosi sebeli wamba nji, “Wene we mulume, kasa mene!”<verse eid="LUK 22:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59"/>Aba kuna kubita enakao icana omunji kame sebeli oongoteta okwamba nji, “Ni yonyene wuyu mulume mumweya waye, kakuli ni yonyene, Mugalileya!” <verse eid="LUK 22:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60"/>Kono Pitolosi sebeli wamba nji, “Wene we mulume, siyii eso wamba!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:60">Cwale ababo yo samba omukombwe sebeli okuwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli okusetuka ni kwaliketa Pitolosi, cwale Pitolosi sebeli opuluka amaywi ana kwamba Jesu kwa yonyene nji, “Omukombe owakasikuwa kale balelo mbuni kana twaatu.” <verse eid="LUK 22:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62"/>Cwale sebeli ota kundee nu kalila onene.<verse eid="LUK 22:62"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Shubaulwa ni Kufuliwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Mateu26.67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Maleka14.65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63"/>Cwale alume awo ana kulema Jesu sebeli amuyandisa mane ni kumufula. <verse eid="LUK 22:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64"/>Cwale sebeli amununga ku miyo ni ku mwibanguta nji, “Onuhe! anyine ona kufulu?” <verse eid="LUK 22:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65"/>Cwale sebeli aamba amaywi anjili no kupula no kashwau kwa yonyene oku munyefula.<verse eid="LUK 22:65"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Litiwa balubala no Kuta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mateu26.59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Maleka14.55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Jowani18.19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66"/>Cwale eliywaa aba lina kukeela omukopano no akulu no apulisita na n̄oli sebeli akuwana bamweya. cwale sebeli atwala Jesu ba kuta yoo ni kwamba nji, <verse eid="LUK 22:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67"/>“Nji ya wene Kilesite, otwambele?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">Kono Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Nji ni myambele, kamutamba kupumena, <verse eid="LUK 22:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68"/>cwale nji ni mibangute ka mutamba ku ni tambula. <verse eid="LUK 22:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69"/>Kono okutunda bano Omwana no munu kame saikale ku lyoko no silyo no maata a Nyambe.”<verse eid="LUK 22:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70"/>Cwale onje sebeli aamba nji, “Ya wene cwale Omwana Nyambe? Mi Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Na mwamba ya mene.”<verse eid="LUK 22:70"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71"/>Cwale sebeli aamba nji, “Ka upaki tusi saela kame! Natu kuyupele twenyene okutunda mu kanwa kaye!”<verse eid="LUK 22:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23"/>
  <para style="s">Jesu Yoli Balubala lwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mateu27.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:1-14">27.1-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Maleka15.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Jowani18.28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1"/>Cwale esikwata sonje sebeli siimana ni kutwala Jesu kwa Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2"/>Cwale sebeli atateka oku mukandimeka aamba nji, “Kame tuna wana wuyu mulume yo yaulula aanu ni kutukanisa nji tulese okuba omutelo kwa Sesale mane ni kwamba nji yonyene yokame Kilesite Ombumu.”<verse eid="LUK 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3"/>Cwale Pilalto sebeli omwibanguta nji, “Kana ya wene Ombumu no Majuda? Cwale Jesu sebeli otambula nji, “Nwaamba.”<verse eid="LUK 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4"/>Cwale Pilato sebeli wamba kwa Pulisita akulu naanu no kupula nji, “Kanisiwana omubonda mwa wuyu omulume.” <verse eid="LUK 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5"/>Kono sebeli aongoteta okwamba nji, “Kame afilikanya aanau yo iyeta mu Judeya monje, okutunda mu Galileya mane ni kukeela kuno ku sibaka.”<verse eid="LUK 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Tumenwa kwa Heloda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6"/>Cwale Pilato aba ana kuyupa eyi, sebeli oibanguta nji, “Wuyu mulume neli Mugalileya?” <verse eid="LUK 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7"/>Cwale abana kuyupa nji Jesu kame atunda mu mubuso wa Heloda, sebeli omutumena kwa Heloda ona kwikalanga mu Jelusalema ba nako eyo. <verse eid="LUK 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8"/>Cwale Heloda aba ana kumona Jesu sebeli owabelelwa onene kakuli kame ana kushukelanga onenene oku mumona, kakuli na kuyupa eyaye mi kame ana kusepa nji atende emakazo injili. <verse eid="LUK 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9"/>Cwale Heloda sebeli oibanguta Jesu etipuzo no kupula, kono yonyene kasi kutambula. <verse eid="LUK 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10"/>Akulu no apulisita na n̄oli sebeli aimana balubala lwa Jesu niku mukandimeka. <verse eid="LUK 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11"/>Heloda ni maslole aye sebeli ayandisa Jesu ni ku mushubaula mane ni kumufuka olwambi no kubenya ni kumuusa kwa Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12"/>Okutunda ba liywaa elyo Heloda ni Pilato sebeli akulema oulikani, naba ano kutimbanga onene kunyima.<verse eid="LUK 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Atulelwa Elifu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mateu27.15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Maleka15.6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39">Jowani18.39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:16">19.16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13"/>Pilato cwale sebeli oisana bamweya apulisita akulu na busisi naanu, <verse eid="LUK 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14"/>ni kwamba kwa onyene nji, “Kame muna liti wuyu mulume ni kwamba nji kame ayembulula aanu. Cwale aba nina mwibanguta balubala lwenu esawana omubonda mu yaambo yenu mumu kandimeka. <verse eid="LUK 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15"/>Simba Heloda ni yonyene namono ngeeso, sana muusete kwaaci. Komumone, kakwisa omubonda ana tende owo ofanena elifu. <verse eid="LUK 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16"/>Cwale kame sa ni mufule ni ku mu lukuluka.” <verse eid="LUK 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17"/>Kakuli Pilato na kufanena okwa lukulwela omunjili ba nako no mukiti.<verse eid="LUK 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18"/>Kono onje sebeli akuwa nji, Aibaiwe! Otulukulwele Banabasi!” <verse eid="LUK 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19"/>(Omulume ona kubeekiwa mu tolongo mulibaka no mifilifili ana kwingula mu mulenen̄i ni kwibaa.)<verse eid="LUK 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20"/>Pilato sebeli wamba noo kame, mukusinga nji alukulule Jesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21"/>Kono sebeli akuweleza onene nji, “Angongoteliwe! Angongoteliwe!”<verse eid="LUK 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22"/>Sebeli kame wamba noo aka no waatu nji, “Iikene, eso no kwiiba ana tende? siikene esiyi eso ana tende? Mene kakwisa omubonda nina wana mwa yonyene owo ofanena elifu, kame sani mufule ni ku mulukulula.”<verse eid="LUK 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23"/>Kono onje sebeli amba mu kukuweleza nji angongoteliwe, mi okusinga koo sebeli kwiyatetetwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24"/>Cwale Pilato sebeli watula nji kutendiwe omo mu singela. <verse eid="LUK 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25"/>Cwale sebeli olukuluka omulume ona kubekiwa mu tolongo mulibaka no mifilifili ni kwibaa, woyo ana kukumbela, kono sebeli waaba Jesu mukusinga koo.<verse eid="LUK 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Ngongotelwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mateu27.32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maleka15.21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Jowani19.17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26"/>Cwale aka mutwalile sebeli alema Simoni na ku Sillene, woyo ona kwiiya okutunda ku naha indina. Sebeli amushimbisa esifapano munyima ya Jesu.<verse eid="LUK 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27"/>Aanu no kupula sebeli amukon̄anga munyima na akati alila nukufula ba saali mulibaka lyaye. <verse eid="LUK 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28"/>Kono Jesu sebeli okutemuna ni kwamba kwa onyene nji, “Aana no akati no Jelusalema, mulese ku lila mene, kono mukulile mwenyene naanenu. <verse eid="LUK 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29"/>Kakuli komumone amaywaa akeyile abo aanu saambe nji, ‘Embuyoti yawo akati no kwaleye, ni mapumo awo nokwa kushimba mane ni maele awo no kwayamwisa!’ <verse eid="LUK 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30"/>Cwale kame satateke okwamba ku malundu nji, ‘Mutukwele beulu!’ mane ni ku tulundu tucana nji, ‘Mutufuke!’ <verse eid="LUK 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31"/>Kakuli nji atende eyi abo eitondo esili eyi no kuyuba, ngasibine saku tendahale aba saikukute?”<verse eid="LUK 23:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32"/>Eikebenga yiili no alume sebeli aishimba bamweya naye nji akaibae ni Jesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33"/>Cwale abana kukeela ba sibaka siisaniwa nji Katendele ababo sebeli amungongotela bamweya ni ikebenga yiili. Mi esikebenga esinjili ku lineku no silyo esinjili ku simoo. <verse eid="LUK 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba nji, Sitange, waa lemene, kakuli kayii eso atenda.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:34">Cwale sebeli akutabela eibyana yaye mu kushebuluka. <verse eid="LUK 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35"/>Cwale aanu sebeli aimana aalikete. Kono abusisi sebeli anyefula Jesu ni kwamba nji, “Kame ana ku yoyisanga aanu cwale akuyoyise yonyene nji ya Kilesite wa Nyambe, woyo ana kuketa!”<verse eid="LUK 23:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36"/>Amasole nonyene sebeli amuyandisa ni kwiiya kwa yonyene ni kumuba ebeine, <verse eid="LUK 23:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37"/>ni kwamba nji, “Nji yawene Ombumu no Majuda okuyoyise wenyene!”<verse eid="LUK 23:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38"/>Mi beulu yaye kame kuna kun̄oliwa elin̄olo nji, “Wuyu ya Mbumu no Majuda,”<verse eid="LUK 23:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39"/>Esinjili no sikebanga eso sina kungongoteliwa ni Jesu sebeli saamba nji, “Kawene Kilesite? Okuyoyise mane naaci otuyoyise!”<verse eid="LUK 23:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40"/>Kono esinjili sebeli simukalimela ni kwamba nji, “Kucili Nyambe, kakuli wene kame oli mu katulo imweya no kufanena okufa. <verse eid="LUK 23:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41"/>Cwale kame tufanena kakuli kame tutambula omupuzo no eyi tunatende, kono wuyu mulume kasitenda esi no kwiiba.” <verse eid="LUK 23:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42"/>Cwale sebeli wamba nji, “Jesu oka nipuluke abo so kaingene mu mubuso wowe!”<verse eid="LUK 23:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43"/>Jesu sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Niti luli kame ni kwambela nji balelo kame so kaikale ni mene mu Paladaisi.”<verse eid="LUK 23:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">Elifu lya Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mateu27.45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maleka15.33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Jowani19.28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44"/>Kame ina ku kwana enako no munji mi ouwi sebeli ufuka enaha yonje mane konji okakeela ba hola no utanu ni tunee (9) <verse eid="LUK 23:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45"/>mi eliywaa sebeli liilola, cwale olwambi luna ku tulekiwangwa mu keleke sebeli lukauka bakaci.<verse eid="LUK 23:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46"/>Cwale Jesu abana mana okulila ni mulumo munene sebeli wamba nji, “Tate mu maoko owe mwa nibeeka emebo yange!” Cwale abana mana okwamba eyo, sebeli ooyela aka no mamaneneno.<verse eid="LUK 23:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47"/>Cwale omutateleli abana kumona eso sina tendahala sebeli oyeema Nyambe ni kwamba nji, “Niti luli wuyu mulume muwa kakwite omubonda!”<verse eid="LUK 23:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48"/>Cwale oundi ona kuungana ba sibaka aba ona kumona eso sina kutendahala, cwale sebeli auka ku mindi alemine ba yaali aenine onene. <verse eid="LUK 23:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49"/>Cwale onje awo ana kulimukanga Jesu nakati ana kumukon̄a okutunda ku Galileya sebeli aimana oku no kuleba alikete einu eyi.<verse eid="LUK 23:49"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okupumbekwa kwa Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mateu27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maleka15.42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Jowani19.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50"/>Cwale kame kuna kwikalanga omulume no litina lya Josefa na ku Alimateya etolopo no Mujuda. Neli omunjili no manduna no Kuta, omulume no kuluka ni uwaa, <verse eid="LUK 23:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51"/>woyo kasi kutenda esi no kwiiba, kono kame ana kusaelanga omubuso wa Nyambe. <verse eid="LUK 23:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52"/>Woyo mulume sebeli ota kwa Pilato nuka kumbela olutu lwa Jesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53"/>Cwale sebeli oshimba olutu lwa Jesu ni ku lupungela mu lwambi no likena ni kumubeeka mu liyumbelo omo kaku sikupumbekiwamo kale omunu. <verse eid="LUK 23:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54"/>Mi neli eliywaa no ukutukiseta omukiti no Pumulo nji otateke. <verse eid="LUK 23:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55"/>Akati ana kumukon̄a Jesu okutunda ku Galileya sebeli amona eliyumbelo omo ana kulangeka Jesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56"/>Cwale sebeli auka okalukisa emitondo ni maati no kumuwaa ba lutu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:56">Ba liywaa no Pumulo sebeli apumula okukumanena ni mulawo.<verse eid="LUK 23:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24"/>
  <para style="s">Okwinguka kwaafu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Mateu28.1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Maleka16.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Jowani20.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1"/>Kono cwale ba liywaa no matatekelo no sunda amasikusiku akati sebeli ata ku liyumbelo, okutwala emitondo ana kuula. <verse eid="LUK 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2"/>Cwale sebeli akawana eliwee nali tundisiwa ba liyumbelo, <verse eid="LUK 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3"/>kono aba ana kwingena mu liyumbelo kasi kuwana olutu lwaye. <verse eid="LUK 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4"/>Asikomokile eyo sebeli amona alume ayiili aimanine aku mangile eikumango no kumyamyata. <verse eid="LUK 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5"/>Cwale asikomokike ni kwinamena etimala banji, alume sebeli amba kwa onyene nji, “Iikene aba musaela wuyu no kuyoya kwaafu?<verse eid="LUK 24:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6"/>Kamupuluke eyo ana kumyambela Jesu yosili mu Galileya. <verse eid="LUK 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7"/>‘Nji Omwana no munu kame sabeekiwe mu maoko no aanu asikutenda esibi, mane angongoteliwe, mi liywaa no waatu ainguke.’”<verse eid="LUK 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8"/>Cwale akati awo sebeli apuluka amaywi aye, <verse eid="LUK 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9"/>mi aba ana kuuka okutunda ku liyumbelo sebeli ambela ano kukwana likumi ni mumweya ni kwaanu onje eyo ina tendahala. <verse eid="LUK 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10"/>Cwale neli Maliya Magdalena ni Jo-anna ni Maliya inawaye Jakobo na njili akati sebeli aamba eyi kwa tumiwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11"/>Kono amaywi aa kame ana kumonahala kwa onyene nji matangu mi kasi kwapumena. <verse eid="LUK 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12"/>Kono Pitolosi sebeli oimana ni kwitukela ku liyumbelo aka nangelamo, kono sebeli okawana feela olwambi ana kupungeliwamo mi Jesu kasamo. Sebeli ouka yo komokile esi sina tendahala.<verse eid="LUK 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Omwendo no Kuta ku Imause</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12">Maleka16.12</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 16:13">13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13"/>Ba liywaa elyo ayiili kwawo ana ku kon̄anga Jesu sebeli ata ku mundi wisaniwa nji Emausi ibima ikwana itanu ni yiili okutunda ku Jelusalema, <verse eid="LUK 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14"/>alemine okwambota kwiinu yonje eyo ina tendahala. <verse eid="LUK 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15"/>Alemine okwamba nu kwambota bamweya, Jesu ni yonyene sebeli osheeteta ni kuta noo. <verse eid="LUK 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16"/>Kono amiyo oo sebeli akwangwwa oku mulimuka, <verse eid="LUK 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17"/>Jesu sebeli wamba nji, “Iikene mukwambota me mweenda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:17">Cwale sebeli aimana ni kumonahala okweena. <verse eid="LUK 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18"/>Cwale omunjili mukaci koo, osilitina lya Kileopasi sebeli otambula Jesu nji, “Wene wemboci feela ongenda nokwalimuka eyo ina tendahala mu Jelusalema mu maywaa ano?”<verse eid="LUK 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19"/>Jeau sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">“Iikene einu eyo? mi sebeli aamba nji, “Okukumanena neyi ya Jesu no Nazaleta,” woyo ona kutendanga omunuhi wa Nyambe mu musebezi ni liywii balubala wa Nyambe naanu onje.<verse eid="LUK 24:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20"/>Omo apulisita etu no akulu na busisi omo ana kumutwalela nji aibaiwe ni kungongoteliwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21"/>Kono kame tuna kusepa nji yoso yoyisa Isilaele! Ee, mi komone munyima no eyi, sebeli maywaa aatu okutunda abo ina kutendahalela eyi. <verse eid="LUK 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22"/>Cwale akati no sikwata setu nakutu komokisa, kakuli kame ana kwikala ku liyumbelo amasiku-siku. <verse eid="LUK 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23"/>Kono kasi kuwana olutu lwaye, cwale sebeli auka aamba nji kono kame ana kumona epono no mangeloi awo ana kwamba nji kame ayoya. <verse eid="LUK 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24"/>Mu sikwata setu anjili sebeli ata ku liyumbelo nu kawana kanyi eso ana kwamba akati, kono yonyene kasi kumumona.”<verse eid="LUK 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Anyi alume no aelo no micima no kwapumena wangu yonje eyo ana kwamba anuhi a Nyambe! <verse eid="LUK 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26"/>Kana kasi kulukela nji Kilesite ayandele einu ni kwingena mu kanya yaye?” <verse eid="LUK 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27"/>Cwale okutateka kwa Mushe nanuhi onje a Nyambe na kwatolokela mu man̄olo onje okukumanena ni Jesu.<verse eid="LUK 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28"/>Cwale aba ana kusheeteta abeebi ni mundi ana kuta, Jesu sebeli omonahala yoli balubala loo, <verse eid="LUK 24:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29"/>kono sebeli amuusa ni kwamba nji, “oikale naaci kakuli sebeli mangolwaa mi eliywaa lyaika kale.” Cwale sebeli ota okaikala noo. <verse eid="LUK 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30"/>Cwale yoli noo ba tafule sebeli oshimba esinkwa ni kusifuyola ni kusipatoola mane ni kwaaba. <verse eid="LUK 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31"/>Cwale amiyo oo sebeli atona ni kumulimuka nji ya Jesu, kono sebeli opicuka mukaci koo. <verse eid="LUK 24:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32"/>Cwale sebeli akwambota mukaci koo nji, “Kandi ngasibine emicima yetu kai simatuka aba ana mbanga naaci mu ndila, abo mane yo tubalela aman̄olo?”<verse eid="LUK 24:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33"/>Cwale sebeli aimana mu nako eyeyo ni kuuka ku Jelusalema, nukawana ano kukwana likumi ni mumweya aunganine bamweya nawo ana kwikalanga noo, <verse eid="LUK 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34"/>ona kwamba nji, “Ombumu nainguka luli mi namonahala kwa Simoni!”<verse eid="LUK 24:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35"/>Cwale sebeli aamba eyo ina tendahala mu ndila, mane nomo ana kumu limukela ba kupatoola esinkwa.<verse eid="LUK 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Kumonahaza kwa Iyetwa aye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mateu28.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maleka16.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Jowani20.19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Tikezo1.6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36"/>Asilemine okwamba eyi, Jesu yonyene sebeli oimana mukaci koo.<verse eid="LUK 24:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37"/>Sebeli acila onene oku yambuta nji mwendi silumba ana mono. <verse eid="LUK 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38"/>Sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Iikene eyo mukukataleza mane nuukwibanguta etipuzo mu micima yenu.? <verse eid="LUK 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39"/>Komumone amaoko ni makondo nji yamene, komuni leme kakuli esilumba kasikwite olutu simba eifuba kakuli mene mumwine nji nikwite.”<verse eid="LUK 24:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40"/>Kame ana kwamba eyi ni kwamonisa amakaa aye ni makondo aye. <verse eid="LUK 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41"/>Asiulwile okupumena, mulibaka no ku wabelelwa, ni kukomoka, sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Mukwite esi no kulya?” <verse eid="LUK 24:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42"/>Sebeli amuba eseemba no ndi no kukon̄ela, <verse eid="LUK 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43"/>mi sebeli oshimba ni kulya balubala woo amwine.<verse eid="LUK 24:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44"/>Cwale sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Aa amaywi ange awo nina kwamba kwaanyi meni sili nenu nji yonje eyo in̄olilwe mu mulawo wa Mushe nanuhi a Nyambe ni mu lisamu iiyatetetwe.”<verse eid="LUK 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli oyatulula etingana too nji ayupisise aman̄olo, <verse eid="LUK 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46"/>cwale sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Esi sokame sin̄olilwe nji Kilesite afanene okuyanda nji eli no waatu ainguke kwaafu, <verse eid="LUK 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47"/>mi nji okubaka ni kulemeniwa eibi iyitiwe mu litina lyaye mu tinaha tonje okutateka mu Julusalema. <verse eid="LUK 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48"/>Aanyi muli apaki no inu eyi. <verse eid="LUK 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49"/>Cwale komumone, kame nituma esepiso ya sitange kwaanyi, kono mwikale mu mulenen̄i okutwala abo samu katambulele amaata atunda ku wilu.<verse eid="LUK 24:49"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Shimbelwa Kuwilu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Maleka16.19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Tikezo1.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli washimba ni kuta ku Betaniya, cwale sebeli oimeka amakaa aye ni kwa fuyola. <verse eid="LUK 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51"/>Ababo yo lemine okwa fuyola sebeli waasiya ni ku shimbelwa kuwilu. <verse eid="LUK 24:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52"/>Cwale sebeli auka ku Jelusalema awabelelwe onene, <verse eid="LUK 24:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53"/>cwale sebeli atwalelela mu Ndoo ya Nyambe alumbeka Nyambe.<verse eid="LUK 24:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24"/>
</usx>
